Downloaded from CINEFREAK.NET

00:01:02.667 --> 00:01:07.792
<i>♪ Your name... ♪</i>

00:01:07.958 --> 00:01:12.208
<i>♪ Your name... ♪</i>

00:01:12.292 --> 00:01:13.750
<i>♪ One Sun, One Moon ♪</i>

00:01:13.792 --> 00:01:18.625
<i>♪ Your name... ♪</i>

00:01:18.750 --> 00:01:22.833
<i>♪ Your name... ♪</i>

00:01:22.917 --> 00:01:24.500
<i>♪ One Sun, One Moon ♪</i>

00:01:24.542 --> 00:01:29.208
<i>♪ Even today and forever ♪</i>

00:01:29.542 --> 00:01:32.667
<i>♪ He reigns as the Thalaivar ♪</i>

00:01:32.958 --> 00:01:35.333
<i>♪ Hey! One Sun, One Moon ♪</i>

00:01:35.667 --> 00:01:36.458
<i>♪ ...and One! ♪</i>

00:02:28.417 --> 00:02:30.042
[continuous scrapping]

00:02:31.375 --> 00:02:33.583
[suspenseful music]

00:02:35.500 --> 00:02:37.875
Sir, he has approached us
to lodge a complaint against you.

00:02:38.042 --> 00:02:39.208
That's why we brought him to you.

00:02:39.917 --> 00:02:41.250
[suspenseful music continues

00:02:42.292 --> 00:02:42.917
<i>Brother!</i>

00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:45.167
<i>Please spare me.</i>
<i>Dileep brother, please spare me.</i>

00:02:45.208 --> 00:02:46.750
<i>-Please spare me, brother.</i>
<i>-Jinju!</i>

00:02:46.833 --> 00:02:48.500
<i>Please, Dileep, brother, spare me!</i>

00:02:48.583 --> 00:02:50.917
<i>Please spare me this one time.</i>

00:02:51.083 --> 00:02:52.500
<i>Please spare me.</i>

00:02:52.750 --> 00:02:55.583
<i>Please give me more time.</i>
<i>I'll definitely find him.</i>

00:02:55.750 --> 00:02:56.750
<i>Brother, please spare me.</i>

00:02:56.792 --> 00:02:58.792
You promised to find him
in 2 months.

00:02:59.708 --> 00:03:01.917
It's been 3 months since Varman died.

00:03:02.042 --> 00:03:04.417
You haven't found out who killed Varman.

00:03:04.500 --> 00:03:07.792
Also, you haven't found out who stole
the statues from Varman either.

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:09.458
Why should I spare your life?

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:11.542
After all, it's a matter of statutes.
I'll find them.

00:03:12.125 --> 00:03:13.125
After all, statues, you say?

00:03:13.250 --> 00:03:16.125
Hey, they're worth over ₹6,000 crores.

00:03:16.875 --> 00:03:17.833
Sorry, brother!

00:03:17.875 --> 00:03:19.042
Hey, close it up!

00:03:19.083 --> 00:03:21.083
Brother, please don't do it!

00:03:21.125 --> 00:03:23.042
-Brother, please spare me.<i>-Please don't harm my brother.</i>

00:03:23.042 --> 00:03:25.542
-Brother, please don't do it.<i>-Dileep! Dileep! Dileep!</i>

00:03:25.667 --> 00:03:27.583
<i>-Dileep!</i>
-Brother, I'll find it soon.

00:03:28.042 --> 00:03:28.875
Fine, I'll spare you.

00:03:29.208 --> 00:03:32.542
If you can answer the question
I'm 'bout to ask you...

00:03:32.667 --> 00:03:34.375
I'll spare you and your brother.

00:03:34.500 --> 00:03:35.333
Fine, go ahead.

00:03:37.208 --> 00:03:38.208
[puffs out]

00:03:38.292 --> 00:03:39.917
In the past 2 months,

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:42.708
you must've found out something
about the person we're looking for.

00:03:42.792 --> 00:03:43.375
Tell me what that is.

00:03:44.208 --> 00:03:46.542
Give me one piece of information,
and I'll let you live.

00:03:46.833 --> 00:03:49.458
In the past 2 months,
I found out one thing, though.

00:03:49.542 --> 00:03:50.708
What is it? Huh?

00:03:51.458 --> 00:03:52.750
Not just me...

00:03:53.542 --> 00:03:55.083
even you can't trace him.

00:03:56.833 --> 00:03:58.917
I asked you to
find out who's behind all of it.

00:03:59.042 --> 00:04:01.917
However, you discovered
that he cannot be tracked at all.

00:04:02.375 --> 00:04:04.750
-And you took 3 months for it.
-Dileep! Dileep!

00:04:04.833 --> 00:04:06.167
-[stabs]
-[man screams]

00:04:09.917 --> 00:04:11.625
[sinister music]

00:04:18.583 --> 00:04:20.208
<i>Your hair looks fantastic.</i>

00:04:20.417 --> 00:04:22.667
<i>It's been 3 months since</i>
<i>we lost 3 containers filled with statues</i>

00:04:22.708 --> 00:04:25.000
<i>and since Varman's death.</i>

00:04:25.208 --> 00:04:27.583
<i>You promised to find out</i>
<i>everything in 2 months.</i>

00:04:27.667 --> 00:04:29.542
<i>I'm facing a few problems out here.</i>

00:04:29.667 --> 00:04:30.667
<i>I'm very close to finding out everything.</i>

00:04:30.958 --> 00:04:32.792
<i>In another month,</i>
<i>I'll surely find out everything.</i>

00:04:32.833 --> 00:04:36.250
I'm sparing you
because you worked with me for 20 years.

00:04:36.417 --> 00:04:39.083
Like you promised,
if you don't come through in one month...

00:04:39.292 --> 00:04:40.625
...then no one will be able to find you.

00:04:40.750 --> 00:04:42.792
<i>I promise!</i>
<i>I'll definitely find out everything.</i>

00:04:43.083 --> 00:04:44.208
<i>Please give me some time.</i>

00:04:46.042 --> 00:04:47.750
[villainous music]

00:04:53.125 --> 00:04:55.042
-Tell me.<i>-Hey, what is the status?</i>

00:04:55.125 --> 00:04:56.083
I found a lead.

00:04:56.208 --> 00:04:57.917
<i>-Who is it?</i>
-That's irrelevant to you.

00:04:57.958 --> 00:05:01.625
You promised to pass over Varman's business
to us if we find information for you.

00:05:01.750 --> 00:05:03.917
What if you cut us loose
after retrieving the information?

00:05:04.042 --> 00:05:05.208
I believe he has already confessed.

00:05:05.583 --> 00:05:07.333
Hurry up and find out more about him.

00:05:07.875 --> 00:05:09.292
-[gun fires]
-[man groans]

00:05:11.000 --> 00:05:11.792
What happened?

00:05:12.167 --> 00:05:14.542
I retrieved the clue and shot him dead.

00:05:15.917 --> 00:05:16.792
Attaboy!

00:05:17.458 --> 00:05:19.708
Now use that clue to find him.

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:20.833
If you failed to find him...

00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:23.958
...I'll send you where Varman is now.

00:05:24.917 --> 00:05:27.167
[villainous music]

00:05:29.333 --> 00:05:30.333
[music rises, fades]

00:05:41.667 --> 00:05:43.000
[line ringing]

00:05:44.958 --> 00:05:46.667
[automated message tone]

00:05:47.917 --> 00:05:48.917
[continuous honking]

00:05:48.958 --> 00:05:50.250
Mom, the auto has arrived.

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:54.500
[mellow music]

00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:57.833
Swetha, your lunch is ready.

00:05:57.833 --> 00:05:58.625
<i>Okay, mother-in-law.</i>

00:05:59.750 --> 00:06:01.750
Why is he not answering my call?

00:06:01.875 --> 00:06:03.083
How many times should I call him?

00:06:04.958 --> 00:06:06.375
Rithvik, please hurry up.

00:06:07.125 --> 00:06:08.125
Here, hold your bag.

00:06:10.625 --> 00:06:12.917
Swetha, you will go
past the supermarket, correct?

00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:15.375
Ask him to call me.
He isn't answering my calls.

00:06:15.458 --> 00:06:16.833
He must be busy.

00:06:17.583 --> 00:06:19.917
He works as a supermarket supervisor.

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:22.083
How busy could he be
that he can't answer my calls?

00:06:22.250 --> 00:06:24.167
-Fine, go safely.
-Sure, mother-in-law.

00:06:24.458 --> 00:06:26.417
Hey, why are you following
my girl on Instagram?

00:06:26.458 --> 00:06:28.167
She followed me, damn it.
Get lost!

00:06:28.250 --> 00:06:29.208
-[blender whirring]
-[man groaning]

00:06:29.250 --> 00:06:30.708
Hey, let go of me!

00:06:31.542 --> 00:06:32.542
[kicking]

00:06:34.042 --> 00:06:34.875
[punches land]

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:36.542
Hey, he's biting.
Help me out here.

00:06:37.125 --> 00:06:37.625
Hey!

00:06:38.125 --> 00:06:41.042
-Hey, hold on to him.
-Don't let go of him.

00:06:41.417 --> 00:06:42.583
[continuous smacking]

00:06:42.875 --> 00:06:45.667
Hey, don't bite me.
Damn, he's biting me.

00:06:46.625 --> 00:06:47.458
-[whiplash]
-Oh, God!

00:06:48.958 --> 00:06:51.417
[upbeat music]

00:06:52.917 --> 00:06:55.125
[wheeling in]

00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:02.000
[slams shut]

00:07:03.167 --> 00:07:04.167
[slams shut]

00:07:04.667 --> 00:07:07.000
[upbeat music continues]

00:07:08.875 --> 00:07:10.250
I'm certainly going to commit
two murders today.

00:07:13.292 --> 00:07:14.583
Hey, where are the bottles?

00:07:15.917 --> 00:07:18.250
-[upbeat music continues]
-[bottles clinking]

00:07:20.125 --> 00:07:21.875
[clutches, yanks]

00:07:24.625 --> 00:07:27.083
<i>♪ One name to rule the game ♪</i>

00:07:29.667 --> 00:07:32.375
<i>♪ He's got the fire</i>
<i>Got the flame ♪</i>

00:07:34.750 --> 00:07:36.583
-Son, why didn't you bill it?
-Bill?

00:07:37.042 --> 00:07:38.625
Hey, I'm heading to fight!

00:07:38.708 --> 00:07:40.000
I can't GPay you when I'm outraged.

00:07:42.417 --> 00:07:43.542
-[yanks]
-[bottles clink]

00:07:43.625 --> 00:07:45.625
You can take it out
only after you bill it.

00:07:47.458 --> 00:07:49.792
Hey, you don't know how I am.
Don't mess with me.

00:07:49.917 --> 00:07:51.375
Wait, I'll show you my power!

00:07:51.458 --> 00:07:52.458
[bottles clink]

00:07:54.125 --> 00:07:55.083
[light thud]

00:07:55.125 --> 00:07:56.875
Hey, what are you doing?
Remove the basket.

00:07:57.500 --> 00:07:59.333
<i>Hey, you're messing with the wrong person.</i>

00:07:59.458 --> 00:08:01.792
Sheila Madam,
if you sit on the basket, it'll be helpful.

00:08:01.833 --> 00:08:04.292
<i>Those guys have been biting</i>
<i>the hell out of us. Let go of me.</i>

00:08:05.583 --> 00:08:07.042
[m

00:08:09.708 --> 00:08:11.708
Bhaskar, I'm releasing him
because of your reputation.

00:08:11.875 --> 00:08:14.292
If he keeps repeating it,
then it'll be a problem.

00:08:17.083 --> 00:08:18.083
-I ought to!
-Hey!

00:08:18.333 --> 00:08:21.250
Sir, when you see two kids
are fighting on the road...

00:08:21.625 --> 00:08:23.125
...why would you hand them
to the police?

00:08:23.417 --> 00:08:25.750
Sir, he came into the store
and took away bottles.

00:08:25.958 --> 00:08:27.917
Out of rage, if he stabs someone
with those bottles...

00:08:27.958 --> 00:08:29.833
...it would appear
as if we supplied the weapons.

00:08:30.125 --> 00:08:32.917
If the judge questions me in court,
what would I say?

00:08:33.500 --> 00:08:35.958
Court? Judge?

00:08:37.750 --> 00:08:40.958
Mahesh, I believe
he's one of those boomer uncles.

00:08:41.250 --> 00:08:42.750
He seems to be thorough with the law.

00:08:43.167 --> 00:08:45.083
Spare him now.
We'll handle him later.

00:08:45.292 --> 00:08:46.083
Later?

00:08:46.333 --> 00:08:48.458
Hey, Uncle,
what the hell are you going to do later?

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:50.917
It's my ill fate
that I was born into your family.

00:08:51.667 --> 00:08:53.583
[mellow music]

00:08:56.458 --> 00:08:57.958
Rithvik, ready!

00:09:00.167 --> 00:09:00.667
[exploding]

00:09:00.708 --> 00:09:01.542
Yayy!

00:09:02.083 --> 00:09:03.375
[cheering]
Happy Birthday, Mom!

00:09:04.542 --> 00:09:06.333
Rithvik, what's this nonsense?

00:09:07.250 --> 00:09:08.625
Who asked you to do this?

00:09:08.917 --> 00:09:09.917
[sorrowful music]

00:09:10.333 --> 00:09:11.375
I'm asking you a question!

00:09:11.917 --> 00:09:13.583
Mom, it was Grandpa...

00:09:17.333 --> 00:09:19.917
He's a small kid.
You should know better.

00:09:20.583 --> 00:09:22.583
I'm finding it hard to cope as it is.

00:09:22.958 --> 00:09:25.125
Had you thought of it
from my perspective...

00:09:25.417 --> 00:09:26.833
you wouldn't have done this.

00:09:28.583 --> 00:09:29.375
Sorry, dear!

00:09:32.292 --> 00:09:34.792
[sorrowful music continues]

00:09:42.625 --> 00:09:45.458
[sorrowful music continues]

00:09:48.667 --> 00:09:49.917
[light cries with soft snorts]

00:09:50.208 --> 00:09:51.625
He was my son too.

00:09:52.708 --> 00:09:54.125
Even I can't accept his loss.

00:09:56.333 --> 00:09:58.875
But don't forget you have a son to raise.

00:10:01.208 --> 00:10:02.792
Did you think about Rithvik's plight?

00:10:03.333 --> 00:10:05.167
[vocalised sorrowful music]

00:10:05.792 --> 00:10:07.792
Moving on is best for all of us.

00:10:09.125 --> 00:10:14.417
<i>♪ Let those memories linger</i>
<i>In a corner of my heart ♪</i>

00:10:14.917 --> 00:10:17.333
<i>♪ Let it pass into yesterday... ♪</i>

00:10:22.583 --> 00:10:25.708
<i>♪ A dream that wished</i>
<i>The past would return ♪</i>

00:10:25.833 --> 00:10:28.667
<i>♪ A bond I believed would last ♪</i>

00:10:28.750 --> 00:10:33.500
<i>♪ If it fell apart</i>
<i>When I least imagined, let it fade ♪</i>

00:10:33.625 --> 00:10:37.458
<i>♪ Oh... Nothing lasts forever ♪</i>

00:10:37.667 --> 00:10:40.458
<i>♪ What is lost</i>
<i>May not be lost forever ♪</i>

00:10:40.625 --> 00:10:45.458
<i>♪ Let time be the witness</i>
<i>To what is true ♪</i>

00:10:46.417 --> 00:10:52.208
<i>♪ What we nurtured…</i>
<i>Even that had to wither ♪</i>

00:10:52.458 --> 00:10:54.958
<i>♪ Only when we try to forget… ♪</i>

00:10:55.042 --> 00:10:57.750
<i>♪ Every wound will heal with time ♪</i>

00:10:57.750 --> 00:10:59.042
What exactly happened to my father?

00:10:59.083 --> 00:11:04.125
<i>♪ Don’t cry for what has passed ♪</i>

00:11:04.333 --> 00:11:06.708
<i>♪ Cherish what you still have ♪</i>

00:11:06.750 --> 00:11:08.125
<i>♪ It, too, shall pass ♪</i>

00:11:08.208 --> 00:11:09.750
<i>♪ What belonged to yesterday… ♪</i>

00:11:09.833 --> 00:11:13.125
<i>♪ Let it pass into yesterday,</i>
<i>Just as yesterday passed ♪</i>

00:11:14.250 --> 00:11:19.750
<i>♪ Let those memories linger</i>
<i>In a corner of my heart ♪</i>

