<i>♪ What belonged to yesterday… ♪</i>

00:11:45.458 --> 00:11:49.333
<i>♪ Let it pass into yesterday,</i>
<i>Just as yesterday passed ♪</i>

00:11:49.750 --> 00:11:55.292
<i>♪ Let those memories linger</i>
<i>In a corner of my heart ♪</i>

