<i>♪ What belonged to yesterday… ♪</i>

00:11:57.250 --> 00:12:00.208
<i>♪ Let it pass into yesterday,</i>
<i>Just as yesterday passed ♪</i>

00:12:01.333 --> 00:12:06.917
<i>♪ Let those memories linger</i>
<i>In a corner of my heart ♪</i>

00:12:07.292 --> 00:12:09.542
<i>♪ Let it pass into yesterday... ♪</i>

00:12:16.750 --> 00:12:18.375
[water gushing]

00:12:18.833 --> 00:12:20.417
-[water recedes]
-[phone ringing]

00:12:21.208 --> 00:12:21.917
What is it, Vijaya?

00:12:22.000 --> 00:12:26.208
The water in the pipes
seems to be mixed with mud.

00:12:26.500 --> 00:12:28.125
The water is brown in color.

00:12:28.542 --> 00:12:31.000
For now,
I bought a water can for cooking.

00:12:31.208 --> 00:12:32.500
Could you please check what's wrong?

00:12:32.833 --> 00:12:33.583
Sure, I'll check.

00:12:37.625 --> 00:12:39.333
-[thundering]
-[heavy downpour]

00:12:40.500 --> 00:12:42.417
[auto engine ticking]

00:12:45.833 --> 00:12:47.292
[thundering]

00:12:51.692 --> 00:12:53.567
Sir, why are you here?
What happened?

00:12:53.708 --> 00:12:55.458
The drinking water is brown.

00:12:56.458 --> 00:12:59.542
Hey, why is the water beige?

00:13:00.875 --> 00:13:01.958
What did I tell you?

00:13:03.167 --> 00:13:04.542
I wanted a coffee-brown color.

00:13:04.708 --> 00:13:06.500
Freaking, you turned it into beige.

00:13:07.625 --> 00:13:08.583
Take a look!

00:13:09.667 --> 00:13:12.625
When I see through, I shouldn't
know what the person opposite is doing.

00:13:12.792 --> 00:13:15.208
But now I can see
that he's glaring at me.

00:13:15.417 --> 00:13:19.500
Tomorrow, make sure I don't
see any of his expressions.

00:13:19.792 --> 00:13:20.417
Understood?

00:13:20.875 --> 00:13:22.500
Hey, Mani, bring me my lunch.

00:13:23.917 --> 00:13:26.333
Sir, normally requests
that it be turned beige.

00:13:26.500 --> 00:13:28.583
I believe he's very angry,
as he requested coffee-brown.

00:13:28.917 --> 00:13:31.542
So, I'd suggest you discuss with him

00:13:31.667 --> 00:13:33.750
fall on his feet and apologize.
He'll forget everything.

00:13:34.333 --> 00:13:35.708
Then the water will change color.

00:13:35.958 --> 00:13:38.125
If you don't apologize,
it may turn jet black.

00:13:38.333 --> 00:13:39.542
Then water won't be useful
for the toilet either.

00:13:39.875 --> 00:13:40.583
Take care!

00:13:41.250 --> 00:13:41.958
-Hey!
-Sir?

00:13:42.083 --> 00:13:42.833
Come in!

00:13:43.125 --> 00:13:44.625
-Don't waste your time with him.
-Sure, here I come.

00:13:44.667 --> 00:13:48.333
He'd realize my power
only after struggling with water cans.

00:13:52.125 --> 00:13:55.458
Muthu, I think it's a very tough job.

00:13:55.625 --> 00:13:58.167
I'm sure it won't be tougher
than carrying a water can.

00:13:58.667 --> 00:14:00.000
Ask them to make me a cup of tea.

00:14:01.167 --> 00:14:02.833
With or without sugar?

00:14:03.042 --> 00:14:03.792
With sugar!

00:14:04.167 --> 00:14:05.417
[mischievous music]

00:14:05.875 --> 00:14:07.667
With or without milk?

00:14:07.750 --> 00:14:09.125
I don't want tea.
You may go.

00:14:10.750 --> 00:14:13.250
[steel clanging]

00:14:16.250 --> 00:14:17.500
[clanking]

00:14:19.250 --> 00:14:21.000
[pipe saw scrapes]

00:14:23.208 --> 00:14:24.208
[clinking]

00:14:24.750 --> 00:14:25.958
[car whirring]

00:14:26.333 --> 00:14:27.000
Sir!

00:14:28.250 --> 00:14:30.375
I'm toiling out here,
and you're playing on the phone.

00:14:30.500 --> 00:14:31.875
Out of rage,
I might pelt stones at you.

00:14:32.042 --> 00:14:34.250
Go inside the house and check
what the water color is now.

00:14:38.417 --> 00:14:40.542
[water gushing]

00:14:44.375 --> 00:14:46.167
Yeah! The color is normal now.

00:14:48.417 --> 00:14:50.417
Why is the quality
of your product deteriorating?

00:14:50.458 --> 00:14:51.833
I've been monitoring it constantly.

00:14:51.958 --> 00:14:54.167
If you don't improve,
I'll stop ordering from you.

00:14:54.250 --> 00:14:57.500
Sheila, Madam, the profit this month
should've been ₹1,24,000.

00:14:57.583 --> 00:14:59.417
But it's only ₹1,12,000.

00:14:59.708 --> 00:15:00.917
Why? What went wrong?

00:15:01.458 --> 00:15:03.583
₹12,000 was spent only on tasting.

00:15:04.167 --> 00:15:05.875
[mischievous music]

00:15:06.833 --> 00:15:08.833
Bring me the new flavour.

00:15:09.000 --> 00:15:10.167
I must check how it tastes.

00:15:11.250 --> 00:15:12.042
Yes, tell me.

00:15:12.667 --> 00:15:15.292
Didn't you resolve
the water problem that day?

00:15:16.083 --> 00:15:16.625
Yeah, I did!

00:15:16.958 --> 00:15:19.458
But I see men from the municipality
working on it here.

00:15:21.375 --> 00:15:24.000
It's unclear why they're here,
and they aren't explaining.

00:15:24.292 --> 00:15:25.500
Could you please come over?

00:15:26.500 --> 00:15:28.375
Damn, he did a clean job.

00:15:29.708 --> 00:15:31.375
Hey, open the tap now!

00:15:31.958 --> 00:15:33.458
[water gushing]

00:15:33.958 --> 00:15:36.208
Sir, the color changed to coffee brown.

00:15:37.875 --> 00:15:40.708
If anyone dares to mess with the pipes...

00:15:40.875 --> 00:15:42.583
all the houses will have to
use drainage water.

00:15:43.250 --> 00:15:45.000
-Hey, check if the meat is ready.
-Sure, Sir!

00:15:45.917 --> 00:15:48.042
Bhai, how long will it take you
to cut one kilo of meat?

00:15:48.125 --> 00:15:49.625
-I was making sure it's fresh.
-Stop here.

00:15:49.750 --> 00:15:51.333
-Man, you're taking too long.
-Hey, hurry up!

00:15:51.375 --> 00:15:52.958
-Almost done!
-Annoying man.

00:15:53.750 --> 00:15:55.792
-[suspenseful music]
-[auto engine ticking]

00:15:58.042 --> 00:15:59.583
[scooter engine lightly whirring]

00:16:01.458 --> 00:16:03.000
[auto whirring]

00:16:03.625 --> 00:16:05.708
Sir, the water problem resolved itself.

00:16:06.708 --> 00:16:08.333
How will it resolve itself?

00:16:08.792 --> 00:16:10.875
Only if we fix it will it be resolved.

00:16:11.667 --> 00:16:12.667
[knife chopping]

00:16:13.000 --> 00:16:14.417
What if you mess around with it...

00:16:14.542 --> 00:16:17.375
and the water line to the Collector's house
turns into turquoise blue?

00:16:17.708 --> 00:16:18.833
Who will take the responsibility for it?

00:16:19.375 --> 00:16:21.000
I thought
it would take you longer to arrive.

00:16:21.000 --> 00:16:22.292
Moreover, there was no water at home.

00:16:22.292 --> 00:16:24.083
That's why I fixed it myself.

00:16:24.417 --> 00:16:26.042
Fixed it yourself, you say?

00:16:26.417 --> 00:16:27.292
Oh!

00:16:28.625 --> 00:16:30.708
If I enter your house and burn it down...

00:16:31.083 --> 00:16:32.375
would you put out the fire yourself?

00:16:33.083 --> 00:16:35.958
Or if I throw your grandson
from the terrace...

00:16:36.500 --> 00:16:38.333
would you save him yourself?

00:16:38.625 --> 00:16:41.292
Don't do it, Muthu.
Let's go, Muthu.

00:16:41.625 --> 00:16:42.667
Mu... thu...

00:16:43.000 --> 00:16:44.000
[riveting music]

00:16:44.292 --> 00:16:45.833
Listen to him and leave.

00:16:46.792 --> 00:16:49.708
Keep moving! Don't touch anything
without our permission.

00:16:50.083 --> 00:16:52.917
Why would he throw me
off the terrace for what you did?

00:16:53.583 --> 00:16:54.375
Let it go!

00:16:54.667 --> 00:16:56.250
Please bring the water can.

00:16:56.500 --> 00:16:57.750
I'll help you carry it.

00:16:58.458 --> 00:17:01.125
Sir, I think
he'll run away from town tomorrow.

00:17:01.167 --> 00:17:02.583
He must run away.
Run away.

00:17:03.083 --> 00:17:04.208
Now he must've realized my power.

00:17:04.250 --> 00:17:05.333
-Sir!
-How dare he?

00:17:05.375 --> 00:17:06.792
He's back fixing the pipes.

00:17:08.042 --> 00:17:09.833
[rousing music]

00:17:10.875 --> 00:17:12.125
[steel clanging]

00:17:15.708 --> 00:17:18.333
He won't listen, will he?
I'm going to crack his head.

00:17:18.792 --> 00:17:19.708
How dare you?

00:17:19.792 --> 00:17:21.833
Despite warnings, you're back to digging.

00:17:22.208 --> 00:17:23.583
[rousing music intensifies]

00:17:23.833 --> 00:17:24.958
[gagging]

00:17:25.292 --> 00:17:26.292
[loud thud]

00:17:26.917 --> 00:17:28.292
-[stomps]
-Oh, God!

00:17:30.792 --> 00:17:32.542
-[rod clanks]
-[screams]

00:17:34.250 --> 00:17:36.042
[rousing music continues]

00:17:36.750 --> 00:17:37.917
Sir, please spare me.

00:17:37.917 --> 00:17:39.833
-I made a mistake.
-Run for your lives!

00:17:39.875 --> 00:17:41.625
-Bring someone to help.
-Sir, please forgive me.

00:17:42.125 --> 00:17:42.625
Sir!

00:17:43.583 --> 00:17:44.708
Either stab me or spare me.

00:17:44.792 --> 00:17:46.500
How long do I try to dodge it?

00:17:46.708 --> 00:17:47.833
Sir, please spare me.

00:17:48.083 --> 00:17:50.167
Sir, please forgive me.
Please! Please!

00:17:50.333 --> 00:17:51.333
Sir, sir, sir, sir!

00:17:51.417 --> 00:17:52.750
-[smacks]
-[blood gushes]

00:17:56.042 --> 00:17:57.250
What color is this?

00:17:59.250 --> 00:18:00.542
Ferrari Red!

00:18:01.125 --> 00:18:03.125
If I see you in this area again...

00:18:03.917 --> 00:18:06.667
...the water in your house
will run this color.

00:18:07.792 --> 00:18:09.625
-Leave!
-Thank you, Sir.

00:18:09.875 --> 00:18:10.792
Thank you, Sir.

00:18:14.583 --> 00:18:16.083
[rousing music continues]

00:18:16.917 --> 00:18:19.875
-Run for your lives.<i>-Sir, should I fry or roast the chicken?</i>

00:18:19.917 --> 00:18:21.250
To hell with you!

00:18:21.583 --> 00:18:24.083
-You guys are hopeless.<i>-Sir, I'm confused.</i>

00:18:24.667 --> 00:18:26.042
[bus honking]

00:18:28.500 --> 00:18:31.125
<i>Uncle, don't worry.</i>
<i>Moorthi will handle him.</i>

00:18:31.333 --> 00:18:34.458
<i>-Did Moorthi assure himself?</i>
<i>-Yes, he did!</i>

00:18:34.667 --> 00:18:37.375
<i>How dare he beat you?</i>
<i>I'm going to torture the hell out of him.</i>

00:18:37.458 --> 00:18:39.042
He'll come running, pleading with you.

00:18:39.500 --> 00:18:40.958
We must not spare him, Sukumar.

00:18:41.125 --> 00:18:43.250
He humiliated me by beating me
in front of people.

00:18:43.750 --> 00:18:45.917
-I can't show my face in public.<i>-The chief is here. I'll call you later.</i>

00:18:46.000 --> 00:18:47.792
Is this the man who thrashed Bhaskar?

00:18:49.250 --> 00:18:53.792
How could you disrespect a municipality
officer and thrash him in public?

00:18:54.083 --> 00:18:56.375
-Sir, it was his fault--
-Are you implying he's at fault?

00:18:57.042 --> 00:18:58.500
Making mistakes is his job.

00:18:58.958 --> 00:19:00.833
And my job is to make them
commit those mistakes.

00:19:01.500 --> 00:19:03.208
You stopped him from doing his job.

00:19:03.292 --> 00:19:05.250
So, I'm assigning you a job out here.

00:19:06.208 --> 00:19:08.042
You don't get it, do you?

00:19:08.958 --> 00:19:10.792
That guy over there is Raghu.

00:19:11.167 --> 00:19:12.333
He was running a tea shop in town.

00:19:12.625 --> 00:19:13.667
His shop was popular.

00:19:14.042 --> 00:19:17.500
As it's popular,
I asked him to hang my picture in his shop.

00:19:17.792 --> 00:19:18.833
He refused it!

00:19:19.542 --> 00:19:22.292
I didn't mind that he refused.

00:19:22.417 --> 00:19:25.542
But removed his shop from there
and installed it under my picture here.

00:19:25.667 --> 00:19:26.667
-[jesting music]
-[slurping]

00:19:26.833 --> 00:19:30.250
Now his permanent job is to
make tea for us for the rest of his life.

00:19:31.667 --> 00:19:33.667
Suku, do we have
any job vacancies at the moment?

00:19:33.708 --> 00:19:35.750
Remember, you stabbed our driver.

00:19:36.125 --> 00:19:38.542
It seems the knife went
an inch deeper into the liver.

00:19:38.750 --> 00:19:40.333
The doctor said he won't make it.

00:19:40.500 --> 00:19:42.792
Is it? I did stab him properly.

00:19:43.125 --> 00:19:44.417
How did it go an inch deeper?

00:19:44.708 --> 00:19:46.000
[jesting music continues]

00:19:46.208 --> 00:19:50.250
Fine! God opens a new door
when he closes one.

00:19:50.833 --> 00:19:53.667
We'll appoint him as our driver.
Give me the keys.

00:19:55.292 --> 00:19:57.583
Take it! Clean it spotless!

00:19:57.958 --> 00:19:59.208
I might ask you to drive at any time.

00:19:59.917 --> 00:20:00.917
[chuckles]

00:20:01.500 --> 00:20:02.583
Hey, Raghu!

00:20:02.875 --> 00:20:06.250
<i>This guy is disrespecting me by sitting</i>
<i>under my picture and eating fritters.</i>

00:20:06.667 --> 00:20:10.167
<i>Instead of throwing hot water on him,</i>
<i>what the hell are you doing?</i>

00:20:12.292 --> 00:20:13.167
What's with the glaring?

00:20:13.708 --> 00:20:16.458
We didn't hire you
to pay you a monthly salary.

00:20:16.667 --> 00:20:18.125
But to torture you all the time.

00:20:18.458 --> 00:20:19.792
Go ahead and clean the car.

00:20:20.208 --> 00:20:21.583
Incorrigible man!

00:20:26.667 --> 00:20:28.292
[water lightly gushing]

00:20:29.250 --> 00:20:30.208
<i>♪ Give me the rhythm ♪</i>

00:20:36.125 --> 00:20:37.000
[water lightly flowing]

00:20:37.042 --> 00:20:38.250
<i>♪ Rhythm... Rhythm... ♪</i>

00:20:38.750 --> 00:20:39.750
[door closes]

00:20:41.583 --> 00:20:42.958
Hey, drive!

00:20:43.083 --> 00:20:45.208
It's not a rocket to wear a seat belt.

00:20:45.250 --> 00:20:48.125
<i>♪ We’re a wild bunch</i>
<i>This is our kingdom ♪</i>

00:20:48.375 --> 00:20:49.917
<i>♪ They’re coming to tear you apart ♪</i>

00:20:50.292 --> 00:20:52.167
<i>♪ They’re going to make you pay ♪</i>

00:20:52.333 --> 00:20:53.958
<i>♪ Oi, Alphonso mango! ♪</i>

00:20:54.167 --> 00:20:55.917
<i>♪ This is the Puttapu gang! ♪</i>

00:20:56.000 --> 00:20:56.583
-[slams brakes]
-[light cries]

00:20:56.625 --> 00:20:57.708
Uncle, are you okay?

00:20:58.667 --> 00:20:59.625
[shifting gears]

00:20:59.917 --> 00:21:00.958
Speed breaker!

00:21:01.208 --> 00:21:04.750
<i>♪ Come, come, come…</i>
<i>Shall we mess with you? ♪</i>

00:21:04.875 --> 00:21:08.708
<i>♪ Oh, yeah, yeah, yeah!</i>
<i>Is this the LeapFrog game, uh? ♪</i>

00:21:10.500 --> 00:21:11.750
[auto engine lightly revving]

00:21:11.958 --> 00:21:13.625
I don't know anything.
Please spare me.

00:21:13.708 --> 00:21:15.792
-For God's sake, spare me.
-I ought to!

00:21:16.958 --> 00:21:19.375
[tense music]

00:21:20.083 --> 00:21:21.750
[bangles jingling]

00:21:23.125 --> 00:21:25.125
Why aren't you telling me
anything about what's happening?

00:21:26.583 --> 00:21:28.333
We're surrounded
by many problems at the moment.

00:21:28.625 --> 00:21:31.000
I will explain
once all problems are resolved.

00:21:35.667 --> 00:21:37.667
<i>♪ Why are you looking so startled? ♪</i>

00:21:37.833 --> 00:21:41.417
<i>♪ You're stuck with a halfwit... ♪</i>

00:21:42.333 --> 00:21:44.333
We asked you to be here at 08:00 a.m.
But you're here early at 07:00 a.m.

00:21:44.458 --> 00:21:46.000
It's not like you will be given
a hike in salary.

00:21:46.125 --> 00:21:46.625
Go!

00:21:47.208 --> 00:21:49.792
<i>♪ You're stuck with a halfwit... ♪</i>

00:21:52.417 --> 00:21:53.250
[loud slams]

00:21:53.333 --> 00:21:54.208
[gun fires]

00:21:54.417 --> 00:21:55.417
[strikes hard]

00:21:55.875 --> 00:21:56.917
<i>♪ Give me the rhythm ♪</i>

00:21:57.208 --> 00:22:00.292
You both present your justifications,
taking turns.

00:22:00.708 --> 00:22:03.417
But in the end,
you must listen to my verdict.

00:22:03.875 --> 00:22:05.792
It's okay, take it. It's only ₹40.

00:22:08.500 --> 00:22:09.542
Did I charge him less?

00:22:09.708 --> 00:22:11.833
No! You priced it right.

00:22:11.958 --> 00:22:12.917
Of course!

00:22:15.000 --> 00:22:16.542
<i>♪ They’re coming to tear you apart ♪</i>

00:22:16.875 --> 00:22:18.500
<i>♪ They’re going to make you pay ♪</i>

00:22:18.875 --> 00:22:20.458
<i>♪ Oi, Alphonso mango! ♪</i>

00:22:20.625 --> 00:22:22.708
<i>♪ This is the Puttapu gang! ♪</i>

00:22:26.125 --> 00:22:29.167
Dileep, it's getting harder to
track him through other people.

00:22:29.708 --> 00:22:31.208
So, we're stepping in to look for him.

00:22:31.667 --> 00:22:33.083
I reckon we're nearing him.

00:22:33.375 --> 00:22:37.208
I believe he must be within a
150-200 kilometer radius of where we are.

00:22:38.250 --> 00:22:40.875
If I find anything new,
I'll call you myself.

00:22:41.667 --> 00:22:43.083
[nefarious music]

00:22:44.458 --> 00:22:45.792
<i>Brother, it looks crooked.</i>

00:22:45.875 --> 00:22:47.708
<i>If we don't follow this blueprint,</i>
<i>they'll yell at me.</i>

00:22:47.792 --> 00:22:49.167
<i>-Okay, I will fix it.</i>
<i>-Please change it.</i>

00:22:49.250 --> 00:22:50.708
-I hope you understand.
-I get it.

00:22:51.417 --> 00:22:52.125
Good morning!

00:22:52.708 --> 00:22:56.167
My boys were here to grant you permission,
but you refused it.

00:22:56.708 --> 00:22:58.667
Why should I get permission from you?

00:22:58.708 --> 00:23:01.417
Just as you seek permission from
the government, you must seek mine.

00:23:01.625 --> 00:23:04.333
Sir, if I don't get permission from the
government, I'll face legal problems.

00:23:04.500 --> 00:23:05.917
It's imperative.
Why should I seek yours?

00:23:05.958 --> 00:23:08.125
If you don't seek mine,
you'll face problems constantly.

00:23:08.250 --> 00:23:09.208
[yells]

00:23:12.083 --> 00:23:14.125
[peppy music]

00:23:16.958 --> 00:23:18.708
As it's a demo, I put out a safety net.

00:23:18.792 --> 00:23:20.208
Next time,
there will be no safety net.

00:23:20.583 --> 00:23:21.208
Understood?

00:23:21.958 --> 00:23:23.583
Make sure you pay me on time.

00:23:23.608 --> 00:23:24.993
-<i>♪ Oi, Alphonso mango! ♪</i>
-Buh-bye!

00:23:25.018 --> 00:23:27.018
<i>♪ This is the Puttapu gang! ♪</i>

00:23:27.667 --> 00:23:28.667
[papers rustling]

00:23:28.792 --> 00:23:29.792
[phone ringing]

00:23:30.167 --> 00:23:32.667
-Yes, Ameer.<i>-Kumar, it's been two days.</i>

00:23:32.750 --> 00:23:35.292
You promised delivery on Friday
it's Monday now.

00:23:35.875 --> 00:23:36.917
I have not received anything yet.

00:23:37.083 --> 00:23:38.458
<i>That's why Dileep asked to check with you.</i>

00:23:38.583 --> 00:23:40.917
Ameer, a guy, promised to bring it by.

00:23:41.167 --> 00:23:42.500
I'm waiting for him.

00:23:42.667 --> 00:23:44.250
Give me a day.

00:23:44.625 --> 00:23:46.417
Please inform Dileep
that I made a humble request.

00:23:46.833 --> 00:23:49.458
It would be better
if you delivered it by tomorrow.

00:23:49.750 --> 00:23:50.958
[sinister music]

00:23:51.208 --> 00:23:52.792
<i>-Yes, brother!</i>
-Bloody rascal!

00:23:53.125 --> 00:23:55.708
-Weren't you supposed to deliver today?
-I informed him yesterday.

00:23:56.083 --> 00:23:57.583
He promised to deliver it today.

00:23:57.792 --> 00:23:59.542
But he hasn't answered my calls
since this morning.

00:23:59.667 --> 00:24:00.375
Who is he?

00:24:00.667 --> 00:24:02.792
Brother, he's been delivering
to us for 3 months now.

00:24:02.958 --> 00:24:05.333
He's been consistent
and has delivered every week.

00:24:05.542 --> 00:24:08.083
But today, for some reason
he hasn't answered my calls.

00:24:08.792 --> 00:24:10.458
Give me some time.
I'll call him again.

00:24:11.833 --> 00:24:14.042
[sinister music]

00:24:15.125 --> 00:24:17.000
[phone ringing]

00:24:24.250 --> 00:24:25.042
[slams brakes]

00:24:25.125 --> 00:24:26.167
Save me! Save me!

00:24:26.917 --> 00:24:29.583
-Oh, God!
-Why would he ram with Veena?

00:24:29.667 --> 00:24:32.375
-Moorthi and fruits!
-Come over here.

00:24:32.500 --> 00:24:34.167
Uncle, please roll down the glass.

00:24:34.292 --> 00:24:36.375
I'm sorry, sir.
The villagers are chasing me.

00:24:36.458 --> 00:24:37.167
Please give me a lift.

00:24:37.208 --> 00:24:38.208
-Hey!
-Sir!

00:24:38.292 --> 00:24:40.042
Bloody fruit! Get lost!

00:24:40.125 --> 00:24:41.875
-Let me hide in the boot.
-Driver! Start!

00:24:42.417 --> 00:24:44.250
[agitated crowd noises]

00:24:47.458 --> 00:24:49.625
Driver, keep your eyes on the road.

00:24:49.750 --> 00:24:51.750
A huge crowd is coming.
They might ram into us.

00:24:51.917 --> 00:24:53.875
Why are you looking at the
guy behind you and driving?

00:24:54.333 --> 00:24:56.500
I was wondering how casually
he was smuggling this statue.

00:24:56.583 --> 00:25:00.417
This statue sells at auction
in London or Paris for millions.

00:25:01.167 --> 00:25:02.917
- Millions, you say?
-Yes!

00:25:03.167 --> 00:25:05.333
Haven't you heard about smuggling statutes?

00:25:05.417 --> 00:25:06.500
It's a huge mafia!

00:25:06.917 --> 00:25:08.917
They steal ancient statues in India...

00:25:09.125 --> 00:25:11.917
and illegally export them abroad
and make millions.

00:25:12.042 --> 00:25:13.208
Haven't you watched it on YouTube?

00:25:13.458 --> 00:25:15.792
Hey, why didn't you say this
before bumping him?

00:25:15.917 --> 00:25:16.708
Stop the car!

00:25:17.333 --> 00:25:18.708
-[halts slowly]
-Reverse the car.

00:25:19.083 --> 00:25:20.292
Hey, watch out when reversing.

00:25:20.792 --> 00:25:22.292
Damn, they're carrying big brooms.

00:25:23.042 --> 00:25:24.583
[agitated crowd noises]

00:25:24.833 --> 00:25:26.583
[reversing screech]

00:25:27.958 --> 00:25:29.875
[lighthearted music]

00:25:32.667 --> 00:25:33.667
[halts slowly]

00:25:33.750 --> 00:25:36.958
I felt bad about not giving you a lift.
Please hop into the vehicle.

00:25:37.125 --> 00:25:39.417
It's okay, Sir.
I'll catch a share-auto from the main road.

00:25:39.458 --> 00:25:41.083
Why do you want to waste
₹10 on an auto?

00:25:41.083 --> 00:25:42.875
-Hey, grab him!
-Grab me?

00:25:42.917 --> 00:25:44.917
<i>-Hey, grab him!</i>
<i>-Hey, pull him in.</i>

00:25:45.000 --> 00:25:46.542
<i>-Oh, no!</i>
<i>-Oh, God!</i>

00:25:46.625 --> 00:25:49.667
<i>-Damn you, wrong spot!</i>
<i>-It wasn't me. It's the guitar.</i>

00:25:52.375 --> 00:25:54.167
<i>Hey, where are you taking me?</i>

00:26:03.875 --> 00:26:04.750
Muruga!

00:26:05.042 --> 00:26:06.542
[phone ringing]

00:26:09.583 --> 00:26:11.750
Sir, please give me my phone.

00:26:11.917 --> 00:26:14.333
I have to deliver the goods.
If I don't, they'll kill me.

00:26:14.583 --> 00:26:15.208
Please, Sir.

00:26:15.708 --> 00:26:18.208
Hey, Suku, call and put it on speaker.

00:26:20.833 --> 00:26:21.500
Please come.

00:26:24.708 --> 00:26:25.708
Same to you, Brother.

00:26:25.792 --> 00:26:26.875
[comical music]

00:26:27.042 --> 00:26:29.042
I've been calling you to find out
when you will deliver it.

00:26:29.333 --> 00:26:31.167
Why won't you answer my call?
Where are you now?

00:26:32.458 --> 00:26:34.625
<i>You were consistent for 3 months,</i>
<i>so I believed in you.</i>

00:26:34.833 --> 00:26:35.375
Brother!

00:26:35.417 --> 00:26:38.125
If you dodge my calls
and fail to deliver...

00:26:38.417 --> 00:26:39.542
I'll hack you into pieces.

00:26:39.833 --> 00:26:41.667
Brother, please don't do anything rash.

00:26:41.750 --> 00:26:44.083
Brother, there was a mix-up
with the vehicle registration papers.

00:26:44.250 --> 00:26:45.875
So, the traffic police caught me.

00:26:46.042 --> 00:26:48.125
-I will deliver the statue as promised.<i>-Is the package safe?</i>

00:26:48.208 --> 00:26:49.583
-It's safe.<i>-You better be here in an hour.</i>

00:26:49.583 --> 00:26:50.125
Brother!

00:26:50.250 --> 00:26:51.083
[call disengages]

00:26:51.583 --> 00:26:53.167
Why is he getting worked up?

00:26:53.458 --> 00:26:54.875
How much is he paying for the statue?

00:26:55.167 --> 00:26:57.875
Brother, it's chump change.
He'll pay ₹10 lakhs for it.

00:26:58.542 --> 00:26:59.458
₹10 lakhs?

00:27:02.333 --> 00:27:03.792
How many have you sold to date?

00:27:04.500 --> 00:27:06.125
I may have sold around 25-30 statues.

00:27:06.542 --> 00:27:08.125
25-30 statues, you say?

00:27:08.708 --> 00:27:10.458
You look like a beggar, though.

00:27:10.583 --> 00:27:11.833
What do you do with so much money?

00:27:12.500 --> 00:27:14.333
I deposit at Hong Kong International Bank.

00:27:15.083 --> 00:27:16.458
Hong Kong National Bank?

00:27:17.458 --> 00:27:19.333
Hey, Driver, is he telling the truth?

00:27:19.958 --> 00:27:22.833
Yes, Sir. As I mentioned,
people make millions doing this business.

00:27:24.167 --> 00:27:26.625
[comical music continues]

00:27:29.958 --> 00:27:30.667
Kohli!

00:27:31.625 --> 00:27:34.375
Are you wondering how I am
going to enter this new business?

00:27:34.375 --> 00:27:36.000
Uncle, I'm thinking about something else.

00:27:36.083 --> 00:27:37.625
What else are you thinking about?

00:27:37.750 --> 00:27:41.542
How can he drive in reverse at 90 km/hr?

00:27:42.083 --> 00:27:44.042
In fact, he didn't even turn around
to check the road.

00:27:44.292 --> 00:27:46.667
Can an ordinary driver
do something like this?

00:27:47.292 --> 00:27:48.458
I was wondering about it.

00:27:48.667 --> 00:27:51.042
Hey, a millionaire
is sitting in front of you.

00:27:51.083 --> 00:27:53.833
Instead, you're wondering
about this ordinary driver, you fool.

00:27:53.958 --> 00:27:55.167
-Mr. goods carrier.
-Yes!

00:27:55.292 --> 00:27:56.000
Congratulations!

00:27:56.167 --> 00:27:58.083
-Why?
-You're appointed for a job.

00:27:58.167 --> 00:27:59.667
You can immediately join.

00:28:01.125 --> 00:28:03.458
Job? What kind of job?

00:28:03.750 --> 00:28:05.500
Nothing unusual.
It's the regular job you're already doing.

00:28:05.792 --> 00:28:09.125
After you sell the stolen statue for
₹10 lakhs bring that money to me

00:28:09.208 --> 00:28:11.292
and I'll pay you a salary of ₹50,000.

00:28:12.000 --> 00:28:12.792
I don't understand.

00:28:13.375 --> 00:28:16.500
Why should I give you
my hard-earned stolen money?

00:28:16.708 --> 00:28:19.708
It's a fee for protection from people who
may chase you when you're out to steal.

00:28:21.208 --> 00:28:23.750
-Who would chase me?
-We will chase you.

00:28:24.458 --> 00:28:27.042
Sir, the fairness in your words
has won my respect.

00:28:27.125 --> 00:28:28.917
I’d be honored to work with you.

00:28:28.958 --> 00:28:30.750
That isn't enough!

00:28:31.042 --> 00:28:33.333
You must deliver the statue
and deposit the money with me.

00:28:33.375 --> 00:28:34.542
Only then will I confirm your job.

00:28:36.250 --> 00:28:37.500
[baffling music]

00:28:37.708 --> 00:28:38.625
You got me webbed!

00:28:40.542 --> 00:28:41.292
I will do it.

00:28:42.625 --> 00:28:43.458
I will do it, Sir.

00:28:44.125 --> 00:28:46.500
-Did you sell it for more than ₹10 lakhs?
-Sir!

00:28:46.542 --> 00:28:48.667
-Did you sell it for ₹15 lakh or ₹20 lakh?
-I didn't sell it for more.

00:28:49.417 --> 00:28:51.167
Hey, tell me the truth!

00:28:51.250 --> 00:28:52.500
Next, I'll stab you with a knife.

00:28:52.667 --> 00:28:54.250
Sir, I didn't sell it for more than that.

00:28:56.583 --> 00:28:57.625
Hey, Driver!

00:28:58.333 --> 00:28:59.958
No matter how much I beat him,
he's not budging.

00:29:00.000 --> 00:29:03.125
As you mentioned,
I don't think he's lying to us.

00:29:05.250 --> 00:29:07.208
Who mentioned that I sold it for more...

00:29:07.750 --> 00:29:09.750
and lying to you about it?

00:29:10.167 --> 00:29:11.792
Here, it's the driver.

00:29:12.292 --> 00:29:13.667
[baffling music]

00:29:16.125 --> 00:29:17.125
Thought as much.

00:29:17.375 --> 00:29:19.250
Bloody waste of energy.

00:29:19.500 --> 00:29:20.542
-Kohli!
-Uncle.

00:29:21.042 --> 00:29:23.000
-Bring me the massage oil.
-Yeah, Uncle, let's go.

00:29:23.000 --> 00:29:25.333
My shoulder is hurting
from beating this moron.

00:29:25.500 --> 00:29:26.333
[bottles clinking]

00:29:27.083 --> 00:29:28.875
Who's releasing me now?

00:29:29.917 --> 00:29:31.958
[comical music]

00:29:35.625 --> 00:29:37.375
Were you hurting
when I was getting beaten?

00:29:37.500 --> 00:29:39.250
Why would it hurt me
when you're getting beaten?

00:29:39.375 --> 00:29:40.708
Aren't they beating you?

00:29:41.542 --> 00:29:42.208
I don't get it.

00:29:42.250 --> 00:29:44.375
I was minding my business while
driving on the side of the road.

00:29:44.583 --> 00:29:47.167
But you swayed around
and bumped into the car?

00:29:47.792 --> 00:29:50.000
Oh, my God! Karma!

00:29:50.167 --> 00:29:51.042
What is he saying?

00:29:51.958 --> 00:29:54.167
The statue that he sells for ₹10 lakh

00:29:54.417 --> 00:29:55.917
is resold by the buyer for ₹70 lakh.

00:29:56.000 --> 00:29:59.125
And it's again resold by the
other party for up to ₹1.5 crore.

00:29:59.458 --> 00:30:00.458
₹1.5 crore?!

00:30:01.875 --> 00:30:04.667
-Is it worth so much?
-Don't you think so?

00:30:05.750 --> 00:30:07.542
Had I known, I would've escaped.

00:30:07.625 --> 00:30:08.667
What's he saying now?

00:30:09.500 --> 00:30:11.083
Aren't we stealing the statue?

00:30:11.167 --> 00:30:12.500
If we could find a buyer
who'd pay ₹1.5 crore

00:30:12.583 --> 00:30:13.750
why don't we sell it directly?

00:30:13.792 --> 00:30:16.167
Why should we go through two mediators?

00:30:17.042 --> 00:30:17.917
What did he say?

00:30:18.125 --> 00:30:20.792
I'm an independent thief.
How can I stand up against the mafia?

00:30:21.042 --> 00:30:22.333
I'm no Moorthi!

00:30:22.458 --> 00:30:24.458
Someone powerful like Moorthi can do it.

00:30:24.792 --> 00:30:25.667
That's what he said!

00:30:26.458 --> 00:30:28.458
[comical music continues]

00:30:30.250 --> 00:30:32.167
You told him everything that I never said.

00:30:32.667 --> 00:30:34.375
Now I'll tell you something.
Would you tell him?

00:30:36.167 --> 00:30:39.083
He's the dumbest fruit in his gang.

00:30:39.625 --> 00:30:41.375
-I will tell him.
-Please do.

00:30:41.875 --> 00:30:42.958
Hey, enough!

00:30:43.125 --> 00:30:46.250
Sir, my back is burning.
Please pull down my T-shirt.

00:30:46.333 --> 00:30:48.000
Brother, can someone
powerful like me do it?

00:30:48.083 --> 00:30:49.833
-Get lost!
-Definitely, Sir.

00:30:50.042 --> 00:30:53.292
If they knew you're involved,
they'll surely step down.

00:30:53.833 --> 00:30:56.250
-Hey, Driver, are you serious?
-Yes, Sir.

00:30:58.333 --> 00:31:00.625
Kohli, what are you wondering about?

00:31:00.958 --> 00:31:02.583
That I'm not aware of my own power.

00:31:02.833 --> 00:31:04.750
Uncle,
I was wondering about something else.

00:31:04.833 --> 00:31:05.500
What is it?

00:31:05.917 --> 00:31:08.042
Many of the locals don't know you exist.

00:31:08.125 --> 00:31:09.500
I was wondering how people
in other towns know about you.

00:31:10.625 --> 00:31:14.583
-Something fishy?
-I too had the same doubt.

00:31:14.708 --> 00:31:16.917
But the Driver seems to be
confident about it.

00:31:17.500 --> 00:31:19.875
Let the Driver introduce me to them.

00:31:19.917 --> 00:31:21.958
If they're threatened,
we'll take over the business.

00:31:22.042 --> 00:31:24.292
If they kill the driver,
we'll find a new driver.

00:31:24.333 --> 00:31:25.458
We have nothing to lose.

00:31:25.583 --> 00:31:27.208
-Fine, you lie on the bench.
-Uncle?

00:31:27.583 --> 00:31:30.542
You had doubts about my power.
So you deserve punishment.

00:31:30.583 --> 00:31:32.375
-Hey, bring me the whip.
-Hey, shit!

00:31:39.542 --> 00:31:41.375
[cars whirring]

00:31:46.500 --> 00:31:49.750
[tense music]

00:31:53.500 --> 00:31:54.542
[doors closing]

00:31:57.792 --> 00:31:59.833
[tense music continues]

00:32:02.333 --> 00:32:04.542
I was told you'd only speak to me.
Go ahead.

00:32:05.833 --> 00:32:08.125
-Hereafter, I can't sell you the statues.
-Why?

00:32:08.750 --> 00:32:10.250
Moorthi has stepped into this business.

00:32:11.083 --> 00:32:14.208
Once he steps in,
nothing goes beyond his word.

00:32:14.667 --> 00:32:16.417
-Who's Moorthi?
-There's more to it.

00:32:16.625 --> 00:32:20.125
By dawn,
he must not see you people in this town.

00:32:20.208 --> 00:32:23.750
So, you should vacate overnight and leave.

00:32:23.917 --> 00:32:25.000
Who said this?

00:32:25.292 --> 00:32:26.792
This too is Moorthi's order.

00:32:27.292 --> 00:32:29.500
Moorthi? Who's this Moorthi?

00:32:29.750 --> 00:32:32.333
So, even you aren't aware of him.
But they're hyping him up too much.

00:32:32.917 --> 00:32:35.333
Hey, does anyone know who Moorthi is?

00:32:35.958 --> 00:32:38.375
-Moorthi...
-Anyone know him?

00:32:39.583 --> 00:32:40.667
No idea, Brother!

00:32:40.917 --> 00:32:42.292
[phone ringing]

00:32:43.125 --> 00:32:45.125
Moorthi? Which Moorthi?

00:32:45.333 --> 00:32:49.250
He has warned us to vacate overnight
and leave town.

00:32:49.333 --> 00:32:50.875
-Overnight, he said?
-Yes!

00:32:51.125 --> 00:32:53.250
Who is he?
And what was he doing?

00:32:54.250 --> 00:32:55.375
What does Moorthi do?

00:32:56.458 --> 00:32:57.458
He owns a fruit shop.

00:32:58.375 --> 00:32:59.583
-He owns a fruit shop.<i>-Are you serious?</i>

00:33:00.875 --> 00:33:01.708
Fruit shop?

00:33:02.208 --> 00:33:03.875
-Wait, I'll call you back.<i>-Okay.</i>

00:33:05.042 --> 00:33:06.208
He owns a fruit shop, you say?

00:33:06.750 --> 00:33:09.667
We're dealing with statues, but
you're talking about a fruit shop owner.

00:33:09.958 --> 00:33:11.542
I think there's a miscommunication.

00:33:11.667 --> 00:33:13.625
Please report back to your boss.
They made a mistake.

00:33:14.042 --> 00:33:15.750
We must follow Moorthi's orders.

00:33:15.792 --> 00:33:17.708
Moorthi doesn't follow
anyone else's orders.

00:33:18.167 --> 00:33:20.417
Moorthi! Moorthi!
Who the hell is Moorthi?

00:33:20.792 --> 00:33:21.667
Our Boss!

00:33:22.167 --> 00:33:23.667
If he's your boss, who are you?

00:33:23.958 --> 00:33:25.000
I'm his driver.

00:33:25.667 --> 00:33:26.583
Driver?

00:33:28.000 --> 00:33:30.625
Hey, all this while
you were speaking to a driver.

00:33:31.917 --> 00:33:34.292
Why wouldn't your Boss
come down to discuss?

00:33:34.750 --> 00:33:37.458
To solve petty matters like this,
he sends us.

00:33:37.957 --> 00:33:39.623
Did you call it a petty matter?

00:33:40.292 --> 00:33:41.083
I ought to!

00:33:41.500 --> 00:33:42.542
Kumar, calm down.

00:33:43.292 --> 00:33:45.458
If we kill him,
we'd never know who Moorthi is.

00:33:47.875 --> 00:33:49.458
Fine, let go of my hand.
I'll handle it.

00:33:55.125 --> 00:33:58.125
You ask Moorthi to come and meet me.

00:33:58.667 --> 00:33:59.875
I want to meet Moorthi.

00:34:00.750 --> 00:34:02.333
If he doesn't show up...

00:34:02.417 --> 00:34:05.042
I'll cut your head
and place it on the road.

00:34:05.167 --> 00:34:05.917
Call him!

00:34:08.792 --> 00:34:09.833
What are you waiting for?

00:34:10.542 --> 00:34:13.792
If Moorthi comes down,
he won't speak calmly as you do.

00:34:18.958 --> 00:34:19.708
It's okay.

00:34:23.958 --> 00:34:24.792
Ask him to come.

00:34:26.125 --> 00:34:28.625
[thrilling music]

00:34:36.417 --> 00:34:38.708
Kumar has locked us up on the bridge.

00:34:38.958 --> 00:34:40.500
Only if you come down
will he release us.

00:34:40.792 --> 00:34:42.292
Please come soon.

00:34:42.833 --> 00:34:43.875
Please don't get offended.

00:34:46.250 --> 00:34:47.083
I informed him.

00:34:49.250 --> 00:34:51.625
[thrilling music intensifies]

00:34:56.792 --> 00:34:58.500
[tires screeching]

00:35:00.125 --> 00:35:01.833
[thrilling music continues]

00:35:02.417 --> 00:35:04.542
Hey, why are you guys over here?

00:35:05.167 --> 00:35:08.667
We heard about Moorthi.
So we're curious to know about him.

00:35:09.917 --> 00:35:12.500
[thrilling music continues]

00:35:16.583 --> 00:35:18.042
I thought he would arrive in 10 minutes.

00:35:18.500 --> 00:35:20.042
I don't see anyone yet.
Call him again.

00:35:25.167 --> 00:35:25.750
Brother!

00:35:28.833 --> 00:35:30.958
-He will be here.
-I didn't hear you call him.

00:35:31.083 --> 00:35:32.333
Are you lying?

00:35:32.458 --> 00:35:34.167
-[firing]
-[man groans in pain]

00:35:35.708 --> 00:35:37.042
Someone's shooting at us.

00:35:39.708 --> 00:35:40.542
He has arrived.

00:35:42.167 --> 00:35:44.042
<i>Hey, look around.</i>

00:35:44.500 --> 00:35:47.250
<i>-Hey, step aside.</i>
<i>-Keep pressure on the wound.</i>

00:35:47.750 --> 00:35:49.083
<i>-Come on, do it.</i>
<i>-It's hurting!</i>

00:35:52.417 --> 00:35:54.917
[tense music intensifies]

00:35:57.625 --> 00:35:58.708
Hey, what happened?

00:35:59.083 --> 00:36:01.000
-Brother, they're shooting at us.
-Yes, Brother!

00:36:02.750 --> 00:36:04.333
I think he set up a sniper somewhere.

00:36:04.417 --> 00:36:06.458
-Bring out the weapons.
-Come on, everyone!

00:36:06.833 --> 00:36:07.750
Go! Go!

00:36:08.708 --> 00:36:11.417
-[opens door]
-[weapons clinking]

00:36:13.125 --> 00:36:15.458
[intensified tense music continues]

00:36:18.417 --> 00:36:20.875
[bullets firing]

00:36:26.625 --> 00:36:28.417
[music crescendos]

00:36:30.083 --> 00:36:32.125
<i>♪ He’s witnessed your dirty game ♪</i>

00:36:34.500 --> 00:36:36.875
<i>♪ He's familiar with your father's game ♪</i>

00:36:39.667 --> 00:36:41.333
Moorthi has summoned you right away.

00:36:41.875 --> 00:36:44.917
Are you moving your cars,
or should he do it?

00:36:45.500 --> 00:36:48.667
Sir, we have the keys.
How will he move the cars?

00:36:49.250 --> 00:36:51.000
[suspenseful music builds]

00:36:53.583 --> 00:36:54.792
[rockets whooshes]

00:36:54.875 --> 00:36:56.417
[loud explosion]

00:36:56.792 --> 00:36:59.458
[mass music]

00:37:00.292 --> 00:37:01.125
[loud explosion]

00:37:01.167 --> 00:37:02.083
<i>♪ Hukkum! ♪</i>

00:37:02.917 --> 00:37:04.250
<i>♪ Tiger Ka Hukkum! ♪</i>

00:37:04.292 --> 00:37:06.292
<i>♪ He’s witnessed your dirty game ♪</i>

00:37:06.458 --> 00:37:08.708
<i>♪ He's familiar with your father's game ♪</i>

00:37:08.917 --> 00:37:13.125
<i>♪ Oh… he’s the one</i>
<i>Who makes generations dance to his tune! ♪</i>

00:37:13.250 --> 00:37:15.708
<i>♪ A few may try to tarnish his name ♪</i>

00:37:15.917 --> 00:37:18.083
<i>♪ A hundred may try to snatch his crown ♪</i>

00:37:18.250 --> 00:37:20.583
<i>♪ Look over that wall ♪</i>

00:37:20.792 --> 00:37:23.125
<i>♪ millions will rise to show their love! ♪</i>

00:37:23.583 --> 00:37:25.583
<i>♪ Watch Thalaivar unleash the chaos! ♪</i>

00:37:28.125 --> 00:37:31.125
<i>♪ Thalaivar forever ♪</i>

00:37:33.750 --> 00:37:35.875
[music fades]

00:37:37.750 --> 00:37:38.958
Are you aware of me?

00:37:39.542 --> 00:37:40.083
We do!

00:37:40.292 --> 00:37:42.583
<i>Why wait?</i>
<i>Vacate the town right away.</i>

00:37:49.250 --> 00:37:51.583
[sinister music]

00:37:51.958 --> 00:37:53.500
-[wood scraping]
-[hammer nailing]

00:37:56.708 --> 00:38:01.875
[heaving chants]

00:38:10.000 --> 00:38:13.042
[sinister music continues]

00:38:21.125 --> 00:38:23.542
[sinister music continues]

00:38:26.958 --> 00:38:28.083
[flicks lighter]

00:38:36.667 --> 00:38:37.500
What did he say?

00:38:37.875 --> 00:38:39.792
He insists on only speaking to you.

00:38:42.167 --> 00:38:43.083
Bring him in.

00:38:44.375 --> 00:38:44.958
Hey!

00:38:46.708 --> 00:38:48.333
-Who are you?
-He's my assistant.

00:38:48.375 --> 00:38:49.000
What's in the bag?

00:38:49.708 --> 00:38:52.750
Nothing scary, Man.
Only massage oils and refreshments.

00:38:52.958 --> 00:38:54.667
-I have betel leaf--
-Shut it!

00:38:56.417 --> 00:38:58.042
Aren't you the driver?

00:38:59.000 --> 00:39:00.292
Take your assistant and step back.

00:39:01.208 --> 00:39:02.083
Assistant?

00:39:02.333 --> 00:39:03.875
Drivers are not allowed
inside the premises.

00:39:04.167 --> 00:39:04.833
Step back!

00:39:05.333 --> 00:39:07.000
-You two can proceed.
-Thank you, Brother.

00:39:07.250 --> 00:39:08.583
Can't you hear me?
Step back, damn it!

00:39:08.625 --> 00:39:10.042
But you're moving forward, Man.

00:39:10.583 --> 00:39:12.375
[footsteps approaching]

00:39:14.042 --> 00:39:15.667
-Hi, Guys!
-Three monkeys.

00:39:15.833 --> 00:39:17.333
Don't know
when they would pee on us.

00:39:17.625 --> 00:39:18.375
Take your seat.

00:39:22.500 --> 00:39:25.875
Sir, I can assure you
it's not from our boat.

00:39:26.292 --> 00:39:28.917
You've made a mistake
and arrived at the wrong address.

00:39:29.208 --> 00:39:30.542
This isn't our stuff.

00:39:31.083 --> 00:39:33.375
Kumar did mention
that you manufacture boats.

00:39:33.792 --> 00:39:36.083
And you conceal old statues
while manufacturing boats...

00:39:36.208 --> 00:39:39.250
and export to many foreign countries.

00:39:39.917 --> 00:39:41.125
Kumar informed me correctly.

00:39:41.917 --> 00:39:43.583
I peg Kumar as a gentleman.

00:39:44.208 --> 00:39:45.417
I don't think he's lying.

00:39:45.792 --> 00:39:46.958
Why are you lying to me?

00:39:47.083 --> 00:39:48.250
Are you afraid of me?

00:39:48.708 --> 00:39:50.083
[giggles]

00:39:50.167 --> 00:39:51.125
[phone ringing]

00:39:51.292 --> 00:39:52.750
Someone is calling.

00:39:53.458 --> 00:39:54.958
Wait a minute. Ameer is calling.

00:39:55.625 --> 00:39:57.250
-Hello!
-Kumar?

00:39:57.542 --> 00:39:58.792
Kumar is not available.
Wrong number!

00:39:59.333 --> 00:40:00.250
Wrong number?

00:40:00.333 --> 00:40:03.417
Yes! If you save it as Moorthi,
it'll be the right number.

00:40:03.583 --> 00:40:04.583
Hang up the phone!

00:40:06.042 --> 00:40:08.583
Like Kumar,
his phone is under my control, too.

00:40:08.625 --> 00:40:09.667
Where is Kumar?

00:40:10.833 --> 00:40:11.875
Kumar may be anywhere.

00:40:11.958 --> 00:40:14.667
He may be present everywhere.
That's not important.

00:40:14.750 --> 00:40:15.292
Fool!

00:40:16.167 --> 00:40:17.750
Why so many mediators?

00:40:18.042 --> 00:40:19.958
Mediators are an additional cost.

00:40:20.375 --> 00:40:22.375
It's a loss for the buyer and the seller.

00:40:22.625 --> 00:40:25.083
From now on,
I'll sell you the statue for ₹1 crore.

00:40:25.250 --> 00:40:27.625
You'll profit ₹50 lakhs,
and I'll profit ₹90 lakhs.

00:40:27.708 --> 00:40:29.208
It doesn't matter what happened to Kumar.

00:40:29.333 --> 00:40:32.042
Imagine he disappeared into thin air
or drowned in the sea.

00:40:32.125 --> 00:40:34.000
Or he got abducted by the aliens.

00:40:34.083 --> 00:40:35.375
How does it even matter?

00:40:35.500 --> 00:40:37.792
Focus on timely delivery
and product quality.

00:40:37.958 --> 00:40:39.583
If you're on board, shake hands with me.

00:40:39.708 --> 00:40:40.417
Deal closed!

00:40:40.583 --> 00:40:42.917
If you're not on board,
I'll keep the statue with me.

00:40:43.167 --> 00:40:44.875
The statues are 500 years old.

00:40:44.917 --> 00:40:47.250
I'll sell it next year,
saying it's 501 years old.

00:40:48.042 --> 00:40:49.125
Hey, Moorthi, wait!

00:40:51.458 --> 00:40:54.792
You came, spoke rapidly, and left
without giving me a chance to speak.

00:40:55.167 --> 00:40:57.625
Don't I need a few minutes
to think about it?

00:40:57.917 --> 00:41:00.000
You can even think for 20 years
before I arrived.

00:41:00.083 --> 00:41:04.042
Once I'm involved,
you don't get even a minute to decide.

00:41:04.083 --> 00:41:05.292
You have only 59 seconds.

00:41:05.375 --> 00:41:07.792
You lost that 5 minutes ago, too.
You got it?

00:41:08.125 --> 00:41:09.875
[laughing]

00:41:11.417 --> 00:41:13.000
You're a very sharp man!

00:41:13.792 --> 00:41:16.125
Without my knowledge,
I'm starting to admire you.

00:41:16.583 --> 00:41:17.458
I don't care!

00:41:18.250 --> 00:41:19.875
Fine, I'll buy the statue.
Please sit down.

00:41:20.250 --> 00:41:21.708
Ameer, check the statue.

00:41:26.125 --> 00:41:26.667
Hey!

00:41:28.583 --> 00:41:29.833
Not you, Sir. Please sit down.

00:41:30.500 --> 00:41:32.083
-Yeah, yeah!
-Bring him a tender coconut.

00:41:32.667 --> 00:41:34.958
Oh, get me the ripest one.

00:41:36.417 --> 00:41:38.333
Ripest, indeed. They're bringing it.

00:41:39.292 --> 00:41:41.417
-[sinister music]
-[laughing]

00:41:43.958 --> 00:41:45.083
[water splashes]

00:41:46.083 --> 00:41:47.000
Hey, Driver!

00:41:48.250 --> 00:41:49.417
What are you doing over here?

00:41:49.750 --> 00:41:51.458
Didn't I ask you to wait near the car?

00:41:51.917 --> 00:41:54.542
If I see you cross your limit again...

00:41:54.625 --> 00:41:56.875
Get lost! I'll whack you!

00:42:02.875 --> 00:42:04.833
It's a simple game
and you look confused.

00:42:05.083 --> 00:42:07.208
Use the Elephant to take down the King.

00:42:07.208 --> 00:42:08.542
And finish the game.

00:42:08.917 --> 00:42:11.750
-But it's breaking the rules--
-No, no, I don't follow the rules.

00:42:12.833 --> 00:42:14.583
Please count to check if it's all in there.

00:42:14.625 --> 00:42:15.708
No need. I trust you.

00:42:16.417 --> 00:42:17.917
How could you trust me within a day?

00:42:18.125 --> 00:42:18.917
I don't trust you.

00:42:19.083 --> 00:42:22.625
But I trust in the fear
that no one would dare cheat me.

00:42:22.750 --> 00:42:24.875
I'll meet you next week.
Phew!

00:42:28.125 --> 00:42:28.750
Ameer!

00:42:29.833 --> 00:42:31.792
-How much did you squander?
-₹2 lakhs.

00:42:31.917 --> 00:42:34.167
From now on, squander ₹4 lakhs.

00:42:34.375 --> 00:42:35.375
[lighter flickers]

00:42:37.375 --> 00:42:42.167
Deploy two of our men to check if he's
truly a clown or pretending to be one.

00:42:42.750 --> 00:42:43.875
[in Malayalam] Did you notice his walk?

00:42:46.500 --> 00:42:47.583
It's a super walk!

00:42:48.375 --> 00:42:51.208
He neither picked the elephant
nor did he beat the king.

00:42:51.292 --> 00:42:53.417
But he's confident about it.

00:42:53.792 --> 00:42:56.167
[peppy music]

00:42:57.125 --> 00:43:00.417
Ameer! Next time he's here,
call me without fail.

00:43:00.625 --> 00:43:02.250
He's quite entertaining.

00:43:03.000 --> 00:43:05.375
He's quite an interesting man!

00:43:07.792 --> 00:43:09.125
[puffs out]

00:43:10.208 --> 00:43:14.500
After all these years, I only now realized
I could make tons of money so quickly.

00:43:14.542 --> 00:43:15.042
Fraud!

00:43:16.458 --> 00:43:18.792
I must do something for you in return
for teaching me this technique.

00:43:18.958 --> 00:43:20.917
Do you want ₹1,000?
Or 10 ₹100?

00:43:20.958 --> 00:43:22.958
Or do you want 100 ₹10?
Tell me what you want.

00:43:23.125 --> 00:43:25.208
Sir, I don't want your money.
I'm not interested in money.

00:43:25.375 --> 00:43:26.708
I'm content as long as you're happy.

00:43:26.875 --> 00:43:29.250
Oh, God! Why are you such a good person?

00:43:29.458 --> 00:43:32.542
If I don't do anything in return,
I'll owe you for life.

00:43:32.792 --> 00:43:34.750
Ask anything you want.
You must have some desire.

00:43:34.833 --> 00:43:36.375
It doesn't matter what you desire.

00:43:36.667 --> 00:43:38.375
I don't have much of a desire.

00:43:38.500 --> 00:43:39.625
However, I have a small desire.

00:43:39.875 --> 00:43:41.208
Tell me what it is.

00:43:42.000 --> 00:43:44.625
-Could you please step back?
-Such a small desire?

00:43:45.625 --> 00:43:47.208
-One, two...
-[smacks]

00:43:47.292 --> 00:43:48.333
Oh, no! Arghh!

00:43:50.500 --> 00:43:51.750
[rod clanking]

00:43:52.875 --> 00:43:54.458
He kept stepping on my sandals.

00:43:54.625 --> 00:43:56.250
I was fed up with having
to stitch up my sandals.

00:43:56.500 --> 00:43:58.042
[groans in pain]

00:43:58.417 --> 00:44:01.083
What about him?
He threw water in your face.

00:44:01.292 --> 00:44:01.833
You're right!

00:44:02.542 --> 00:44:04.333
I'm not in the mood now.
I'll handle him later.

00:44:05.000 --> 00:44:06.625
Is it so? Fine, as you wish.

00:44:06.875 --> 00:44:09.167
I'll buy 10 rods and stash them
in different places.

00:44:09.250 --> 00:44:11.250
Whenever you're in the mood,
you pick up the rod and beat them.

00:44:11.792 --> 00:44:12.333
Okay!

00:44:12.417 --> 00:44:15.458
From now on,
I'm THOR, and you're my Mjölnir.

00:44:15.667 --> 00:44:18.417
When I throw, you should finish the job
and get back to my hands.

00:44:18.625 --> 00:44:20.458
You must not go to anyone else
if they try to barge in.

00:44:20.583 --> 00:44:21.500
-Understand?
-Yes, Sir.

00:44:24.292 --> 00:44:26.833
Brother, he's a newbie,
and you're giving him THOR-level treatment.

00:44:26.875 --> 00:44:28.958
-What about me?
-I do have something for you.

00:44:29.042 --> 00:44:31.042
If I'm Harry Potter, you're my mopstick.

00:44:31.167 --> 00:44:33.458
When I place you in the crotch,
you should take me everywhere diligently.

00:44:33.875 --> 00:44:34.417
Go!

00:44:35.792 --> 00:44:37.958
You don't have to thank me.
It's okay.

00:44:38.125 --> 00:44:39.833
Now that you're here,
go ahead and tell me.

00:44:40.458 --> 00:44:41.125
Tell me!

00:44:41.750 --> 00:44:43.917
-I'm going to inform him, Vimal.
-About what?

00:44:46.167 --> 00:44:48.333
[mischievous music]

00:44:49.625 --> 00:44:52.208
-Oh, damn!
-It's hard-earned money.

00:44:52.708 --> 00:44:54.792
Please don't let anyone steal from you.

00:44:56.417 --> 00:44:58.250
Wait! What did a wise poet once say?

00:44:59.708 --> 00:45:01.083
"Work hard, my dear."

00:45:01.417 --> 00:45:04.208
"Also, take a commission
of ₹1 lakh from ₹1 crore."

00:45:04.542 --> 00:45:05.875
He did not quote anything to me.

00:45:06.167 --> 00:45:07.792
[mischievous music continues]

00:45:08.250 --> 00:45:11.208
How come an ordinary driver
can fight with such swagger?

00:45:11.417 --> 00:45:12.708
That's a headshot, bro!

00:45:13.625 --> 00:45:17.208
Uncle, something fishy.
Please take care.

00:45:17.417 --> 00:45:20.125
Hey, don't underestimate a driver.

00:45:20.333 --> 00:45:23.333
Even Elon Musk, who sent a rocket to Mars,
was once a driver.

00:45:23.333 --> 00:45:25.042
Uncle, I was a driver once, too.

00:45:25.250 --> 00:45:28.083
Oh, brother, I forgot about you.

00:45:28.167 --> 00:45:30.750
Hey, bring out the whip.
And tie him to the bench.

00:45:31.167 --> 00:45:32.958
-Uncle?
-To hell with you!

00:45:33.083 --> 00:45:35.167
-[heavy downpour]
-[thundering]

00:45:37.123 --> 00:45:39.289
[foot steps]

00:45:41.258 --> 00:45:43.383
[foot steps]
[faint song playing]

00:45:46.625 --> 00:45:53.037
[Yaakkai Thiri song by A. R. Rahman]

00:45:55.833 --> 00:45:57.208
[opens door]

00:46:00.583 --> 00:46:05.917
[Yaakkai Thiri Song by A. R. Rahman]

00:46:46.667 --> 00:46:48.042
[echoing] Dileep!

00:46:53.042 --> 00:46:54.750
[ominous music]

00:46:55.125 --> 00:46:56.208
How are you, my friend?

00:46:56.458 --> 00:46:58.000
I'm dead, aren't I?

00:46:58.750 --> 00:46:59.750
What do you mean?

00:46:59.917 --> 00:47:00.583
Hey!

00:47:00.667 --> 00:47:02.542
Instead of avenging my death.

00:47:02.542 --> 00:47:05.042
Damn you, you're sleeping peacefully,
cuddling your wife.

00:47:05.083 --> 00:47:06.667
[in Malayalam]
What did I promise you?

00:47:07.167 --> 00:47:09.500
I will find him,
and I'll kill him myself.

00:47:09.542 --> 00:47:11.292
I don't trust you, Dileep.

00:47:12.125 --> 00:47:13.125
[loud smacks]

00:47:15.167 --> 00:47:17.333
[heavy thundering]

00:47:27.750 --> 00:47:29.458
[line ringing]

00:47:30.792 --> 00:47:33.625
Hey, did you guys find him or not?

00:47:34.458 --> 00:47:35.958
I can't sleep in peace.

00:47:36.625 --> 00:47:38.625
Varman has started to haunt me
in my dreams.

00:47:39.458 --> 00:47:41.583
<i>Don't get worked up.</i>
<i>Get back to sleep.</i>

00:47:41.833 --> 00:47:42.667
<i>We'll handle it.</i>

00:47:44.208 --> 00:47:46.292
[somber music]

00:47:50.208 --> 00:47:53.000
They thrashed me
for stealing two bundles of cash.

00:47:53.375 --> 00:47:55.375
They skinned me alive in the hot sun.

00:47:55.542 --> 00:47:57.792
When I'm pissed
for getting skinned by a whip...

00:47:57.958 --> 00:48:00.167
I'm wondering how pissed
you must be for getting stabbed.

00:48:00.417 --> 00:48:02.917
So, my friend,
I have three plans to kill him.

00:48:03.417 --> 00:48:06.083
One, two, and three.

00:48:06.500 --> 00:48:08.708
You pick whichever suits you.

00:48:09.042 --> 00:48:10.458
[car ignition revving]

00:48:10.833 --> 00:48:11.750
[lock clasps]

00:48:13.875 --> 00:48:15.458
Pick one finger.

00:48:16.333 --> 00:48:18.333
I'm feeling pukish.
Could you please open the door?

00:48:18.750 --> 00:48:20.667
It's not a request. It's an order.

00:48:21.125 --> 00:48:23.208
I have never played a three-finger game.

00:48:23.750 --> 00:48:25.708
As you insist, I'll pick a finger.

00:48:26.417 --> 00:48:28.042
[peppy music]

00:48:29.250 --> 00:48:30.208
Ring finger.

00:48:31.875 --> 00:48:32.750
Lorry!

00:48:33.292 --> 00:48:35.958
Sorry! Someone has been feeding you
the wrong information about me.

00:48:36.292 --> 00:48:39.125
Do you think so?
Fine, let's check with them.

00:48:39.167 --> 00:48:40.000
With whom?

00:48:40.417 --> 00:48:42.167
[light taps]

00:48:42.917 --> 00:48:43.917
[screen beeping]

00:48:44.417 --> 00:48:46.042
[phone ringing]

00:48:48.125 --> 00:48:48.667
Brother!

00:48:48.792 --> 00:48:49.875
-Bhaskar!<i>-Yes, Brother.</i>

00:48:49.875 --> 00:48:51.500
What happens
when you touch a ring finger?

00:48:51.833 --> 00:48:53.125
<i>Ring finger means lorry.</i>

00:48:53.292 --> 00:48:55.667
<i>The middle finger means knife.</i>
<i>That, too, is a rusted knife.</i>

00:48:55.958 --> 00:48:57.583
<i>And little finger means poison.</i>

00:48:57.833 --> 00:49:01.375
<i>He is not aware that I'm your guy,</i>
<i>and he's devising a plan to kill you.</i>

00:49:01.583 --> 00:49:04.125
<i>Had he met me out of office, I would've</i>
<i>killed and buried him in the ground.</i>

00:49:04.292 --> 00:49:06.292
<i>One day or another,</i>
<i>I'll be the one to kill him.</i>

00:49:06.833 --> 00:49:08.750
-It's okay, I'll handle him.<i>-Sure, Brother.</i>

00:49:08.875 --> 00:49:09.399
Babaji?

00:49:10.417 --> 00:49:11.833
[music]

00:49:12.667 --> 00:49:13.458
Bhaskar?

00:49:15.333 --> 00:49:16.208
Is he your man?

00:49:18.625 --> 00:49:19.875
Bloody Bhaskar!

00:49:20.292 --> 00:49:21.708
[confused, peppy music]

00:49:22.208 --> 00:49:24.042
Aren't you both enemies?

00:49:26.708 --> 00:49:29.375
What about when you
stabbed him with a crowbar?

00:49:29.500 --> 00:49:32.250
I stabbed him.
But did he really get stabbed?

00:49:32.667 --> 00:49:34.042
He managed to escape.

00:49:34.167 --> 00:49:36.958
When I stab him, he'll escape.
And when he's escaping, I'll stab him.

00:49:37.333 --> 00:49:39.833
-I don't get it.
-It's all about timing.

00:49:40.375 --> 00:49:41.292
[gasps]

00:49:41.458 --> 00:49:42.375
Timing?

00:49:44.375 --> 00:49:46.792
The last time I was deceived
was while watching WWF.

00:49:50.708 --> 00:49:52.125
Actually, I have something to say.

00:49:52.750 --> 00:49:54.042
But you won't believe me.

00:49:54.167 --> 00:49:55.500
I will believe you.
Please tell me.

00:49:56.917 --> 00:49:59.542
I feel like hugging you and crying.

00:50:00.042 --> 00:50:03.000
I want to be your size 8 shoes
on your legs.

00:50:03.208 --> 00:50:05.042
-Also, I would--
-Don't sweat it.

00:50:05.167 --> 00:50:07.042
As long as you don't pull any tricks,
it's enough.

00:50:08.625 --> 00:50:09.417
If you could...

00:50:09.917 --> 00:50:14.042
give me a clue
where else you have your men.

00:50:14.708 --> 00:50:17.375
I will give you a clue
whenever the time is right.

00:50:18.417 --> 00:50:20.417
I have a lot to give you, Vimal.

00:50:20.875 --> 00:50:23.333
<i>♪ Shall we fly to the continent</i>
<i>Across the sea? ♪</i>

00:50:23.458 --> 00:50:25.250
<i>♪ Shall we make ourselves</i>
<i>The controversy? ♪</i>

00:50:25.500 --> 00:50:28.917
<i>♪ Even drenched in rain,</i>
<i>Shall we explode like a country bomb? ♪</i>

00:50:29.000 --> 00:50:32.625
<i>♪ Shall we cross over</i>
<i>To the other side of the river? ♪</i>

00:50:32.750 --> 00:50:36.458
<i>♪ Will it tumble down,</i>
<i>Or soar through the air? ♪</i>

00:50:36.458 --> 00:50:38.208
<i>♪ A league beyond ♪</i>

00:50:38.333 --> 00:50:39.917
<i>♪ A league beyond ♪</i>

00:50:39.958 --> 00:50:41.083
Hey, guys, I'm back!

00:50:42.000 --> 00:50:43.292
<i>♪ A league beyond ♪</i>

00:50:43.417 --> 00:50:44.667
-[marbles clinking]
-[door opens]

00:50:47.375 --> 00:50:48.667
-[man gasping]
-[slits throat]

00:50:48.958 --> 00:50:50.875
Did you find any leads on him yet?

00:50:52.417 --> 00:50:55.417
As your owner started
a new business with Dileep Chetta

00:50:55.667 --> 00:50:58.625
please refer me if they need men for work.

00:50:59.000 --> 00:51:01.042
We do selling and buying.

00:51:01.125 --> 00:51:02.625
-Just like gold.
-What's happening?

00:51:02.667 --> 00:51:05.833
Meet Benjamin. He's offering henchmen
if we're open to hiring them.

00:51:05.958 --> 00:51:07.833
-Oh! I have 10 henchmen, though.
-Is it?

00:51:07.917 --> 00:51:09.667
-I just have to say the word.
-Will they kill people?

00:51:10.250 --> 00:51:11.208
They'll go to sleep.

00:51:12.917 --> 00:51:16.875
Driver, the man we met,
could be a sleeper cell from Dileep's gang.

00:51:17.167 --> 00:51:20.750
He'll infiltrate our gang, learn our
techniques, and build their business.

00:51:21.458 --> 00:51:22.167
Do you think so?

00:51:23.000 --> 00:51:25.250
You're still so naive.

00:51:25.708 --> 00:51:27.208
You're not Elon Musk.

00:51:27.583 --> 00:51:28.583
[loud smack]

00:51:28.833 --> 00:51:30.375
You're Musk Melon.

00:51:31.083 --> 00:51:33.208
Ball! Rubber Ball!

00:51:36.417 --> 00:51:39.375
Can Swetha and Rithvik
go to school as usual?

00:51:40.125 --> 00:51:42.375
Or should I ask them to stay home?

00:51:42.500 --> 00:51:44.708
Keep the routine going.

00:51:45.125 --> 00:51:46.875
If something changes, I'll tell you.

00:51:47.667 --> 00:51:50.292
[pulsating music]

00:52:02.042 --> 00:52:03.625
<i>♪ A league beyond ♪</i>

00:52:03.708 --> 00:52:05.542
<i>♪ A league beyond ♪</i>

00:52:05.792 --> 00:52:07.458
<i>♪ A league beyond ♪</i>

00:52:07.750 --> 00:52:09.958
I hear Abu Dhabi real estate
is cheaper now.

00:52:10.000 --> 00:52:11.958
So, I thought I'd buy a property
in Abu Dhabi rather than Tuticorin.

00:52:12.042 --> 00:52:13.708
-[gasps]
-[horn blaring]

00:52:16.667 --> 00:52:17.667
The bus!

00:52:18.250 --> 00:52:20.167
Can you handle an umbrella as he did?

00:52:21.917 --> 00:52:23.542
But how is a driver so skilled?

00:52:24.583 --> 00:52:26.750
[pulsating music continues]

00:52:31.250 --> 00:52:32.583
A-1 rowdies!

00:52:32.708 --> 00:52:35.375
They are both from Tamil Nadu.
Where are you from?

00:52:36.167 --> 00:52:38.417
[pulsating music continues]

00:52:39.625 --> 00:52:42.458
Listen, if you don't pay me on time

00:52:42.500 --> 00:52:44.583
then I'll come at a random time
and torture you.

00:52:48.542 --> 00:52:51.125
I wonder where he conducts
his concerts every day.

00:52:51.208 --> 00:52:53.500
As if he's going to win Oscars
for his work.

00:52:53.958 --> 00:52:55.083
Sir, please stand straight.

00:52:55.375 --> 00:52:57.208
They might stitch it irregularly.

00:52:57.250 --> 00:52:58.583
<i>I know how to do my job.</i>

00:53:02.208 --> 00:53:04.250
What happened?
Were you able to find him?

00:53:06.750 --> 00:53:08.958
[pulsating music continues]

00:53:19.625 --> 00:53:21.000
Actually, it's a tough game.

00:53:21.292 --> 00:53:22.250
You only have one move left.

00:53:22.375 --> 00:53:24.750
Use the King to defeat another King.
Game over!

00:53:25.542 --> 00:53:27.167
He is interested but doesn't know
how to play the game.

00:53:28.125 --> 00:53:31.917
Ameer, before he figures out
which is King and which is Queen...

00:53:32.208 --> 00:53:33.708
we must find out who he is.

00:53:33.833 --> 00:53:35.583
Hey, check out this girl.

00:53:35.625 --> 00:53:38.583
She's like a doll.
At least now, agree to marry her.

00:53:39.125 --> 00:53:43.042
Hey, old lady, I'm too young
to get married. Don't force me.

00:53:43.083 --> 00:53:44.375
You're as old as her father.

00:53:44.500 --> 00:53:45.542
-What did you say?
-Uncle!

00:53:45.625 --> 00:53:47.875
I'll find out what you muttered
and skin you in the morning.

00:53:48.375 --> 00:53:50.208
[pulsating music continues]

00:53:50.833 --> 00:53:52.500
<i>♪ A league beyond ♪</i>

00:53:52.708 --> 00:53:54.333
<i>♪ A league beyond ♪</i>

00:53:55.833 --> 00:53:56.833
[light screeching halt]

00:54:06.875 --> 00:54:07.375
Sir!

00:54:08.333 --> 00:54:09.042
Sir! Sir!

00:54:10.792 --> 00:54:12.000
Sir, how are you?

00:54:12.500 --> 00:54:13.750
Be well! Be well!

00:54:13.958 --> 00:54:15.208
Sir, do you remember me?

00:54:16.708 --> 00:54:18.542
-I remember you well, Chidambaram.
-Good to hear.

00:54:18.708 --> 00:54:20.625
My daughter, Sir. She's pregnant.

00:54:20.708 --> 00:54:22.417
So I took her to the city hospital.

00:54:22.542 --> 00:54:24.667
We stopped to have a meal.

00:54:24.875 --> 00:54:26.917
I was very happy to see you here.

00:54:27.042 --> 00:54:29.417
-Please bless my daughter, Sir.
-Be well, dear.

00:54:30.333 --> 00:54:32.458
It's been years since I last met you.

00:54:33.500 --> 00:54:34.542
What brings you here?

00:54:34.708 --> 00:54:36.875
I'll explain that later.
Please take care of your daughter.

00:54:39.966 --> 00:54:40.624
Okay, Sir.

00:54:44.667 --> 00:54:48.583
-Oh, God...
-Actually, I'm planning to invest in Dubai.

00:54:48.875 --> 00:54:53.500
Now I'm confused about whether
to invest in Bahrain or locally.

00:54:54.500 --> 00:54:56.917
<i>A few are suggesting retaining the $s.</i>

00:54:57.042 --> 00:54:58.500
<i>And a few suggest converting them to £s.</i>

00:54:58.875 --> 00:55:01.125
<i>People have also suggested</i>
<i>converting to cryptocurrency.</i>

00:55:01.792 --> 00:55:03.583
[ominous music]

00:55:04.458 --> 00:55:06.250
I think her due date is in two months.

00:55:07.417 --> 00:55:09.708
I see her tummy has grown bigger.

00:55:11.167 --> 00:55:14.875
Isn't that man a retired inspector?

00:55:16.833 --> 00:55:17.542
Yes.

00:55:19.042 --> 00:55:19.958
Who are you?

00:55:20.917 --> 00:55:22.625
[ominous music continues]

00:55:23.542 --> 00:55:24.333
I'm a driver.

00:55:26.458 --> 00:55:30.583
When a retired inspector
is seeking blessings from a driver...

00:55:31.917 --> 00:55:32.875
it doesn't add up.

00:55:33.500 --> 00:55:34.333
Am I right?

00:55:35.250 --> 00:55:38.292
So, stop kidding with me.

00:55:38.625 --> 00:55:39.292
Who are you?

00:55:41.250 --> 00:55:43.250
As I mentioned, I'm a driver.

00:55:43.583 --> 00:55:44.750
So, you're not going to reveal yourself.

00:55:45.583 --> 00:55:47.375
-Hey!
-Oh!

00:55:48.000 --> 00:55:50.417
He's not revealing the truth.
What shall we do?

00:55:51.125 --> 00:55:52.875
Why don't we ask them ourselves?

00:55:53.417 --> 00:55:55.167
[ominous music continues]

00:55:56.333 --> 00:56:00.375
They've only been following him for 2 days,
yet they're suspicious of his past.

00:56:00.583 --> 00:56:02.583
-Aren't you suspicious?
-I know everything.

00:56:02.792 --> 00:56:04.542
I know what he did
before he started working for me.

00:56:04.583 --> 00:56:05.667
What was he doing?

00:56:05.833 --> 00:56:07.708
He was a bagboy at the supermarket.

00:56:09.333 --> 00:56:10.333
Bloody fool!

00:56:11.458 --> 00:56:13.458
Greetings, Sir.

00:56:13.792 --> 00:56:16.542
Who's the man
from whom you sought blessings?

00:56:18.542 --> 00:56:20.417
-I don't know him.
-Stop kidding me, Sir.

00:56:20.500 --> 00:56:22.375
Who seeks blessings
from an unknown person?

00:56:22.917 --> 00:56:24.917
So, tell me who that man is.

00:56:25.500 --> 00:56:26.958
I told you I don't know him.

00:56:27.167 --> 00:56:28.750
-I ought to!
-Dad!

00:56:28.875 --> 00:56:31.042
You know to seek blessings from him.

00:56:31.375 --> 00:56:33.625
Damn you!
But you don't know him.

00:56:33.625 --> 00:56:35.333
-Who's that man?
-Let go of my daughter.

00:56:35.500 --> 00:56:38.417
<i>-Get up!</i>
<i>-Better tell me who that man is.</i>

00:56:38.500 --> 00:56:39.625
<i>If you don't tell me...</i>

00:56:39.750 --> 00:56:41.792
<i>-...I'll kill your daughter.</i>
<i>-Stop screaming.</i>

00:56:41.917 --> 00:56:43.042
<i>Hey, tie her up.</i>

00:56:43.417 --> 00:56:45.000
<i>-Tell me who it is?</i>
<i>-I don't know him.</i>

00:56:45.125 --> 00:56:47.000
-Tell me who that man is.
-Dad!

00:56:47.167 --> 00:56:49.958
<i>If you want your daughter to live,</i>
<i>reveal his identity.</i>

00:56:50.000 --> 00:56:51.750
Driver, start the car,
let's leave right away.

00:56:51.917 --> 00:56:55.458
<i>Tell me!</i>
<i>If you still don't tell me, I'll kill her.</i>

00:56:55.583 --> 00:56:58.000
Hey, start the car.
If not, I'll walk home.

00:56:58.208 --> 00:57:00.250
-Please don't harm her.
-Tell me!

00:57:00.375 --> 00:57:01.000
Tell me!

00:57:01.667 --> 00:57:02.750
-Please spare her.
-You won't, will you?

00:57:02.875 --> 00:57:04.542
-Please don't do it.
-Won't you?

00:57:05.208 --> 00:57:07.458
<i>-She's pregnant.</i>
<i>-Beat her.</i>

00:57:09.667 --> 00:57:12.292
-[man screams]
-[whips]

00:57:12.542 --> 00:57:15.000
-[shrilled scream]
-[glasses shatter]

00:57:16.167 --> 00:57:17.833
[man wails]

00:57:18.958 --> 00:57:21.833
-[screaming] Dad!
-[whips]

00:57:23.500 --> 00:57:28.292
<i>♪ Even today and forever ♪</i>

00:57:28.917 --> 00:57:31.833
<i>♪ He reigns as the Thalaivar ♪</i>

00:57:32.208 --> 00:57:33.792
[screaming]

00:57:34.417 --> 00:57:39.542
<i>♪ All eight directions will ignite ♪</i>

00:57:39.917 --> 00:57:44.417
<i>♪ When his name is spoken ♪</i>

00:57:45.625 --> 00:57:50.375
<i>♪ Your name... ♪</i>

00:57:50.875 --> 00:57:55.667
<i>♪ Your name... ♪</i>

00:57:56.042 --> 00:58:01.417
<i>♪ Your name... ♪</i>

00:58:01.792 --> 00:58:06.000
<i>♪ Even today and forever ♪</i>

00:58:07.125 --> 00:58:10.083
<i>♪ He reigns as the Thalaivar ♪</i>

00:58:10.792 --> 00:58:13.375
<i>Hey, please ask him to stop.</i>

00:58:13.583 --> 00:58:15.333
-[screaming]
-[gun loads]

00:58:18.125 --> 00:58:22.792
<i>♪ All eight directions will ignite ♪</i>

00:58:23.500 --> 00:58:27.458
<i>♪ When his name is spoken ♪</i>

00:58:32.708 --> 00:58:33.625
[bullets falling]

00:58:34.708 --> 00:58:35.917
<i>♪ Thalaivan! ♪</i>

00:58:36.917 --> 00:58:39.542
[in Malayalam] Oh, no, my dear, Sir.

00:58:39.583 --> 00:58:41.667
I really don't want to find out
who you are.

00:58:41.875 --> 00:58:43.333
For God's sake, spare me, Sir.

00:58:43.417 --> 00:58:45.583
Forgive me, Sir. Please forgive me.

00:58:47.125 --> 00:58:50.250
Despite the havoc you've caused,
I haven't killed you.

00:58:50.537 --> 00:58:52.496
Rightfully, I should be apologizing.

00:58:53.625 --> 00:58:54.583
Sorry, Dear.

00:58:54.833 --> 00:58:56.333
[cries]

00:58:57.208 --> 00:58:59.458
He kept asking me to reveal my identity.

00:58:59.875 --> 00:59:02.917
Unfortunately,
he died before he knew who I was.

00:59:03.042 --> 00:59:05.083
-I'll reveal it to you now.
-No need, Sir.

00:59:05.292 --> 00:59:06.708
Why don't you
pass on the information to him?

00:59:07.250 --> 00:59:08.500
[heavy panting]

00:59:08.625 --> 00:59:09.875
My name is...

00:59:10.208 --> 00:59:11.625
-[gun loads]
-[stomps]

00:59:12.792 --> 00:59:13.833
Tiger

00:59:14.208 --> 00:59:16.042
Muthuvel Pandian

00:59:16.292 --> 00:59:17.792
[upbeat theme music]

00:59:17.875 --> 00:59:19.500
[continuous gunfire]

00:59:21.917 --> 00:59:24.125
[upbeat theme music continues]

00:59:27.000 --> 00:59:28.000
[pukes vehemently]

00:59:28.042 --> 00:59:30.417
You're puking just watching him in action.

00:59:30.708 --> 00:59:32.667
From now on, he'll make your life hell.

00:59:32.833 --> 00:59:33.667
Take a look.

00:59:35.083 --> 00:59:36.458
[whistling]

00:59:37.042 --> 00:59:38.875
-[continuous gunfire]
-[glasses shatter]

00:59:39.833 --> 00:59:40.750
[grunts]

00:59:41.917 --> 00:59:44.375
If you dare to tell anyone
about what happened at the tea shop...

00:59:44.417 --> 00:59:46.208
you may be alive
to open your mouth to speak.

00:59:46.500 --> 00:59:48.083
But when you're about to speak,
you will be dead.

00:59:49.125 --> 00:59:50.125
Understood?

00:59:51.333 --> 00:59:52.500
[gagging]

00:59:53.333 --> 00:59:54.833
Behaving as if you're pregnant.

00:59:54.958 --> 00:59:56.667
From now on,
if you want to puke, hold it in.

00:59:56.833 --> 00:59:57.958
Rotten fruit!

00:59:58.083 --> 01:00:00.417
Hey, get up!
People might get the wrong idea.

01:00:00.458 --> 01:00:02.042
I had a disturbed sleep.

01:00:02.167 --> 01:00:06.042
I kept hearing explosions in my dream.

01:00:06.250 --> 01:00:08.833
I got a severe headache.
Shall we have some Badam Milk?

01:00:08.958 --> 01:00:10.042
-[projectile vomits]
-Hey!

01:00:11.792 --> 01:00:13.958
-You already had?
-Yes, Moorthi Milk!

01:00:15.933 --> 01:00:17.475
[sinister music]

01:00:18.208 --> 01:00:20.542
Varman's men, Dhanraj and Paneer,

01:00:22.208 --> 01:00:23.708
Why did they go to Hyderabad?

01:00:25.000 --> 01:00:26.792
[sinister music continues]

01:00:28.042 --> 01:00:31.375
When I saw you three,
I knew you guys were big distributors.

01:00:31.500 --> 01:00:34.000
Blast, brother doesn't agree
to sell his film so easily.

01:00:34.125 --> 01:00:36.125
But you're very lucky that he agreed.

01:00:36.208 --> 01:00:39.667
[in Telugu] If you release this film,
you'll be showered with money.

01:00:40.292 --> 01:00:44.583
[Kaavaalaa Song by Anirudh Ravichander]

01:00:46.875 --> 01:00:49.250
Sir, he's in this song.

01:00:49.792 --> 01:00:51.125
That's all I know, Sir.

01:01:00.167 --> 01:01:01.667
[distant barking]

01:01:01.792 --> 01:01:03.833
[chair creaks]

01:01:13.583 --> 01:01:15.667
[chair creaks]

01:01:27.042 --> 01:01:29.083
[squeaking]

01:01:32.583 --> 01:01:34.042
[door creaks]

01:01:35.375 --> 01:01:37.375
-Uncle?
-Hey, Moorthi!

01:01:41.708 --> 01:01:42.708
[gagging]

01:01:44.625 --> 01:01:46.333
[murmurs]

01:01:47.958 --> 01:01:49.958
[door creaks]

01:01:53.458 --> 01:01:55.667
[thrilling music]

01:01:57.750 --> 01:01:58.833
-[thuds]
-[light groans]

01:02:01.875 --> 01:02:03.792
[thrilling music continues]

01:02:11.417 --> 01:02:12.417
[door opens]

01:02:13.875 --> 01:02:14.792
[door closes]

01:02:14.833 --> 01:02:15.708
Come on, drive!

01:02:16.500 --> 01:02:17.458
[gagging]

01:02:17.750 --> 01:02:19.958
[cars revving]
[lights beam]

01:02:22.167 --> 01:02:23.792
-[door opens]
-[villainous music]

01:02:33.583 --> 01:02:36.208
[villainous music continues]

01:02:43.958 --> 01:02:46.667
[villainous music continues]

01:02:50.708 --> 01:02:51.958
[music fades]

01:02:53.917 --> 01:02:56.500
If anyone dares to step out of this ring...

01:02:57.375 --> 01:02:59.167
cut their legs right away.

01:03:02.250 --> 01:03:04.292
[footsteps approaching]

01:03:07.458 --> 01:03:08.458
Aren't you the driver?

01:03:10.083 --> 01:03:11.125
What are you doing over here?

01:03:11.333 --> 01:03:13.333
Didn't ask you to stay by the car?

01:03:13.958 --> 01:03:15.958
Are you trying to become a gangster
by getting beaten by me?

01:03:16.667 --> 01:03:18.292
Go! Stay by the car.

01:03:18.875 --> 01:03:19.417
Okay!

01:03:20.625 --> 01:03:22.708
[gripping music]

01:03:30.958 --> 01:03:32.500
His specialty is...

01:03:33.000 --> 01:03:35.792
whatever problem he causes
won't affect him.

01:03:35.958 --> 01:03:37.292
But it'll affect the people around him.

01:03:37.417 --> 01:03:38.750
How do you know about it?

01:03:39.000 --> 01:03:41.917
I'm the 1st one to be affected by him.

01:03:42.708 --> 01:03:45.833
Think this is a shock?
Wait till you hear the rest.

01:03:45.875 --> 01:03:46.333
What?

01:03:46.417 --> 01:03:49.167
You employed him because
he beat up the municipality, Bhaskar.

01:03:49.917 --> 01:03:52.542
That Bhaskar is his man.

01:03:52.917 --> 01:03:53.625
Oh!

01:03:56.625 --> 01:03:58.458
Uncle, what are you thinking about?

01:03:59.125 --> 01:04:02.625
"Kohli warned me enough. At least once,
I should've listened to him."

01:04:02.833 --> 01:04:04.125
Isn't that what's running on your mind?

01:04:05.500 --> 01:04:07.500
Moron! Come to the center.

01:04:08.667 --> 01:04:09.708
Excuse me!

01:04:11.583 --> 01:04:12.958
Aren't you ashamed?

01:04:14.667 --> 01:04:15.542
Animals!

01:04:17.333 --> 01:04:19.542
[villainous music]

01:04:26.375 --> 01:04:28.542
[footsteps approaching]

01:04:31.500 --> 01:04:35.208
At 01:00 a.m., you were sneaking out
without your men's knowledge

01:04:35.292 --> 01:04:39.750
through the bathroom window.
You must have a solid reason to do it.

01:04:41.917 --> 01:04:42.708
What was the reason?

01:04:43.875 --> 01:04:47.208
You see, I can't trust my men
with the money at home.

01:04:47.542 --> 01:04:50.667
So I always secretly move the money
to a safer place.

01:04:50.708 --> 01:04:52.875
Similarly, I stepped out last night.

01:04:53.208 --> 01:04:57.208
But you never did the same
with the money you made before.

01:04:57.583 --> 01:04:59.083
How do you know?

01:04:59.333 --> 01:05:01.333
The guys who were
following you told me about it.

01:05:01.417 --> 01:05:02.917
Why don't you call them?
I'll ask them the same.

01:05:03.458 --> 01:05:05.292
Those two men are dead now.

01:05:05.583 --> 01:05:07.500
Dead? Who killed them?

01:05:07.708 --> 01:05:09.167
You're the only one who can identify him.

01:05:10.333 --> 01:05:12.875
You're unaware of how your men died.

01:05:13.417 --> 01:05:15.583
How would I know who killed them?

01:05:16.625 --> 01:05:17.167
You would know!

01:05:17.750 --> 01:05:19.375
-[whiplash]
-[men groan in pain]

01:05:19.458 --> 01:05:21.375
Beat him! Beat everyone!

01:05:21.542 --> 01:05:23.042
He's trying to escape.
Catch him!

01:05:23.083 --> 01:05:25.167
Hey, he's stepping out of the circle.

01:05:25.833 --> 01:05:27.542
Whip him! Skin him!

01:05:28.167 --> 01:05:30.167
-[continuous whiplash]
-[men wincing]

01:05:32.250 --> 01:05:33.917
Hey, take a break, damn it!

01:05:35.667 --> 01:05:37.000
Don't spare them!

01:05:37.458 --> 01:05:38.667
[tires screeches]

01:05:42.500 --> 01:05:44.208
[ominous music]

01:05:47.167 --> 01:05:48.000
How can I help you, Sir?

01:05:49.833 --> 01:05:50.833
I want to meet this person.

01:05:51.708 --> 01:05:53.833
Is it, Muthu, Sir? He looks dapper!

01:05:54.625 --> 01:05:56.417
Are you Muthu, sir's friend?

01:05:58.833 --> 01:06:00.917
-[continuous whiplash]
-[men wincing]

01:06:04.667 --> 01:06:06.458
I'll reveal his identity. I will!

01:06:06.542 --> 01:06:07.958
I will reveal his identity.
Please don't hit me.

01:06:09.458 --> 01:06:11.833
I will reveal his identity.
Please don't hit me.

01:06:12.167 --> 01:06:14.583
<i>Please don't hit me.</i>
<i>I'll reveal his identity.</i>

01:06:15.958 --> 01:06:19.292
You let the passengers get beaten,
but you still clean the car.

01:06:20.167 --> 01:06:22.583
Clean! Clean it well!

01:06:23.292 --> 01:06:25.958
We'll carry Moorthi's remains in that car.

01:06:27.667 --> 01:06:29.292
Keep it shining.

01:06:30.583 --> 01:06:33.667
-Moorthi!
-You're finally here.

01:06:35.792 --> 01:06:38.167
Are you going to confess
out of fear of being whipped?

01:06:38.708 --> 01:06:40.583
Did you forget the gun you saw
inside the car?

01:06:42.375 --> 01:06:45.917
But two more dangerous items
are inside the car.

01:06:47.375 --> 01:06:48.167
Is that so?

01:06:48.958 --> 01:06:50.750
Shall I lie to them?

01:06:51.125 --> 01:06:52.250
Right away!

01:06:53.083 --> 01:06:53.667
Lie!

01:06:56.292 --> 01:06:58.132
Here he comes. Tell him.

01:06:58.917 --> 01:07:00.250
I will tell him!

01:07:00.958 --> 01:07:02.792
-Tell me.
-I killed them!

01:07:03.333 --> 01:07:04.625
[comical music]

01:07:05.417 --> 01:07:08.917
With a knife in my hand,
I brutally stabbed them to death.

01:07:11.000 --> 01:07:12.458
I told you to lie.

01:07:13.625 --> 01:07:14.958
But you got caught lying.

01:07:16.250 --> 01:07:18.917
Rest in peace, Moorthi.

01:07:20.042 --> 01:07:20.652
Get up!

01:07:22.042 --> 01:07:23.167
[groans]

01:07:27.807 --> 01:07:28.296
Hold this!

01:07:29.250 --> 01:07:29.750
Hold it!

01:07:30.792 --> 01:07:31.500
Hold, damn it!

01:07:33.625 --> 01:07:36.292
Stab me just like you stabbed them.

01:07:38.208 --> 01:07:39.000
Stab me!

01:07:40.583 --> 01:07:41.500
Stab me!

01:07:42.205 --> 01:07:43.500
[comical music continues]

01:07:44.583 --> 01:07:45.417
Stab me!

01:07:46.958 --> 01:07:48.542
-Stab me!
-Hey!

01:07:48.750 --> 01:07:49.750
[gasps]

01:07:50.875 --> 01:07:52.208
Why are you blocking me?

01:07:52.542 --> 01:07:55.875
When you were about to stab him,
he would've blocked you, right?

01:07:56.375 --> 01:07:59.083
He would've blocked you first,
then grabbed you.

01:08:01.125 --> 01:08:02.500
After that,
he would've hung you upside down.

01:08:02.917 --> 01:08:04.583
[pants]

01:08:05.333 --> 01:08:07.417
-[loud thud]
-Finally, slammed you on the ground.

01:08:07.917 --> 01:08:09.750
This time I'll tell you the actual truth.

01:08:09.917 --> 01:08:11.458
I will tell you the actual truth.

01:08:11.583 --> 01:08:13.167
I will not lie anymore.

01:08:14.083 --> 01:08:16.625
I know.
I know that you did not kill them.

01:08:17.292 --> 01:08:19.375
But someone else killed them.

01:08:20.083 --> 01:08:22.000
And you were a witness to their killings.

01:08:23.500 --> 01:08:24.417
Who is he?

01:08:25.792 --> 01:08:26.458
Tell me.

01:08:28.208 --> 01:08:30.500
Tell me, Moorthi. Come on!

01:08:36.000 --> 01:08:38.583
I did witness it.
But he was wearing a helmet.

01:08:38.667 --> 01:08:39.792
He's dead meat!

01:08:40.625 --> 01:08:42.708
[comical music continues]

01:08:44.417 --> 01:08:45.542
[light screams]

01:08:46.667 --> 01:08:49.958
Why are you getting so angry?

01:08:52.917 --> 01:08:54.292
[yells]

01:08:54.333 --> 01:08:55.708
[phone ringing]

01:08:56.583 --> 01:08:57.750
[loud thuds]

01:09:00.268 --> 01:09:02.518
[heavy panting]

01:09:04.292 --> 01:09:05.417
[cries in pain]

01:09:05.500 --> 01:09:07.083
-Tell me.<i>-Listen, Dileep!</i>

01:09:07.542 --> 01:09:10.542
Important matter. We got a picture
of the man who killed Varman.

01:09:11.125 --> 01:09:12.792
But the crucial part of it is...

01:09:13.083 --> 01:09:15.958
he did not go into hiding
after killing Varman.

01:09:16.333 --> 01:09:18.292
He's on his way to kill you next.

01:09:19.042 --> 01:09:19.958
What do you mean?

01:09:20.167 --> 01:09:22.583
I'm telling the truth.
Only his family lives in Tamil Nadu.

01:09:22.708 --> 01:09:24.833
But I hear he visits Kerala often.

01:09:25.042 --> 01:09:26.042
Send me his picture.

01:09:26.417 --> 01:09:28.167
I'll ask my men to look for him.

01:09:28.333 --> 01:09:30.708
I'm sending it right away.
You better be cautious.

01:09:31.000 --> 01:09:32.542
-Step out in private and check.
-Okay.

01:09:34.125 --> 01:09:35.583
[message tone]

01:09:39.375 --> 01:09:41.833
[suspenseful music]

01:09:48.250 --> 01:09:49.792
[water swishing]

01:09:53.667 --> 01:09:55.833
[enthralling music]

01:10:06.958 --> 01:10:09.792
[enthralling music continues]

01:10:22.208 --> 01:10:24.833
[upbeat theme music]

01:10:35.042 --> 01:10:36.208
[puffs out]

01:10:36.667 --> 01:10:38.333
Moorthi, please forgive me.

01:10:38.500 --> 01:10:40.208
You have nothing to do with this matter.

01:10:40.292 --> 01:10:42.292
It'll be a mistake if I suspect you.

01:10:42.875 --> 01:10:43.917
Sorry, Moorthi.

01:10:45.292 --> 01:10:47.458
I must do something to make you happy.

01:10:48.125 --> 01:10:49.292
What shall I do for you?

01:10:50.292 --> 01:10:51.375
Do you like women?

01:10:51.917 --> 01:10:54.375
I do! But not today.

01:10:54.667 --> 01:10:56.958
-Why?
-My whole body hurts!

01:10:58.292 --> 01:11:00.292
They will fix you right up.

01:11:00.417 --> 01:11:02.167
You enjoy yourself!

01:11:03.125 --> 01:11:04.000
Nice guy!

01:11:05.000 --> 01:11:05.728
[upbeat music]

01:11:05.753 --> 01:11:08.521
[Ala Bolelo song]

01:11:56.958 --> 01:12:00.292
<i>♪ Have you come seeking the bliss</i>
<i>That only music can bring? ♪</i>

01:12:00.292 --> 01:12:01.167
<i>♪ What's up, Mate? ♪</i>

01:12:01.208 --> 01:12:04.917
<i>♪ Did you come searching every day? ♪</i>

01:12:05.042 --> 01:12:08.500
<i>♪ Are you leaving</i>
<i>With the meaning hidden in my eyes? ♪</i>

01:12:08.542 --> 01:12:09.250
<i>♪ Nailed it! ♪</i>

01:12:09.333 --> 01:12:12.042
<i>♪ Did you wander in search of poetry? ♪</i>

01:12:13.417 --> 01:12:15.292
<i>♪ Let not youth ever fade ♪</i>

01:12:15.417 --> 01:12:17.292
<i>♪ Let hunger never cease ♪</i>

01:12:17.417 --> 01:12:19.833
<i>♪ Let every day burn on, tireless ♪</i>

01:12:20.125 --> 01:12:21.083
<i>♪ Oh my!!! ♪</i>

01:12:21.167 --> 01:12:24.542
<i>♪ Have you come seeking the bliss</i>
<i>That only music can bring? ♪</i>

01:12:24.583 --> 01:12:25.375
<i>♪ What's up, Mate? ♪</i>

01:12:25.458 --> 01:12:28.833
<i>♪ Did you come searching every day? ♪</i>

01:13:14.875 --> 01:13:15.875
<i>♪ Fantastic! ♪</i>

01:13:30.042 --> 01:13:31.708
<i>♪ My love, run with all your heart… ♪</i>

01:13:32.083 --> 01:13:33.708
<i>♪ Wandering there,</i>
<i>Searching endlessly… ♪</i>

01:13:34.083 --> 01:13:36.875
<i>♪ Will beauty wither away? ♪</i>

01:13:38.125 --> 01:13:39.833
<i>♪ Here, blossoming into a garden… ♪</i>

01:13:40.167 --> 01:13:41.792
<i>♪ As the night falls ♪</i>

01:13:42.167 --> 01:13:44.958
<i>♪ Youth turns sweeter than honey ♪</i>

01:13:45.208 --> 01:13:49.083
<i>♪ O sandalwood maiden,</i>
<i>I lose myself in thoughts of you ♪</i>

01:13:49.250 --> 01:13:52.833
<i>♪ O moon-eyed one, my companion,</i>
<i>Beautiful one, come to me! ♪</i>

01:13:53.083 --> 01:13:57.083
<i>♪ Once a lonely maiden,</i>
<i>I’ve blossomed into moonlight ♪</i>

01:13:57.167 --> 01:14:01.125
<i>♪ Be my companion for life</i>
<i>O Master of tricks ♪</i>

01:14:01.292 --> 01:14:02.000
<i>♪ Here I come! ♪</i>

01:14:10.083 --> 01:14:13.333
<i>♪ Have you come seeking the bliss</i>
<i>That only music can bring? ♪</i>

01:14:13.375 --> 01:14:14.083
<i>♪ What's up, Mate? ♪</i>

01:14:14.292 --> 01:14:17.958
<i>♪ Did you come searching every day? ♪</i>

01:14:18.125 --> 01:14:21.667
<i>♪ Are you leaving</i>
<i>With the meaning hidden in my eyes? ♪</i>

01:14:21.667 --> 01:14:22.375
<i>♪ Nailed it! ♪</i>

01:14:22.458 --> 01:14:25.208
<i>♪ Did you wander in search of poetry? ♪</i>

01:14:26.417 --> 01:14:28.417
<i>♪ Let not youth ever fade ♪</i>

01:14:28.542 --> 01:14:30.375
<i>♪ Let hunger never cease ♪</i>

01:14:30.458 --> 01:14:32.833
<i>♪ Let every day burn on, tireless ♪</i>

01:14:33.208 --> 01:14:34.208
<i>♪ Oh my!!! ♪</i>

01:14:34.250 --> 01:14:37.500
<i>♪ Have you come seeking the bliss</i>
<i>That only music can bring? ♪</i>

01:14:37.500 --> 01:14:38.333
<i>♪ What's up, Son? ♪</i>

01:14:38.500 --> 01:14:41.417
<i>♪ Did you come searching every day? ♪</i>

01:14:59.083 --> 01:15:00.042
[gun fires]

01:15:01.167 --> 01:15:02.167
[thuds]

01:15:02.417 --> 01:15:03.958
[all screams]

01:15:04.500 --> 01:15:06.542
-Hello!
-We're entering his house.

01:15:07.125 --> 01:15:08.375
You lock him over there.

01:15:08.583 --> 01:15:11.042
Until I say the word,
don't do anything to his family.

01:15:11.250 --> 01:15:12.333
Wait for my call.

01:15:13.375 --> 01:15:14.375
[microphone feedback]

01:15:14.667 --> 01:15:17.500
Everyone had fun dancing.
It's enough!

01:15:17.875 --> 01:15:19.750
Now I have a serious
announcement to make.

01:15:20.083 --> 01:15:24.708
My friend Varman's killer was
dancing with us in this crowd.

01:15:25.292 --> 01:15:28.167
Only the killer should be left
standing out there.

01:15:28.375 --> 01:15:31.500
People unrelated to Varman's death
must move to the other side.

01:15:31.625 --> 01:15:32.625
[gun fires]

01:15:33.125 --> 01:15:34.958
[all yelling]

01:15:36.667 --> 01:15:38.667
[dramatic music]

01:15:41.542 --> 01:15:42.542
[flickers]

01:15:45.667 --> 01:15:48.292
Ameer, close all the doors.

01:15:48.833 --> 01:15:50.958
No one should exit or enter.

01:15:52.375 --> 01:15:54.625
[dramatic music continues]

01:15:59.417 --> 01:16:02.250
-Brother, is there a problem?
-Nothing to worry about.

01:16:04.167 --> 01:16:06.625
[dramatic music continues]

01:16:09.208 --> 01:16:11.792
Hey, Driver, didn't you hear him?

01:16:11.958 --> 01:16:13.042
Move to this side.

01:16:13.167 --> 01:16:14.667
They might shoot you dead.

01:16:14.750 --> 01:16:16.333
Damn you!
Always in the wrong place.

01:16:17.500 --> 01:16:19.500
Isn't Varman's killer
supposed to stand out here?

01:16:19.542 --> 01:16:20.583
That's why I'm standing out here.

01:16:20.875 --> 01:16:22.875
Because I killed Varman.

01:16:23.167 --> 01:16:24.917
Did you kill Varman?

01:16:25.333 --> 01:16:26.042
Yes!

01:16:27.458 --> 01:16:29.167
Uncle, he's confusing me.

01:16:30.208 --> 01:16:31.792
-[kicks]
-[groans]

01:16:32.000 --> 01:16:32.708
I ought to!

01:16:33.250 --> 01:16:34.750
What's so confusing about it?

01:16:35.042 --> 01:16:36.167
-Damn you!
-Honey!

01:16:38.125 --> 01:16:39.417
My brother is innocent.

01:16:40.375 --> 01:16:41.917
[heaving]

01:16:45.917 --> 01:16:46.917
One minute!

01:16:47.750 --> 01:16:49.292
I did not kill Varman in vain.

01:16:49.375 --> 01:16:51.292
I tried explaining to him.
But he didn't listen.

01:16:51.958 --> 01:16:52.756
So, I killed him!

01:16:53.250 --> 01:16:54.542
Actually, I was cornered!

01:16:54.792 --> 01:16:55.958
How about you?

01:16:56.708 --> 01:16:58.042
Would you listen to me?

01:16:58.792 --> 01:17:00.583
[pulsating music]

01:17:02.292 --> 01:17:03.292
What's this nonsense?

01:17:03.417 --> 01:17:05.375
How dare he kill our people,
yet he's alive?

01:17:05.417 --> 01:17:06.917
[in Malayalam] And you're silent about it.

01:17:07.958 --> 01:17:08.485
Hey!

01:17:10.000 --> 01:17:11.500
If you step forward...

01:17:11.833 --> 01:17:15.875
and before you could get near him,
a bullet would splatter your brain.

01:17:17.250 --> 01:17:20.625
Despite being surrounded by our men,
he stands there unthreatened.

01:17:23.292 --> 01:17:26.083
That means he already has a backup.

01:17:28.042 --> 01:17:31.042
Hey, pull down all curtains.

01:17:31.250 --> 01:17:33.208
[machine whirring]

01:17:34.917 --> 01:17:37.250
[loud unfurling]

01:17:42.125 --> 01:17:44.833
Now speak to him.
He'll speak in a different tone.

01:17:45.458 --> 01:17:48.458
Chetta, you have misunderstood me.

01:17:48.542 --> 01:17:51.042
I don't have to be here to kill you.

01:17:51.250 --> 01:17:52.833
Only a bullet would've made it here.

01:17:52.958 --> 01:17:55.958
If you may ask
why I haven't killed you yet...

01:17:56.792 --> 01:17:57.875
I need a favor.

01:17:58.208 --> 01:17:59.375
[thundering]

01:17:59.625 --> 01:18:01.583
Favor? What kind of favor?

01:18:01.917 --> 01:18:03.667
I reckon you have a Boss.

01:18:03.917 --> 01:18:05.917
Do you want to meet him?

01:18:07.208 --> 01:18:08.042
I want to kill him!

01:18:08.458 --> 01:18:09.875
[laughs]

01:18:10.583 --> 01:18:12.458
Are you serious? You want to kill him?

01:18:12.542 --> 01:18:13.417
[chuckles]

01:18:13.542 --> 01:18:16.625
Hey! Do you even know his name?

01:18:18.208 --> 01:18:19.500
Fine, I'll tell you his name.

01:18:20.000 --> 01:18:22.625
Bodhi! Bodhi Kalpak!

01:18:23.000 --> 01:18:25.000
Is there anyone above him?

01:18:26.042 --> 01:18:27.833
He's above everyone!

01:18:28.542 --> 01:18:30.792
Everyone else is below him.

01:18:31.750 --> 01:18:34.208
There's a classic idea
for killing these powerful people.

01:18:34.417 --> 01:18:35.458
It's an age-old trick.

01:18:35.750 --> 01:18:37.917
Stab them in the back
with one of their own.

01:18:38.292 --> 01:18:39.667
Just as Brutus did.

01:18:41.208 --> 01:18:43.542
Who is Brutus?

01:18:43.958 --> 01:18:46.833
The man who stabbed
Julius Caesar in the Senate.

01:18:47.333 --> 01:18:48.792
Haven't you read Roman history?

01:18:49.292 --> 01:18:52.625
Similarly,
the Brutus who's going to kill your Boss...

01:18:53.583 --> 01:18:54.208
...is you!

01:18:55.292 --> 01:18:56.833
[nervously chuckles]

01:18:57.125 --> 01:18:58.667
[all chuckle]

01:19:01.083 --> 01:19:03.208
Hey, drag him here.

01:19:03.542 --> 01:19:05.917
Like I mentioned,
we don't have to fear him.

01:19:06.208 --> 01:19:08.500
If a cat is caught alone inside a room

01:19:08.583 --> 01:19:12.583
it'll pretend to be a tiger to escape.

01:19:13.917 --> 01:19:15.875
He's doing the same.

01:19:16.000 --> 01:19:16.875
Hey, let's go!

01:19:18.125 --> 01:19:21.083
When I’m talking seriously,
don’t joke around.

01:19:21.125 --> 01:19:22.125
[sniper fires]

01:19:22.417 --> 01:19:24.167
Hey, how did it happen?
The windows are closed.

01:19:24.250 --> 01:19:26.583
How are they shooting?
Check around.

01:19:26.750 --> 01:19:27.917
Someone has entered.

01:19:28.625 --> 01:19:29.792
[loud thud]

01:19:30.083 --> 01:19:31.292
[guns load]

01:19:31.875 --> 01:19:33.417
[thrilling music]

01:19:34.167 --> 01:19:36.792
See, if you kill your Boss,
my family will be safe.

01:19:37.208 --> 01:19:39.167
That means
I don't have to kill your family.

01:19:39.375 --> 01:19:40.292
So, your family is safe too.

01:19:40.875 --> 01:19:44.167
Basically, we're doing it
to save our families.

01:19:45.125 --> 01:19:46.875
I think it's a fair deal, Chetta.

01:19:48.083 --> 01:19:49.417
Hey, he's the shooter!

01:19:50.375 --> 01:19:51.375
[gun fires]

01:19:51.792 --> 01:19:53.667
Hey, where is it coming from?

01:19:54.750 --> 01:19:55.458
Oh, you!

01:19:56.375 --> 01:19:58.375
Hey, why are our men
shooting at each other?

01:19:58.542 --> 01:20:01.250
Who did you get it from?
What did you sell us?

01:20:01.458 --> 01:20:03.458
I'm calling that guy.

01:20:03.958 --> 01:20:04.958
[gun fires]

01:20:05.292 --> 01:20:06.500
Hey, who's shooting?

01:20:06.667 --> 01:20:09.125
-Hurry up! Did he answer the call?
-He's not answering.

01:20:09.250 --> 01:20:10.875
-Look for yourself.
-Hey, panhead!

01:20:11.625 --> 01:20:13.250
Did you hire men from him?

01:20:15.083 --> 01:20:17.583
-Do you know him?
-Yes, my colleague.

01:20:17.833 --> 01:20:19.417
We work together.

01:20:19.875 --> 01:20:21.625
Is it? Who do you work for?

01:20:21.875 --> 01:20:23.500
There he stands, our MD.

01:20:24.083 --> 01:20:26.625
Mr. Tiger Muthuvel Pandian.

01:20:26.875 --> 01:20:29.333
[enigmatic music]

01:20:30.208 --> 01:20:31.208
[sniper fires]

01:20:38.708 --> 01:20:39.708
[metal thuds]

01:20:39.833 --> 01:20:42.167
Sir, you've been standing for a long time.

01:20:42.458 --> 01:20:43.542
Please sit down and talk.

01:20:43.583 --> 01:20:45.208
Hey, Jinju!

01:20:46.500 --> 01:20:49.667
You’re truly smart
when you know who’s stronger.

01:20:49.833 --> 01:20:52.625
We don't need more evidence
to prove he's the strongest.

01:20:53.000 --> 01:20:54.375
So, I'm joining hands with him.

01:20:54.500 --> 01:20:55.625
You too can join him.

01:20:56.667 --> 01:20:58.250
Brother, who the hell is he?

01:20:58.458 --> 01:21:00.458
Just because he stationed men
doesn't mean we have to be afraid.

01:21:00.792 --> 01:21:03.250
Say the word.
I'll lay my life for you.

01:21:03.458 --> 01:21:05.167
I want to see what he could do.

01:21:05.500 --> 01:21:07.875
Brother, I don't care for my life.

01:21:08.000 --> 01:21:09.792
I won't rest until I kill him.

01:21:10.333 --> 01:21:11.333
[gun clicks]

01:21:12.417 --> 01:21:14.333
Hey, you heard him.

01:21:15.042 --> 01:21:19.083
Just because you set up a couple of snipers
doesn't mean you can finish me for good.

01:21:19.708 --> 01:21:23.417
Do you know
how many here would die for me?

01:21:23.708 --> 01:21:25.208
Oh, no, I'm not aware!

01:21:25.875 --> 01:21:27.292
Shall we test your theory?

01:21:29.333 --> 01:21:32.292
Boys! On the count of three.

01:21:32.458 --> 01:21:33.458
[thundering]

01:21:33.708 --> 01:21:34.417
Three

01:21:36.250 --> 01:21:36.917
Two

01:21:39.458 --> 01:21:40.167
One!

01:21:40.708 --> 01:21:42.292
[suspenseful music builds]

01:21:43.625 --> 01:21:44.292
Go!

01:21:44.458 --> 01:21:45.458
[multiple snipers fire]

01:21:46.500 --> 01:21:48.667
<i>♪ He’s witnessed your dirty game ♪</i>

01:21:50.917 --> 01:21:53.375
<i>♪ He's familiar with your father's game ♪</i>

01:21:56.125 --> 01:22:02.375
<i>♪ Oh… he’s the one</i>
<i>Who makes generations dance to his tune! ♪</i>

01:22:02.458 --> 01:22:05.292
<i>♪ A few may try to tarnish his name ♪</i>

01:22:05.333 --> 01:22:07.625
<i>♪ A hundred may try to snatch his crown ♪</i>

01:22:07.708 --> 01:22:10.083
<i>♪ Look over that wall ♪</i>

01:22:10.208 --> 01:22:12.500
<i>♪ millions will rise to show their love! ♪</i>

01:22:12.875 --> 01:22:15.042
[upbeat theme music]

01:22:20.833 --> 01:22:22.417
[smacks]
[bones crumble]

01:22:23.708 --> 01:22:25.417
[heavy panting]

01:22:27.458 --> 01:22:31.667
Hey, while focusing on my family,
you forgot about yours.

01:22:31.875 --> 01:22:34.417
I'll get to you.
I'll use a different technique to get you.

01:22:35.125 --> 01:22:36.750
[thundering]

01:22:38.083 --> 01:22:41.333
Hey, kill the three people out there.

01:22:41.625 --> 01:22:44.167
<i>Brother, we killed the three people.</i>

01:22:45.167 --> 01:22:46.167
[baffling music]

01:22:46.292 --> 01:22:47.125
Who are you?

01:22:50.250 --> 01:22:52.750
[suspenseful music builds]

01:22:59.667 --> 01:23:02.708
[upbeat theme music]

01:23:16.583 --> 01:23:19.167
Brother, please inform Sir of this.

01:23:19.292 --> 01:23:21.000
The food at home is over.

01:23:21.292 --> 01:23:23.083
Ask him to eat at a hotel.

01:23:23.917 --> 01:23:25.958
[thrilling music]

01:23:28.042 --> 01:23:30.167
Until now,
I was asking you as a request.

01:23:30.833 --> 01:23:31.750
But you didn't respond well.

01:23:34.083 --> 01:23:35.458
Now, it's an order!

01:23:35.833 --> 01:23:37.042
You must do it!

01:23:37.875 --> 01:23:38.750
Hukkum!

01:23:38.875 --> 01:23:40.083
[gun fires]

01:23:42.500 --> 01:23:44.333
Tiger Ka Hukkum!

01:23:46.042 --> 01:23:48.375
[upbeat theme music]

01:24:03.917 --> 01:24:05.917
<i>♪ He’s witnessed your dirty game ♪</i>

01:24:06.083 --> 01:24:08.375
<i>♪ He's familiar with your father's game ♪</i>

01:24:08.667 --> 01:24:12.833
<i>♪ Oh… he’s the one</i>
<i>Who makes generations dance to his tune! ♪</i>

01:24:12.917 --> 01:24:15.500
<i>♪ A few may try to tarnish his name ♪</i>

01:24:15.667 --> 01:24:17.917
<i>♪ A hundred may try to snatch his crown ♪</i>

01:24:18.083 --> 01:24:20.542
<i>♪ Look over that wall ♪</i>

01:24:20.667 --> 01:24:22.833
<i>♪ millions will rise to show their love! ♪</i>

01:24:23.083 --> 01:24:25.375
<i>♪ Watch Thalaivar unleash the chaos! ♪</i>

01:24:27.875 --> 01:24:30.792
<i>♪ Thalaivar forever ♪</i>

01:24:31.000 --> 01:24:32.500
<i>♪ Tiger Ka Hukkum! ♪</i>

01:24:41.292 --> 01:24:43.083
Do we have to do this, Dileep?

01:24:44.833 --> 01:24:46.167
I'm scared to do it too.

01:24:46.917 --> 01:24:49.667
But I don't see another way around it.

01:24:50.667 --> 01:24:53.250
We'll move up a notch in life, too.

01:24:54.000 --> 01:24:54.875
However,

01:24:55.625 --> 01:24:57.667
if we mess up this plan

01:24:58.750 --> 01:25:00.083
we'll be dead for good.

01:25:01.875 --> 01:25:04.250
So ask our boys to be very careful.

01:25:07.875 --> 01:25:08.875
[car honking]

01:25:09.958 --> 01:25:11.792
[car revs]

01:25:13.417 --> 01:25:15.750
[groovy music]

01:25:26.375 --> 01:25:28.375
[groovy music continues]

01:25:38.250 --> 01:25:40.667
[groovy music continues]

01:25:50.625 --> 01:25:54.208
Freddy, remember you asked me, no matter
who it is, they come to Goa to meet you.

01:25:54.292 --> 01:25:56.000
But why are you coming over to meet him?

01:25:57.125 --> 01:25:58.875
The only reason is this hotel.

01:25:59.750 --> 01:26:02.458
I've tasted food from around the world,
but nothing beats this taste.

01:26:02.667 --> 01:26:03.292
Serve.

01:26:04.208 --> 01:26:05.042
Pour some gravy.

01:26:06.542 --> 01:26:10.625
What I'm about to do
may be ethically wrong.

01:26:12.500 --> 01:26:14.208
Shall we discuss after I take a bite?

01:26:16.208 --> 01:26:16.792
Okay.

01:26:25.708 --> 01:26:28.083
But this time, only if I'm selfish,
it's good for me

01:26:30.292 --> 01:26:32.000
So I don't have any other options left.

01:26:33.625 --> 01:26:34.542
Please forgive me.

01:26:37.792 --> 01:26:39.000
-[slams]
-[commotion]

01:26:39.083 --> 01:26:40.917
Hey, Freddy, sit down.

01:26:41.000 --> 01:26:43.375
I've told you countless times
not to leave the table while eating.

01:26:44.042 --> 01:26:46.208
[gripping music]

01:26:48.250 --> 01:26:49.500
Are all of them your men?

01:26:50.125 --> 01:26:51.125
[bullet whooshing]

01:26:51.250 --> 01:26:52.583
Hey! Hey! Hey!

01:26:53.542 --> 01:26:55.333
Can only the Jailer set up snipers?

01:26:55.417 --> 01:26:56.667
Why wouldn't I?

01:26:58.542 --> 01:27:01.667
[multiple guns firing]
-[men groaning]

01:27:03.958 --> 01:27:05.333
[metal clangs]

01:27:07.250 --> 01:27:09.625
[gripping music continues]

01:27:11.750 --> 01:27:13.917
Do you know why
was he loyal to you all these years?

01:27:14.542 --> 01:27:16.250
It's because I asked him to.

01:27:16.958 --> 01:27:18.167
[screams]

01:27:19.042 --> 01:27:20.042
[slashes]

01:27:21.333 --> 01:27:23.458
[blood spurts]

01:27:25.708 --> 01:27:26.708
[thuds]

01:27:29.375 --> 01:27:31.542
As long as you wish to sit in that chair...

01:27:31.708 --> 01:27:33.458
no matter what happens,
I'll stand by you.

01:27:33.792 --> 01:27:36.417
But if you wish to take my place...

01:27:36.792 --> 01:27:39.125
then there'll be another person
who will take you out.

01:27:39.542 --> 01:27:40.167
Understand?

01:27:42.833 --> 01:27:44.042
Shall we meet the Jailer?

01:27:45.625 --> 01:27:47.750
-Get takeaway.
-Okay.

01:27:55.917 --> 01:27:58.000
[fan buzzing]

01:28:00.833 --> 01:28:02.792
[tires screeching]

01:28:08.208 --> 01:28:09.500
[groans in pain]

01:28:12.083 --> 01:28:16.333
Kantha, you ordered the chocolate
flavor last year, and Dad didn’t like it.

01:28:16.417 --> 01:28:19.625
And you guys pinned the blame on me.

01:28:20.292 --> 01:28:22.208
[wood creaking]

01:28:24.042 --> 01:28:28.417
Also, Ved mentioned that he shortlisted
3 event management companies.

01:28:28.875 --> 01:28:31.833
Meet with them to determine
who best fits our needs.

01:28:33.875 --> 01:28:34.875
[dish clangs]

01:28:37.375 --> 01:28:38.708
I'll be home by evening.

01:28:39.375 --> 01:28:40.375
We'll discuss it then.

01:28:45.167 --> 01:28:45.917
Sir...

01:28:47.583 --> 01:28:48.708
Whom do you want to meet?

01:28:49.125 --> 01:28:50.125
[cloche clangs]

01:28:52.958 --> 01:28:54.375
[chilling music]

01:28:57.417 --> 01:28:58.417
[gagging]

01:28:59.958 --> 01:29:00.625
Hey!

01:29:04.042 --> 01:29:04.625
Sir!

01:29:05.125 --> 01:29:05.875
Jailer, Sir!

01:29:06.417 --> 01:29:07.083
Please come!

01:29:09.167 --> 01:29:10.917
Jailer has arrived.

01:29:11.125 --> 01:29:12.292
I'll call you back!

01:29:13.042 --> 01:29:14.542
[dramatic music]

01:29:15.250 --> 01:29:16.292
-Hello, Sir.
-Hello!

01:29:16.417 --> 01:29:17.667
I'm Bodhi Kalpak.

01:29:17.792 --> 01:29:21.125
I’m the one you sent Dileep to kill.

01:29:21.333 --> 01:29:22.417
How are you?

01:29:22.875 --> 01:29:25.417
Sir, it's simple.
You're holding a few of my things.

01:29:25.750 --> 01:29:27.167
So, I'm here to take it back...

01:29:27.292 --> 01:29:29.917
and to compromise that we don't
have anything to do with each other.

01:29:31.958 --> 01:29:32.917
Don't look over there.

01:29:33.458 --> 01:29:35.125
I sent him to kill you.

01:29:35.250 --> 01:29:37.083
But he joined hands with you
and set out to kill me.

01:29:37.708 --> 01:29:38.458
It's wrong!

01:29:42.083 --> 01:29:45.458
I don't think so.
I don't have anything of yours.

01:29:46.292 --> 01:29:51.708
Sir, whenever I’ve offered a compromise,
I’ve always been sincere about it.

01:29:52.167 --> 01:29:54.500
But no one seems to trust me.

01:29:54.792 --> 01:29:59.667
"He might speak well in person
but might harm me later."

01:29:59.792 --> 01:30:01.708
I'm aware of what people think of me.

01:30:02.792 --> 01:30:06.083
It's not people's fault.
Because that's how I think.

01:30:06.708 --> 01:30:08.833
Anyway, nice meeting you, Sir.

01:30:11.167 --> 01:30:12.792
-Hey, takeaway...
-I'll get it packed.

01:30:12.833 --> 01:30:14.167
I meant don't do it.

01:30:15.000 --> 01:30:17.208
[villainous music]

01:30:18.542 --> 01:30:21.292
[engine squeals]
[tire screeches]

01:30:21.750 --> 01:30:22.958
[machine whirring]

01:30:24.625 --> 01:30:27.083
Sharva, I tried speaking
but it didn't work out.

01:30:27.458 --> 01:30:28.708
I anticipated it.

01:30:28.958 --> 01:30:32.792
It won't work if we go to him.
We must bring him to us.

01:30:33.208 --> 01:30:34.167
Fine, forget about it.

01:30:34.750 --> 01:30:36.792
Didn't you mention
his friend's family lives in Mandya?

01:30:36.875 --> 01:30:37.292
<i>Yes!</i>

01:30:37.708 --> 01:30:39.083
-Do as you were instructed.<i>-Okay.</i>

01:30:43.292 --> 01:30:44.667
-[door closes]
-[tire screeches]

01:30:51.167 --> 01:30:52.208
-[in Kannada] Take care of them.
-Sure!

01:30:52.333 --> 01:30:53.000
Let's go!

01:31:00.208 --> 01:31:01.750
[in Kannada] Don't worry about it.

01:31:01.875 --> 01:31:04.083
Now that he's here,
everything will be fine.

01:31:04.625 --> 01:31:07.625
Don't rack your brain over it.
We'll be right here for you.

01:31:08.083 --> 01:31:08.875
Okay?

01:31:10.167 --> 01:31:12.458
-[wheels scraping]
-[suspenseful music]

01:31:14.542 --> 01:31:17.208
Be strong!
Nothing will happen to you.

01:31:18.667 --> 01:31:19.875
I'll take care of everything.

01:31:20.833 --> 01:31:23.375
[suspenseful music continues]

01:31:23.792 --> 01:31:25.208
[slashes]
[thuds]

01:31:25.792 --> 01:31:27.250
[gun locks]
[gun fires]

01:31:28.292 --> 01:31:29.583
[vessel clanks]

01:31:32.250 --> 01:31:33.917
[continuous gunfire]

01:31:35.500 --> 01:31:36.792
[gunfire]

01:31:36.958 --> 01:31:38.417
[wallops]

01:31:41.583 --> 01:31:42.500
-Hey!
-Tharun!

01:31:43.167 --> 01:31:44.958
-Dad!
-Help me!

01:31:45.167 --> 01:31:46.167
-Let go of me.
-Revathi!

01:31:46.250 --> 01:31:47.542
Please help me!

01:31:47.833 --> 01:31:48.750
Let go of me!

01:31:50.583 --> 01:31:53.042
Mom, where's Dad?

01:31:53.208 --> 01:31:54.250
Let go of me!

01:31:54.917 --> 01:31:56.625
Tharun! Tharun!

01:31:56.750 --> 01:31:58.083
[gunfire]

01:31:58.167 --> 01:31:59.167
Hey, let go of me. Mom!

01:31:59.833 --> 01:32:01.250
-[gunfire]
-[man screams]

01:32:02.417 --> 01:32:04.542
[thrilling music]

01:32:07.042 --> 01:32:08.667
-Dad! Dad!
-Help me!

01:32:08.875 --> 01:32:10.708
-Help me!
-Dad!

01:32:12.792 --> 01:32:15.208
[thrilling music continues]

01:32:16.625 --> 01:32:17.625
-[gun fires]
-[woman gasps]

01:32:18.042 --> 01:32:18.792
Dad.

01:32:19.167 --> 01:32:20.833
[continuous gunfire]

01:32:21.000 --> 01:32:22.542
Dad! Hey, let go of me.

01:32:22.667 --> 01:32:24.042
Let go of me!

01:32:24.125 --> 01:32:25.542
Hey, let go of me!

01:32:26.875 --> 01:32:28.958
[villainous music]

01:32:31.250 --> 01:32:33.708
[in Kannada] <i>Sir, they attacked Narsimha</i>
<i>at a hospital in Mandya.</i>

01:32:33.917 --> 01:32:35.583
<i>Also, they took away his wife and son.</i>

01:32:35.667 --> 01:32:37.375
-When did this happen?<i>-Just a while ago.</i>

01:32:42.000 --> 01:32:43.917
<i>Welcome to Goa!</i>

01:32:45.417 --> 01:32:47.083
<i>Welcome humans!</i>

01:32:47.292 --> 01:32:49.458
<i>And welcome to Kalpak's Estate!</i>

01:32:49.792 --> 01:32:53.375
<i>We have built this exclusively</i>
<i>for clients like you.</i>

01:32:53.708 --> 01:32:55.958
<i>Take a look</i>
<i>at the beautiful meditation area.</i>

01:32:56.125 --> 01:32:58.083
The spa is over there.
Here we go.

01:32:58.375 --> 01:33:00.958
You can have fun and relax.
Do whatever you want.

01:33:01.125 --> 01:33:03.958
This is the secret place
you guys were waiting for.

01:33:04.208 --> 01:33:05.542
Are you excited, Sam?

01:33:05.708 --> 01:33:08.208
This is Kalpak's Den
I was talking about.

01:33:08.458 --> 01:33:10.042
Get ready to be surprised.

01:33:10.333 --> 01:33:12.333
Let me open the door.

01:33:12.625 --> 01:33:14.792
And we say, "Open Sesame."

01:33:16.458 --> 01:33:17.625
[screen beeping]

01:33:18.625 --> 01:33:19.625
Follow me, guys.

01:33:19.750 --> 01:33:21.083
Woohoo!

01:33:21.292 --> 01:33:25.583
These are the most exquisite idols
you'll ever find anywhere.

01:33:25.667 --> 01:33:27.958
Choose your idols
and we'll ship it to you safely.

01:33:28.042 --> 01:33:29.250
No worries about that.

01:33:29.625 --> 01:33:30.667
What a beauty!

01:33:31.750 --> 01:33:34.083
[racy music]

01:33:34.625 --> 01:33:36.125
[door whirring]

01:33:37.792 --> 01:33:39.958
[machine screeching]

01:33:41.958 --> 01:33:44.167
[machine whirring]

01:33:52.458 --> 01:33:53.542
-Hi!
-Hello, Mr. Bodhi!

01:33:53.708 --> 01:33:55.333
Sincere apologies for the delay.

01:33:56.542 --> 01:33:59.458
Just to compensate.
This is one of my rare collections.

01:33:59.625 --> 01:34:00.542
-Please!
-Wow, thank you!

01:34:00.625 --> 01:34:02.500
Actually, I'm not the reason for the delay.

01:34:02.625 --> 01:34:03.625
[snaps fingers]

01:34:03.750 --> 01:34:04.625
But this guy is.

01:34:05.667 --> 01:34:07.667
-Ved, please take care of them.
-Let's go!

01:34:07.958 --> 01:34:10.292
I told you
that my brother is such a sweetheart.

01:34:10.417 --> 01:34:11.292
He's a darling!

01:34:13.250 --> 01:34:14.542
[metal jingles]

01:34:20.875 --> 01:34:22.542
[sharp music]

01:34:24.083 --> 01:34:24.750
[in Hindi] Send him in.

01:34:28.208 --> 01:34:30.333
[ominous music]

01:34:34.042 --> 01:34:36.292
[footsteps approaching]

01:34:40.250 --> 01:34:42.708
[thrilling music]

01:34:49.625 --> 01:34:53.000
I was thinking about you yesterday,
and today you're here.

01:34:56.333 --> 01:34:59.125
Last night, Varman was in my dream.

01:34:59.542 --> 01:35:00.542
I'm not joking.

01:35:00.875 --> 01:35:03.875
He was chasing me with an axe.

01:35:04.583 --> 01:35:06.625
It's not fair to me
because you killed him.

01:35:06.750 --> 01:35:08.292
So he must be in your dreams.

01:35:08.625 --> 01:35:10.500
Instead, he's in my dream.

01:35:10.833 --> 01:35:12.042
It's very strange!

01:35:12.333 --> 01:35:15.083
<i>♪ The devil herself appears ♪</i>

01:35:16.083 --> 01:35:20.625
<i>♪ The supreme devil herself appears ♪</i>

01:35:21.667 --> 01:35:25.083
<i>♪ You dare take on this devil? ♪</i>

01:35:27.250 --> 01:35:29.083
[puffs out]

01:35:30.125 --> 01:35:31.333
Coffee or tea?

01:35:32.250 --> 01:35:33.000
None!

01:35:34.125 --> 01:35:36.167
You can choose whether it's coffee or tea.

01:35:36.958 --> 01:35:40.417
You don't get to choose whether
you're willing to drink or not.

01:35:40.792 --> 01:35:43.792
You must drink it. If you don't,
then Kantha will be angry.

01:35:45.250 --> 01:35:47.583
[jazzy music]

01:35:49.167 --> 01:35:50.083
Dad is arriving.

01:35:50.667 --> 01:35:53.292
Get up, get up.

01:35:54.417 --> 01:35:58.708
<i>♪ The supreme devil himself appears ♪</i>

01:35:59.833 --> 01:36:03.042
<i>♪ You dare take on this devil? ♪</i>

01:36:03.583 --> 01:36:05.458
[wheelchair buzzing]

01:36:08.125 --> 01:36:10.458
[thrilling music]

01:36:15.208 --> 01:36:16.208
[smooches]

01:36:18.375 --> 01:36:23.542
Dad, you have to pick who you want to
do the special dance for your birthday.

01:36:23.958 --> 01:36:25.042
That's why we called you here.

01:36:25.792 --> 01:36:27.333
I hope we did not disturb you.

01:36:28.500 --> 01:36:29.167
Bodhi!

01:36:30.708 --> 01:36:32.750
[jazzy music]

01:36:37.417 --> 01:36:38.125
Okay, Dad!

01:36:38.458 --> 01:36:41.000
Sharva, fix this girl for the dance.

01:36:43.500 --> 01:36:46.125
[thrilling music]

01:36:48.500 --> 01:36:50.292
[wheelchair buzzing]

01:36:52.958 --> 01:36:53.708
Sir!

01:36:54.458 --> 01:36:55.875
[in Hindi] Sir, please forgive me.

01:36:56.167 --> 01:36:57.875
Sir, I made a mistake.

01:36:57.875 --> 01:36:59.500
Please forgive me, Sir.

01:36:59.667 --> 01:37:00.833
Please sir!

01:37:01.125 --> 01:37:02.375
Forgive me, Sir!

01:37:03.042 --> 01:37:04.833
-[gun whizzes]
-[gun fires]

01:37:06.292 --> 01:37:08.875
[wheelchair whirring]

01:37:14.542 --> 01:37:16.167
That invitation is for you.

01:37:16.625 --> 01:37:19.917
In 10 days,
it's our Dad's 72nd birthday.

01:37:20.042 --> 01:37:23.125
The biggest gift
we're giving him on his birthday...

01:37:23.750 --> 01:37:29.042
are the three containers full of statues
that you stole from us.

01:37:29.542 --> 01:37:32.458
So, bring the containers on his birthday.

01:37:32.958 --> 01:37:34.083
After you hand it over...

01:37:34.875 --> 01:37:36.708
-[beeps]
-[whizzes]

01:37:37.667 --> 01:37:39.583
[unsettling music]

01:37:40.583 --> 01:37:41.625
you can take them home.

01:37:44.792 --> 01:37:47.250
[unsettling music continues]

01:37:49.583 --> 01:37:50.917
You did not drink your coffee.

01:37:52.667 --> 01:37:54.000
I don't drink coffee.

01:37:54.375 --> 01:37:55.875
You can only leave
if you drink your coffee.

01:37:57.250 --> 01:37:58.625
[lighter flickers]

01:38:00.542 --> 01:38:02.750
-[dramatic music]
-[cup clinks]

01:38:05.292 --> 01:38:06.333
That's enough!

01:38:07.708 --> 01:38:11.333
While you're on our territory,
you must follow our commands.

01:38:11.792 --> 01:38:13.708
This house has rules to follow.

01:38:14.125 --> 01:38:14.875
You may leave!

01:38:15.958 --> 01:38:18.000
[dramatic music continues]

01:38:18.292 --> 01:38:19.125
[snaps fingers]

01:38:21.083 --> 01:38:22.000
[puffs out]

01:38:22.042 --> 01:38:24.250
Dress code is very important
on Dad's birthday.

01:38:25.042 --> 01:38:26.458
You must not come dressed like this.

01:38:27.333 --> 01:38:27.917
Out!

01:38:37.250 --> 01:38:39.000
[mellow music]

01:38:39.458 --> 01:38:43.417
[in Kannada] Sir, everything happened
so fast that we never saw this coming.

01:38:44.083 --> 01:38:47.167
I will bring back
Narshimha's family safe and sound.

01:38:47.833 --> 01:38:49.500
Until then, keep him safe.

01:38:50.750 --> 01:38:53.083
[sentimental music]

01:38:59.417 --> 01:39:00.708
Hey, clean it well.

01:39:00.875 --> 01:39:03.167
-He might come over.
-Uncle, didn't they assign you any work?

01:39:03.583 --> 01:39:06.750
Hey, you should've understood
when they didn't assign me anything.

01:39:06.917 --> 01:39:08.958
My work is to supervise you all.

01:39:09.042 --> 01:39:10.292
-Uncle.
-What is it?

01:39:10.333 --> 01:39:11.917
They asked you to clean the toilet.

01:39:12.083 --> 01:39:13.375
[comical music]

01:39:13.542 --> 01:39:14.667
Did they, dear?

01:39:15.167 --> 01:39:18.042
Watch me clean it
until it shines like a diamond.

01:39:18.250 --> 01:39:18.958
You may leave.

01:39:21.333 --> 01:39:22.208
[spits]

01:39:23.417 --> 01:39:25.167
Swetha, leave the books over there.

01:39:25.583 --> 01:39:27.125
I'll keep Rithvik's books separately.

01:39:27.167 --> 01:39:30.125
Madam, you all must stay here for a while.

01:39:30.708 --> 01:39:32.125
Whatever you need, ask me.

01:39:32.792 --> 01:39:35.125
Sir has instructed
you three not to leave the house.

01:39:42.875 --> 01:39:44.375
