01:42:52.542 --> 01:42:54.458
<i>♪ Step outside, baby…</i>
<i>The whole world’s gone corrupt! ♪</i>

01:42:56.083 --> 01:42:59.167
<i>♪ Dangerous men, Powerful men,</i>
<i>All gathered here ♪</i>

01:42:59.292 --> 01:43:02.333
<i>♪ Even the mightiest</i>
<i>Bow before such beauty ♪</i>

01:43:02.458 --> 01:43:05.292
<i>♪ Higher… higher… higher ♪</i>

