01:43:32.958 --> 01:43:35.708
Happy Birthday, dear Dad.

01:43:35.875 --> 01:43:38.750
Happy Birthday to you!

01:43:39.125 --> 01:43:41.333
-Dad!
-Love you!

01:43:44.417 --> 01:43:48.375
Actually, the reason why we're celebrating
Dad's birthday on a grand scale

01:43:48.667 --> 01:43:50.333
As you all are already aware...

01:43:50.583 --> 01:43:53.458
three containers full of idols
went missing.

01:43:54.208 --> 01:43:56.208
No one but us is to blame for it.

01:43:56.333 --> 01:44:00.500
And that's why we wanted to use this
special celebration as an opportunity

01:44:00.875 --> 01:44:03.083
to apologize to our Dad
in front of all of you.

01:44:03.333 --> 01:44:05.500
Dad, we're sorry!

01:44:08.750 --> 01:44:09.750
[smooches]

01:44:10.875 --> 01:44:11.458
Bodhi!

01:44:11.625 --> 01:44:13.625
Ved, get the keys from him.

01:44:17.125 --> 01:44:19.000
[footsteps approaching]

01:44:19.875 --> 01:44:21.958
Hey, hand me the container keys.

01:44:24.250 --> 01:44:25.083
Keys?

01:44:26.458 --> 01:44:29.792
Wasn't the deal to exchange keys
in exchange for my friend's family?

01:44:30.500 --> 01:44:31.583
I don't see them anywhere.

01:44:32.042 --> 01:44:33.083
Deal is a deal!

01:44:34.750 --> 01:44:37.875
How long would it take me to
beat you up and take the keys?

01:44:38.208 --> 01:44:39.042
Oh, oh!

01:44:39.667 --> 01:44:40.917
What if you beat me

01:44:40.958 --> 01:44:42.958
and the containers explode
because they are rigged with bombs?

01:44:43.000 --> 01:44:44.542
What would you do then? Huh?

01:44:44.833 --> 01:44:46.042
[thrilling music]

01:44:46.292 --> 01:44:47.792
Bring my friend's family.

01:44:52.167 --> 01:44:52.917
No!

01:44:54.250 --> 01:44:54.958
Sharva!

01:44:56.708 --> 01:44:59.208
[dramatic music continues]

01:45:08.375 --> 01:45:10.042
[woman winces]

01:45:12.458 --> 01:45:13.708
[both cry in pain]

01:45:15.833 --> 01:45:17.958
[despicable music]

01:45:22.958 --> 01:45:25.125
Dad, with your permission.

01:45:28.083 --> 01:45:30.250
[loud explosion]

01:45:37.833 --> 01:45:39.417
[rousing music]

01:45:39.708 --> 01:45:41.958
Hey, what's wrong with you?

01:45:46.208 --> 01:45:50.250
Wasn't the deal to hand over the keys
in exchange for my friend's family?

01:45:50.375 --> 01:45:52.667
Instead, if you threaten to kill them...

01:45:52.958 --> 01:45:54.125
the containers will explode!

01:45:54.542 --> 01:45:55.250
Explode, as in?

01:45:55.708 --> 01:45:58.667
What you witnessed was level 1.
It goes up to level 3.

01:45:59.042 --> 01:46:02.208
If all the containers explode,
none of us out here will survive.

01:46:02.250 --> 01:46:03.708
The entire radius will be wiped out.

01:46:03.792 --> 01:46:07.000
Technically, it's a suicide mission.

01:46:07.125 --> 01:46:07.750
What?

01:46:08.250 --> 01:46:11.208
Anyway, after retrieving the containers,
you'll kill us all.

01:46:11.292 --> 01:46:14.667
How is it fair that we die
but you live to enjoy life?

01:46:15.667 --> 01:46:17.083
No, no, not a fair deal.

01:46:17.542 --> 01:46:19.542
Rather, the explosion will kill us all.

01:46:19.625 --> 01:46:21.375
At least the rest of the people
will live happily.

01:46:21.500 --> 01:46:22.417
Am I right?

01:46:24.750 --> 01:46:26.042
[clicker beeps]

01:46:26.333 --> 01:46:28.250
You have two minutes more.

01:46:28.708 --> 01:46:30.250
Hey, check if he's telling the truth.

01:46:32.125 --> 01:46:33.333
Sam, check the containers.

01:46:33.458 --> 01:46:36.542
<i>Hey, get under and check!</i>

01:46:37.292 --> 01:46:39.833
-[upbeat peppy music]
-[beeping]

01:46:42.083 --> 01:46:44.042
Sir, the containers
are rigged with heavy explosives.

01:46:44.333 --> 01:46:46.333
<i>I have never seen a setup like this</i>
<i>in my life.</i>

01:46:46.458 --> 01:46:49.833
As he mentioned, if it explodes,
it will wipe out the entire radius.

01:46:49.958 --> 01:46:52.500
<i>In my opinion,</i>
<i>it's highly risky to mess with it.</i>

01:46:55.417 --> 01:46:57.792
How did you manage to bring in
so many explosives to Goa?

01:46:57.917 --> 01:47:00.417
-At your mercy.
-At our mercy?

01:47:00.708 --> 01:47:01.417
Yes!

01:47:01.667 --> 01:47:04.583
No one dared stop us when we told them
we were heading to Kalpak's house.

01:47:06.333 --> 01:47:08.458
Don't get worked up.
Think hard.

01:47:09.042 --> 01:47:10.958
You have 60 seconds more!

01:47:10.958 --> 01:47:13.958
Hey! Sir, please stop it.

01:47:14.667 --> 01:47:16.083
We'll discuss it.
We'll discuss it.

01:47:18.125 --> 01:47:18.833
Kantha!

01:47:19.458 --> 01:47:20.083
Let them go.

01:47:21.125 --> 01:47:22.500
Please take them with you, Sir.

01:47:22.667 --> 01:47:25.250
I don't want them.
Send your father with me.

01:47:25.333 --> 01:47:28.667
-Hey!
-You have 55 seconds more.

01:47:29.708 --> 01:47:30.375
Sir!

01:47:31.958 --> 01:47:33.250
Why do you need my father?

01:47:33.250 --> 01:47:34.875
You people don't value your word.

01:47:35.042 --> 01:47:38.125
You promised to send them in exchange
for containers, but you didn't.

01:47:38.583 --> 01:47:41.667
Until I feel it's safe
to leave with them from here...

01:47:41.875 --> 01:47:43.625
your father will be with me.

01:47:44.458 --> 01:47:46.292
I cannot send my father at your whim.

01:47:46.417 --> 01:47:47.542
He's my father, Sir!

01:47:48.250 --> 01:47:50.250
You have 50 seconds more.

01:47:50.750 --> 01:47:51.458
Boom!

01:47:51.542 --> 01:47:52.125
Sir!

01:47:53.167 --> 01:47:55.292
Sir, switch off the remote
and put it in your pocket.

01:47:55.625 --> 01:47:56.708
-We'll discuss--
-Bodhi!

01:47:58.583 --> 01:47:59.333
I'll go with him.

01:47:59.583 --> 01:48:02.083
-No need, Dad.
-Dad, it's risky.

01:48:02.417 --> 01:48:04.167
No, Dad. No!

01:48:04.417 --> 01:48:06.708
Do you have any other choice?

01:48:07.167 --> 01:48:08.125
Idiots!

01:48:09.292 --> 01:48:11.292
[riveting music]

01:48:21.250 --> 01:48:23.208
[wheelchair whirring]

01:48:28.708 --> 01:48:29.833
I appreciate it.

01:48:30.333 --> 01:48:32.375
You sorted it out
without making it complicated.

01:48:32.750 --> 01:48:33.625
Thank you!

01:48:53.125 --> 01:48:53.958
Dad!

01:49:04.667 --> 01:49:06.000
Hey! Hey...

01:49:07.250 --> 01:49:09.917
So, I'm a little tired now.

01:49:10.667 --> 01:49:13.250
Madam, can I get a cup of coffee?

01:49:14.042 --> 01:49:16.042
[upbeat music]

01:49:16.125 --> 01:49:17.542
[chuckles]

01:49:21.583 --> 01:49:23.625
[upbeat music continues]

01:49:32.500 --> 01:49:34.042
You must not harm my father.

01:49:34.125 --> 01:49:35.708
What would you do
if something happened to him?

01:49:36.375 --> 01:49:39.125
Hey, if you dare touch any of my people...

01:49:39.417 --> 01:49:40.625
If you even think of harming them

01:49:40.625 --> 01:49:44.167
I will hack you and your family
mercilessly and discard it in Goa's sea

01:49:44.292 --> 01:49:45.333
and be on my way.

01:49:46.542 --> 01:49:50.667
After that, there will be evidence left
that Kalpak's family ever lived in Goa.

01:49:50.750 --> 01:49:51.750
Understand?

01:49:54.125 --> 01:49:55.250
Coffee cancel!

01:49:58.333 --> 01:49:59.958
You look amazing!

01:50:00.375 --> 01:50:01.583
Can I have your number?

01:50:01.750 --> 01:50:02.792
Speak to me.

01:50:02.833 --> 01:50:05.583
8870040172

01:50:07.333 --> 01:50:08.375
I sent you a text.

01:50:09.792 --> 01:50:11.292
Save my number.

01:50:14.042 --> 01:50:15.333
Amazing!

01:50:16.250 --> 01:50:17.583
Damnnn!

01:50:19.792 --> 01:50:22.125
-[upbeat peppy music]
-[firecrackers explode]

01:50:31.833 --> 01:50:34.292
[upbeat peppy music continues]

01:50:49.000 --> 01:50:50.458
Is it ever going to end?

01:50:51.125 --> 01:50:54.458
The end is to destroy their family.

01:50:55.125 --> 01:50:57.417
And this is the beginning
of their destruction.

01:50:58.708 --> 01:51:00.833
Oh, now it's only beginning.

01:51:02.250 --> 01:51:03.333
God help me!

01:51:06.208 --> 01:51:07.625
[jabs deeply]

01:51:09.375 --> 01:51:12.042
Why do I need security as a poser?

01:51:13.458 --> 01:51:15.125
You checked the statues.

01:51:15.167 --> 01:51:17.958
But you failed to check
the rigged explosives, you fool!

01:51:18.500 --> 01:51:21.167
Now I call upon
our Honorable Union Minister...

01:51:21.292 --> 01:51:22.917
-Good evening, it's a--
-Sir!

01:51:23.000 --> 01:51:24.458
Sir, they kidnapped Chakri Kalpak.

01:51:25.917 --> 01:51:29.083
Listen carefully! Extract him safely.

01:51:29.292 --> 01:51:31.250
Or else they'll make our lives living hell.

01:51:31.250 --> 01:51:32.250
[slashes]

01:51:33.458 --> 01:51:35.833
[upbeat villainous music]

01:51:36.625 --> 01:51:37.625
[gun fires]

01:51:38.625 --> 01:51:39.917
[continuous gunfire]

01:51:40.000 --> 01:51:41.792
-Where's my father?
-I don't know, Sir.

01:51:41.833 --> 01:51:44.042
Until my father returns,
I won't spare anyone.

01:51:44.708 --> 01:51:50.458
Imagine what my sons would
do to you and your loved ones.

01:51:52.542 --> 01:51:54.250
<i>Murders are happening all over the city.</i>

01:51:54.375 --> 01:51:55.667
<i>Many people are missing.</i>

01:51:55.833 --> 01:51:58.542
<i>If this continues for a week,</i>
<i>it'll be the end of us.</i>

01:51:58.917 --> 01:52:01.000
[upbeat villainous music continues]

01:52:01.583 --> 01:52:04.167
Chakri Sir will return home safely.

01:52:04.292 --> 01:52:05.333
I can guarantee you that.

01:52:05.417 --> 01:52:08.750
<i>Until then, if you could slow down</i>
<i>whatever you're doing right now...</i>

01:52:08.833 --> 01:52:12.125
Instead of asking me to slow down,
you better act fast.

01:52:13.042 --> 01:52:14.042
[gun fires]

01:52:14.417 --> 01:52:15.750
[water splashes]

01:52:19.417 --> 01:52:24.500
<i>♪ Fallen heart ♪</i>

01:52:27.417 --> 01:52:33.458
<i>♪ Fallen heart ♪</i>

01:52:35.542 --> 01:52:36.667
You mind your business.

01:52:36.833 --> 01:52:38.667
I thought I'd meet you for 5 seconds.

01:52:39.958 --> 01:52:42.792
He loved you a lot.
Please light the lamp.

01:52:42.833 --> 01:52:44.292
<i>♪ Why do they keep losing? ♪</i>

01:52:44.875 --> 01:52:46.750
<i>♪ I keep winning, again and again ♪</i>

01:52:46.917 --> 01:52:50.125
<i>♪ Every challenge is fading away ♪</i>

01:52:50.208 --> 01:52:52.208
<i>♪ Why do they keep losing? ♪</i>

01:52:53.667 --> 01:52:56.042
[upbeat villainous music continues]

01:52:59.458 --> 01:53:01.542
Right, Sir! As you say!

01:53:02.958 --> 01:53:04.708
Sir, consider me your son.

01:53:05.083 --> 01:53:06.292
Please eat something.

01:53:08.250 --> 01:53:11.792
<i>♪ My soul, my heart, my fate</i>
<i>All have surrendered ♪</i>

01:53:12.042 --> 01:53:13.125
If you couldn't find Chakri,

01:53:13.167 --> 01:53:15.250
at least set up
a compromise meeting between them.

01:53:15.250 --> 01:53:17.125
This is my final warning to both of you.

01:53:17.208 --> 01:53:18.542
[continuous gunfire]

01:53:20.958 --> 01:53:23.125
Enjoying a meal with your family?

01:53:23.417 --> 01:53:25.417
Wife, kids, mother, and father.

01:53:26.375 --> 01:53:27.750
But my father is not home yet.

01:53:29.792 --> 01:53:31.292
I'm here to remind you.

01:53:34.958 --> 01:53:36.042
[message tone]

01:53:37.458 --> 01:53:38.833
[gun fires]

01:53:40.042 --> 01:53:42.750
<i>♪ Fallen heart ♪</i>

01:53:43.583 --> 01:53:44.958
Another shootout has been reported.

01:53:45.042 --> 01:53:46.792
<i>He has also deployed a special team</i>
<i>to extract him.</i>

01:53:46.917 --> 01:53:48.583
-Sister, the commissioner.
-I'll call you back.

01:53:48.667 --> 01:53:50.292
I asked you to arrange
a compromise meeting.

01:53:50.417 --> 01:53:52.250
Set it up quickly and inform me.

01:53:56.375 --> 01:53:59.250
I hope the clarity is good.
And it's clearly visible.

01:54:01.042 --> 01:54:04.083
I noticed that you got hurt
while you were being roughed up.

01:54:04.958 --> 01:54:06.750
Keep this for your support.

01:54:08.917 --> 01:54:11.167
Open your mouth.
Come on, open your mouth.

01:54:11.458 --> 01:54:13.625
Hey, open your mouth.
Come on!

01:54:13.708 --> 01:54:15.833
Open your mouth.
Hey, hey, hey, hey!

01:54:16.625 --> 01:54:18.167
[crying in pain]

01:54:18.417 --> 01:54:20.125
What's the noise?
Hey, hey!

01:54:21.417 --> 01:54:22.417
Blood on his lips.

01:54:23.667 --> 01:54:25.667
Hey, I asked you to feed him.

01:54:25.875 --> 01:54:27.292
Why did you bite his lips?

01:54:31.667 --> 01:54:33.292
[phone ringing]

01:54:35.750 --> 01:54:38.333
<i>Sir, this is the Collector speaking.</i>
<i>I want to meet you immediately.</i>

01:54:38.458 --> 01:54:39.583
<i>Could you please meet me in person?</i>

01:54:43.875 --> 01:54:46.125
Sir, please don't worry.

01:54:46.292 --> 01:54:48.500
No matter who he is,
we'll handle him.

01:54:48.667 --> 01:54:51.167
First, let's sort this out.
Then you can take away Chakri, Sir.

01:54:51.458 --> 01:54:54.833
After you leave,
he won't even make it out of this building.

01:54:55.167 --> 01:54:57.750
Hey, do you remember what I told you?

01:54:57.833 --> 01:54:58.417
Yes, Sir.

01:54:58.917 --> 01:55:01.500
He should be wiped out without a trace.

01:55:01.708 --> 01:55:03.750
Who is he? What does he do?

01:55:04.083 --> 01:55:05.292
He's a former Jailer.

01:55:05.625 --> 01:55:07.667
Jailer of which prison?

01:55:07.958 --> 01:55:08.792
Tihar prison.

01:55:09.958 --> 01:55:12.208
Tihar prison? Which year?

01:55:12.500 --> 01:55:14.167
2005-2012

01:55:16.083 --> 01:55:19.167
I can hear the boots.
I think the Jailer has arrived.

01:55:19.875 --> 01:55:22.500
<i>Hey! I'm the King, and it's my reign here!</i>

01:55:22.583 --> 01:55:24.125
<i>I make the rules.</i>

01:55:24.167 --> 01:55:26.458
<i>I keep changing rules at my whim.</i>

01:55:26.708 --> 01:55:28.792
<i>Shut up and follow them.</i>

01:55:29.000 --> 01:55:31.958
<i>If you dare break the rules</i>
<i>and cause trouble...</i>

01:55:32.333 --> 01:55:35.083
<i>...I'll hack you down mercilessly</i>
<i>and discard you.</i>

01:55:35.375 --> 01:55:36.208
<i>Hukkum!</i>

01:55:36.542 --> 01:55:37.833
<i>Tiger Ka Hukkum!</i>

01:55:38.750 --> 01:55:41.333
[upbeat theme music]

01:55:56.583 --> 01:55:58.583
<i>♪ He’s witnessed your dirty game ♪</i>

01:55:58.708 --> 01:56:00.958
<i>♪ He's familiar with your father's game ♪</i>

01:56:01.250 --> 01:56:05.417
<i>♪ Oh… he’s the one</i>
<i>Who makes generations dance to his tune! ♪</i>

01:56:05.458 --> 01:56:08.208
<i>♪ A few may try to tarnish his name ♪</i>

01:56:08.292 --> 01:56:10.583
<i>♪ A hundred may try to snatch his crown ♪</i>

01:56:10.708 --> 01:56:13.042
<i>♪ Look over that wall ♪</i>

01:56:13.250 --> 01:56:15.792
<i>♪ millions will rise to show their love! ♪</i>

01:56:19.542 --> 01:56:22.167
[in Telugu]
Hey, Raja Rao, what brings you here?

01:56:23.333 --> 01:56:25.000
I came to have tea, Brother.

01:56:25.458 --> 01:56:27.542
-If you don't want me here, I'll leave.
-It's okay. Take your seat.

01:56:33.917 --> 01:56:36.417
-Please resolve it as a compromise.
-Okay, Sir.

01:56:39.208 --> 01:56:40.208
Compromise!

01:56:41.292 --> 01:56:41.958
Fine!

01:56:43.083 --> 01:56:44.500
[line ringing]

01:56:45.417 --> 01:56:46.917
<i>-Tell me.</i>
-Kantha...

01:56:47.125 --> 01:56:49.500
They're asking to take away Dad
and resolve the issue as a compromise.

01:56:49.875 --> 01:56:53.250
<i>Fine, tell them we will "compromise"</i>
<i>as they suggest.</i>

01:56:53.542 --> 01:56:54.083
See...

01:56:54.208 --> 01:56:56.042
I want to talk to Kantha.

01:56:56.375 --> 01:56:57.625
You can speak to me.

01:56:57.792 --> 01:56:59.292
I'll speak to Kantha myself.

01:56:59.417 --> 01:57:01.458
<i>Bodhi, it's okay.</i>
<i>Ask him to speak.</i>

01:57:01.583 --> 01:57:02.958
<i>I would like to know</i>
<i>what he has to say.</i>

01:57:05.292 --> 01:57:07.167
I sent you a good morning message...

01:57:07.792 --> 01:57:09.000
but you didn't reply.

01:57:09.292 --> 01:57:11.042
I sent you a good evening message...

01:57:11.042 --> 01:57:12.333
still no reply.

01:57:14.208 --> 01:57:14.792
Thank you.

01:57:15.708 --> 01:57:16.750
[chuckles]

01:57:17.875 --> 01:57:19.000
[sighs]

01:57:23.250 --> 01:57:25.292
[wheelchair whirring]

01:57:26.833 --> 01:57:30.667
Guys, before you find out yourself

01:57:30.833 --> 01:57:32.833
I'll be a gentleman and tell you the truth.

01:57:33.000 --> 01:57:36.458
In a minor scuffle,
we happened to bite your father's ear.

01:57:36.833 --> 01:57:38.250
You guys bit his ear, you say?

01:57:38.583 --> 01:57:39.250
Dad!

01:57:41.667 --> 01:57:43.208
He was the one who bit a finger first.

01:57:43.917 --> 01:57:44.792
A sharp bite!

01:57:49.083 --> 01:57:52.333
[in Telugu] You better bear this in mind.

01:57:52.625 --> 01:57:55.542
If they don't behave, I'll mercilessly
cut them down and scatter you.

01:57:55.667 --> 01:57:59.125
Then it'll take 10 days to even
recognize whose body it was.

01:57:59.792 --> 01:58:01.417
Do you understand, my dear?

01:58:01.750 --> 01:58:03.208
I understood it long ago, Brother.

01:58:03.500 --> 01:58:05.125
-Please explain it to them.
-Sure, I will.

01:58:05.708 --> 01:58:07.625
-I'll take my leave.
-I'll see you off, Sir.

01:58:08.833 --> 01:58:10.583
Oh, okay, okay, Brother!

01:58:13.958 --> 01:58:17.208
Raja Rao: The old man's ear ointment
is in his pocket.

01:58:17.375 --> 01:58:18.375
Apply it daily.

01:58:23.583 --> 01:58:25.125
Dad, please don't worry about it.

01:58:25.750 --> 01:58:28.458
The Jailer and his loved ones

01:58:28.542 --> 01:58:32.292
they'll plead before they die,
and we'll witness it.

01:58:33.750 --> 01:58:35.333
[phone ringing]

01:58:38.083 --> 01:58:39.208
-Jailer, Sir.
-Yeah!

01:58:39.292 --> 01:58:40.833
[in Hindi]
You need to be extremely careful.

01:58:41.333 --> 01:58:42.917
-They have a heavy setting.
-I understand.

01:58:44.958 --> 01:58:47.042
[thrilling music]

01:58:50.042 --> 01:58:52.375
Ear... His ear...

01:58:52.750 --> 01:58:54.292
He underestimated us.

01:58:54.750 --> 01:58:56.958
How dare they bite his ear?

01:59:00.500 --> 01:59:01.667
Take the right.

01:59:02.125 --> 01:59:03.292
Aren't we supposed to go left?

01:59:03.417 --> 01:59:05.333
We have another task to finish
before we arrive.

01:59:10.792 --> 01:59:11.458
Hey!

01:59:12.417 --> 01:59:14.208
-Be careful!
-Sorry, Sir.

01:59:14.375 --> 01:59:16.333
-Sorry, Doctor. Please be careful.
-Okay.

01:59:16.542 --> 01:59:17.625
He's my father.

01:59:18.083 --> 01:59:19.375
-Sir!<i>-Where are you?</i>

01:59:19.500 --> 01:59:20.875
We're heading to the location you shared.

01:59:21.125 --> 01:59:23.208
<i>-Get there quickly!</i>
-Okay, Sir.

01:59:24.167 --> 01:59:26.500
[thrilling music continues]

01:59:31.500 --> 01:59:32.500
[beeps]

01:59:33.250 --> 01:59:35.583
Doesn't matter. Switch it off!
I'll switch it on here.

01:59:36.208 --> 01:59:38.583
[incessant tapping]

01:59:39.667 --> 01:59:42.042
[thrilling music continues]

01:59:51.792 --> 01:59:53.000
[light thuds]

01:59:57.792 --> 01:59:59.375
<i>Go! Keep the camera on!</i>

01:59:59.583 --> 02:00:01.417
<i>-Keep it steady.</i>
-We are here, Sir.

02:00:01.500 --> 02:00:03.042
<i>-I must see it clearly.</i>
-Okay, Sir.

02:00:03.250 --> 02:00:04.792
More than you killing him...

02:00:04.917 --> 02:00:07.583
we must witness him
plead for his life before he dies.

02:00:07.625 --> 02:00:10.667
We, as a family,
are seated in front of a 120x80 screen.

02:00:10.750 --> 02:00:13.167
Ved, start recording.

02:00:13.292 --> 02:00:14.292
I want to keep replaying it.

02:00:14.417 --> 02:00:16.083
I want to watch him suffer.
Understand?

02:00:16.125 --> 02:00:17.958
-Understood, Sir.
-The hell you understood.

02:00:18.125 --> 02:00:20.000
-Clean the lens, damn it!<i>-Okay, sir.</i>

02:00:20.125 --> 02:00:21.458
Come on! Go ahead!

02:00:21.500 --> 02:00:22.958
-Everyone, come on!
-Climb the stairs!

02:00:23.125 --> 02:00:25.750
Go inside. Keep going.

02:00:25.792 --> 02:00:26.417
Go!

02:00:27.125 --> 02:00:29.208
[thrilling music continues]

02:00:30.417 --> 02:00:31.792
How dare you bite his ears?

02:00:34.083 --> 02:00:35.000
[door opens]

02:00:36.667 --> 02:00:37.708
<i>Sir, there's no one out here.</i>

02:00:38.042 --> 02:00:39.375
<i>-Are you sure?</i>
-Yes, Sir.

02:00:40.083 --> 02:00:41.917
-Where the hell is he?<i>-I'm checking.</i>

02:00:42.208 --> 02:00:43.917
<i>Hey, check inside that room.</i>

02:00:44.333 --> 02:00:45.917
<i>-Everyone, check every corner.</i>
-Where are you?

02:00:45.958 --> 02:00:47.958
Sir, do you have any hearing problems?

02:00:48.417 --> 02:00:49.917
No! Why do you ask?

02:00:50.500 --> 02:00:52.875
Then why is he wearing a hearing device?

02:00:52.958 --> 02:00:54.292
Sharva, check what that is.

02:00:56.667 --> 02:00:57.833
-It's a mic.
-Mic?

02:00:58.958 --> 02:01:01.500
[thrilling music continues]

02:01:02.792 --> 02:01:05.000
Does that mean he heard
everything we were talking about?

02:01:06.833 --> 02:01:09.542
Only after he heard
would Dad hear anything.

02:01:10.125 --> 02:01:12.667
Only after he heard
would Dad hear anything!

02:01:13.583 --> 02:01:14.750
[yells]

02:01:17.292 --> 02:01:18.000
Bodhi!

02:01:19.500 --> 02:01:20.958
<i>Listen carefully, Kalpaks!</i>

02:01:21.417 --> 02:01:24.917
<i>Installing a camera, being cunning,</i>
<i>sending your men to intimidate us,</i>

02:01:25.000 --> 02:01:27.292
<i>peeping into others' homes,</i>
<i>dumping garbage at neighbors</i>

02:01:27.333 --> 02:01:28.958
<i>these antics are from your father's time.</i>

02:01:29.250 --> 02:01:30.250
The current style is...

02:01:30.292 --> 02:01:33.417
inviting all the enemies under one roof

02:01:35.125 --> 02:01:36.167
and bomb them!

02:01:37.167 --> 02:01:41.917
<i>♪ Even today and forever ♪</i>

02:01:42.542 --> 02:01:46.292
<i>♪ He reigns as the Thalaivar ♪</i>

02:01:47.958 --> 02:01:53.167
<i>♪ All eight directions will ignite ♪</i>

02:01:53.500 --> 02:01:57.042
<i>♪ When his name is spoken ♪</i>

02:01:58.833 --> 02:02:01.000
<i>♪ One and only Thalaivan ♪</i>

02:02:07.917 --> 02:02:09.167
Sorry, Dad!

02:02:14.167 --> 02:02:17.667
Even if we send in 1000 more men,
he'll finish them single-handedly.

02:02:18.625 --> 02:02:20.500
Our approach is not correct.

02:02:21.417 --> 02:02:24.875
I think we must find his weak spot

02:02:25.208 --> 02:02:27.833
and carefully execute it.

02:02:29.125 --> 02:02:30.792
In fact, in all these years

02:02:31.042 --> 02:02:33.333
I haven't met a man like him.

02:02:34.917 --> 02:02:36.458
To be frank...

02:02:36.667 --> 02:02:39.708
whenever he sends me
good morning and evening texts...

02:02:39.958 --> 02:02:42.042
I feel like replying to it.

02:02:42.792 --> 02:02:45.292
We must handle this man carefully.

02:02:50.292 --> 02:02:51.417
You've chosen the best!

02:02:51.542 --> 02:02:54.208
Your stay at Kalpak will be memorable.

02:02:54.292 --> 02:02:55.875
Trust me, ladies!

02:02:57.708 --> 02:02:58.167
Woohoo!

02:02:58.333 --> 02:03:02.125
So glad to have
four beautiful ladies with us.

02:03:02.250 --> 02:03:02.917
This way!

02:03:04.000 --> 02:03:05.333
-You smell so good.
-Uh-oh!

02:03:05.542 --> 02:03:07.542
-Be careful!
-Hey, don't touch!

02:03:07.625 --> 02:03:08.375
Uh-oh!

02:03:09.458 --> 02:03:10.750
It's not for kids.

02:03:12.167 --> 02:03:14.500
[sensual music]

02:03:20.000 --> 02:03:20.958
Is that so?

02:03:22.708 --> 02:03:24.708
I have four of these.

02:03:25.000 --> 02:03:27.500
Having it isn't enough.
You must use it.

02:03:30.708 --> 02:03:31.500
Okay.

02:03:32.500 --> 02:03:34.000
Sir, it's 100% safe.

02:03:34.125 --> 02:03:36.375
And only you can access it.

02:03:36.583 --> 02:03:39.083
There's a small knob under your armrest.

02:03:39.208 --> 02:03:41.750
If you rotate it,
a side panel will open up.

02:03:41.833 --> 02:03:44.500
And there'll be three triggers
for you to activate.

02:03:45.792 --> 02:03:48.750
Why are you doing this?
Is it really necessary?

02:03:49.042 --> 02:03:52.500
I know what I'm doing.
Do as I say.

02:03:56.375 --> 02:03:58.125
Dad, as per your description...

02:03:58.375 --> 02:04:01.958
we rounded up all the guys in Goa.

02:04:14.750 --> 02:04:16.958
[sinister music]

02:04:21.708 --> 02:04:23.458
[man grunts]

02:04:26.333 --> 02:04:27.500
Injection?

02:04:29.792 --> 02:04:33.667
Are you trying
to use the truth serum on me?

02:04:33.750 --> 02:04:35.125
You're right!

02:04:35.167 --> 02:04:36.208
If you know the truth...

02:04:36.625 --> 02:04:38.583
-...you guys will be in danger.
-Sharva!

02:04:41.750 --> 02:04:43.542
Hey! Hey!

02:04:44.125 --> 02:04:47.042
Where are the Jailer and his people?

02:04:47.583 --> 02:04:51.042
Are you planning to die soon?

02:04:51.750 --> 02:04:53.125
It's better to wait for a while.

02:04:53.458 --> 02:04:55.208
He'll come for you people
and kill you all.

02:04:55.625 --> 02:04:56.875
-Sharva!
-Hey!

02:04:57.250 --> 02:04:58.167
Hey!

02:04:59.000 --> 02:05:01.208
Are you trying to scare us?

02:05:02.250 --> 02:05:03.667
I witnessed your prowess.

02:05:04.417 --> 02:05:06.042
Also, I witnessed his might and valor.

02:05:06.208 --> 02:05:08.167
You can't do anything to him.

02:05:08.625 --> 02:05:09.833
Do you know why?

02:05:10.250 --> 02:05:12.875
All of you suffer from heart problems.

02:05:13.958 --> 02:05:16.042
-Heart problem?
-Yeah!

02:05:16.458 --> 02:05:19.792
If something happens to your sister,
you get hurt.

02:05:20.292 --> 02:05:23.750
If something happens to you,
your brother gets hurt.

02:05:24.292 --> 02:05:27.833
If something happens to your brother,
the entire family gets hurt.

02:05:28.292 --> 02:05:31.375
If you're so weak,
how do you expect to go against the Jailer?

02:05:32.708 --> 02:05:34.292
But do you know how he operates?

02:05:34.917 --> 02:05:36.625
If he makes up his mind...

02:05:37.208 --> 02:05:39.667
he won't even spare his own son.

02:05:39.958 --> 02:05:41.125
That being the case...

02:05:41.458 --> 02:05:44.625
you guys are Kalpak's children.

02:05:45.292 --> 02:05:47.625
You can't even imagine
what he'd do to you, people.

02:05:48.125 --> 02:05:50.417
He'll rip you all apart.

02:05:52.125 --> 02:05:56.292
Oh, no, Madam, another dose, is it?

02:05:57.000 --> 02:06:00.208
Did I still not give up the truth
you were looking for?

02:06:01.042 --> 02:06:03.250
[distant church bell gonging]

02:06:13.667 --> 02:06:17.625
Rithvik, dear, you wanted
to travel by ship, right?

02:06:17.750 --> 02:06:20.667
You, your grandma, and your mom
are traveling by ship for 15 days.

02:06:20.750 --> 02:06:22.750
I'll join you all after 15 days.

02:06:23.167 --> 02:06:26.125
No, Muthu, you come with us too.
We'll go together.

02:06:26.917 --> 02:06:28.667
Aren't Mom and Grandma with you?

02:06:28.750 --> 02:06:31.458
I have some work to finish.
I'll join you guys later.

02:06:32.292 --> 02:06:35.042
[villainous music]

02:06:44.292 --> 02:06:46.708
[villainous music continues]

02:06:51.458 --> 02:06:55.292
We lived all our lives in Goa,
yet we don't know about this place.

02:06:57.083 --> 02:06:59.458
-Vijaya...
-Are you sure you will join us?

02:06:59.875 --> 02:07:00.708
I will!

02:07:01.542 --> 02:07:04.625
However, if I don't make it,
use this card.

02:07:04.917 --> 02:07:08.167
If you call this number,
they'll arrange whatever you ask.

02:07:08.500 --> 02:07:10.417
Take care of Rithvik and Swetha.

02:07:11.208 --> 02:07:13.208
-You too, take care.
-I don't agree with you.

02:07:13.625 --> 02:07:14.750
You will join us too.

02:07:16.125 --> 02:07:18.083
You return and take good care of us.

02:07:20.250 --> 02:07:23.083
[villainous music continues]

02:07:28.333 --> 02:07:30.042
At least explain what's happening?

02:07:30.458 --> 02:07:31.750
I'm very scared.

02:07:33.125 --> 02:07:34.083
<i>Jailer, Sir!</i>

02:07:35.542 --> 02:07:36.417
Jailer, Sir!

02:07:37.875 --> 02:07:39.875
Sir, I know that you're inside.

02:07:40.125 --> 02:07:41.000
<i>Nothing much.</i>

02:07:41.167 --> 02:07:44.208
<i>I came to apologize in person</i>
<i>and compromise.</i>

02:07:45.083 --> 02:07:47.875
<i>I'm not lying.</i>
<i>Please trust me.</i>

02:07:48.417 --> 02:07:49.250
Open the door--

02:07:50.333 --> 02:07:52.667
[villainous music continues]

02:07:59.750 --> 02:08:03.250
I lived all my life in Goa, yet I wasn't
aware that such a place existed.

02:08:04.417 --> 02:08:06.833
A church on one side
and a school on the other side.

02:08:07.083 --> 02:08:10.042
A house in between that no one could find.

02:08:10.292 --> 02:08:11.250
Fantastic, Sir!

02:08:11.625 --> 02:08:12.792
Jailer, indeed!

02:08:13.792 --> 02:08:14.833
Let's go inside.

02:08:16.125 --> 02:08:18.208
[villainous music continues]

02:08:20.625 --> 02:08:21.625
Greetings, Madam.

02:08:23.458 --> 02:08:24.042
Hey!

02:08:26.208 --> 02:08:29.250
Sir, I've come
to sincerely apologize to you.

02:08:30.042 --> 02:08:31.375
Let's compromise once and for all.

02:08:31.750 --> 02:08:33.833
Let's drop everything.
I can't take it anymore.

02:08:34.000 --> 02:08:35.292
I swear I can't take it.

02:08:36.083 --> 02:08:38.875
You see, I can go against anyone
and keep doing this business.

02:08:38.958 --> 02:08:42.667
But I can't go against you
and continue doing this business.

02:08:42.750 --> 02:08:45.833
Because we don't know
how to intimidate you?

02:08:47.000 --> 02:08:49.708
Madam, your husband is a great man.

02:08:50.125 --> 02:08:52.750
Only recently did we learn a truth
about your husband.

02:08:53.583 --> 02:08:58.250
Once we learned the truth,
our entire family was shocked.

02:09:00.042 --> 02:09:02.750
Madam, I agree we do illegal business.

02:09:03.042 --> 02:09:03.667
It's wrong!

02:09:03.875 --> 02:09:05.833
But that's our business.

02:09:06.417 --> 02:09:10.167
We steal statues from different places
and make a living.

02:09:10.375 --> 02:09:12.667
Imagine if someone
tries to hinder our business...

02:09:12.792 --> 02:09:16.583
we threaten to kill their family
or themselves

02:09:16.708 --> 02:09:19.042
and we use that fear to run our business.

02:09:20.000 --> 02:09:23.292
Imagine a person who killed his own son.

02:09:24.542 --> 02:09:26.292
How do we even scare him?

02:09:29.917 --> 02:09:31.708
You killed your own son...

02:09:31.833 --> 02:09:33.583
we wouldn't matter at all.

02:09:35.917 --> 02:09:39.417
-So, we sought you out...
-Arjun?

02:09:39.708 --> 02:09:41.458
-...to compromise with you.
-Is he telling the truth?

02:09:42.125 --> 02:09:44.583
Madam, please discuss
your familial disputes later.

02:09:44.625 --> 02:09:46.083
First, let me take care of my matter.

02:09:46.250 --> 02:09:48.583
Sir, in Tamil Nadu...

02:09:48.917 --> 02:09:51.333
Fine, we won't do business in South India.

02:09:51.417 --> 02:09:53.208
We'll sell the statues in North India
and make a living.

02:09:53.333 --> 02:09:55.708
-Please permit us.
-Why do you say he killed our son?

02:09:57.250 --> 02:09:58.875
Do you even know
what you're talking about?

02:09:59.208 --> 02:10:01.833
-Patience, Madam--
-How dare you accuse him?

02:10:02.625 --> 02:10:04.292
-Get out!
-Madam...

02:10:04.500 --> 02:10:06.417
-I, too, didn't believe it...
-Stop talking and get out.

02:10:06.667 --> 02:10:07.875
I, too, didn't believe it.

02:10:08.083 --> 02:10:09.542
-I found it hard to believe--
-Shut up!

02:10:10.083 --> 02:10:12.167
-Then I visited where he killed him...
-Get out!

02:10:14.500 --> 02:10:16.542
and found this.
Then I believed he did it.

02:10:17.792 --> 02:10:20.458
[emotional music]

02:10:21.958 --> 02:10:22.958
[bullet plunging]

02:10:28.792 --> 02:10:29.792
Do you remember this?

02:10:31.958 --> 02:10:34.208
[emotional music continues]

02:10:43.750 --> 02:10:45.667
[suspenseful music]

02:10:47.750 --> 02:10:52.083
Madam, ask him why he
threw this away and why?

02:10:55.000 --> 02:10:55.958
Please ask him!

02:10:58.250 --> 02:10:58.875
Ask him!

02:11:01.250 --> 02:11:02.292
What is this?

02:11:03.958 --> 02:11:05.792
What did you do to him?

02:11:06.417 --> 02:11:08.167
-Tell her, Sir.
-Tell me.

02:11:08.958 --> 02:11:10.083
What did you do?

02:11:10.750 --> 02:11:12.750
-What happened?
-Answer her.

02:11:13.000 --> 02:11:15.208
-What did you do to Arjun?
-Answer her!

02:11:15.625 --> 02:11:16.667
Answer me!

02:11:17.208 --> 02:11:19.208
He won't budge so easily, Madam.
Wait a minute.

02:11:19.583 --> 02:11:21.208
Son, please come with me.

02:11:21.333 --> 02:11:22.875
Come here. Stand over here.

02:11:23.458 --> 02:11:25.167
Sharva, come this way.

02:11:27.125 --> 02:11:28.583
This is my brother.

02:11:29.750 --> 02:11:33.500
Your son, his father, her husband,

02:11:33.708 --> 02:11:34.875
this man here killed him.

02:11:35.333 --> 02:11:36.708
I swear on my brother.

02:11:36.875 --> 02:11:40.542
Why don't you ask him
to swear on his grandson?

02:11:40.833 --> 02:11:42.708
Swear on him, Sir. Do it, Sir.

02:11:43.208 --> 02:11:45.000
[emotional music continues]

02:11:45.375 --> 02:11:46.250
Do it!

02:11:47.792 --> 02:11:49.208
Swear on him!

02:11:52.500 --> 02:11:53.375
Do it, Sir!

02:11:55.667 --> 02:11:57.000
-Ask him to swear on him.
-Listen...

02:11:59.167 --> 02:12:00.458
Swear on him.

02:12:02.958 --> 02:12:04.292
Swear on him.

02:12:05.375 --> 02:12:06.792
Swear on him!

02:12:12.833 --> 02:12:14.083
He won't do it!

02:12:14.458 --> 02:12:15.500
He can't do it.

02:12:16.958 --> 02:12:19.167
[heart-wrenching music]

02:12:21.625 --> 02:12:22.292
See.

02:12:23.833 --> 02:12:24.500
That's the truth.

02:12:26.125 --> 02:12:28.667
[heart-wrenching music continues]

02:12:34.583 --> 02:12:36.042
You're amazing, Sir.

02:12:36.625 --> 02:12:38.125
You're simply great!

02:12:39.542 --> 02:12:40.875
You killed your son...

02:12:41.250 --> 02:12:43.833
But how did you hide it from your family?

02:12:44.333 --> 02:12:45.833
You're amazing, Sir.

02:12:46.083 --> 02:12:49.208
Damn, I've never met anyone
like you before.

02:12:49.292 --> 02:12:50.292
[chuckles]

02:12:52.917 --> 02:12:54.667
[clicks tongue]

02:12:55.875 --> 02:12:58.417
Be careful, dear.
You have a young boy at home.

02:12:58.750 --> 02:12:59.625
Be careful!

02:13:00.583 --> 02:13:02.833
We don't know what this man can do.

02:13:03.875 --> 02:13:05.750
Rithvik, come here.

02:13:08.292 --> 02:13:10.958
-Rithvik!
-Go to your mother.

02:13:13.750 --> 02:13:14.625
Take care.

02:13:17.250 --> 02:13:19.042
Sharva, let's go.

02:13:19.333 --> 02:13:21.208
Sir, one minute.

02:13:21.708 --> 02:13:22.500
Sister!

02:13:23.083 --> 02:13:24.500
Could you please do me a favor?

02:13:24.625 --> 02:13:26.083
What can I do for you, sister?

02:13:26.583 --> 02:13:28.250
Wherever he has buried my husband...

02:13:28.750 --> 02:13:29.958
I want to go there.

02:13:30.875 --> 02:13:32.792
One day he left the house...

02:13:33.833 --> 02:13:35.250
and never returned!

02:13:35.917 --> 02:13:39.458
But we never knew it was he
who killed him.

02:13:40.208 --> 02:13:41.875
I don't have the courage to ask him.

02:13:42.333 --> 02:13:46.375
Please ask him what he did with my husband.

02:13:47.000 --> 02:13:49.042
Please, wait, sister, I'll ask him...

02:13:50.083 --> 02:13:52.792
Sir, please answer her.

02:13:53.083 --> 02:13:55.625
Did you bury or cremate him?
Please give her closure.

02:14:00.125 --> 02:14:02.792
Sir, please answer her.
I feel bad for her.

02:14:03.292 --> 02:14:05.375
Hey, answer her, damn it!

02:14:07.333 --> 02:14:08.750
Where did you bury him?

02:14:11.458 --> 02:14:13.333
Sister, are you okay with it?

02:14:15.833 --> 02:14:17.500
[clicks tongue]

02:14:17.792 --> 02:14:19.208
What did you do with him?

02:14:19.833 --> 02:14:21.125
Mom, ask him not to beat him.

02:14:21.125 --> 02:14:21.792
Tell me!

02:14:21.917 --> 02:14:23.542
Mom, please stop him.

02:14:23.625 --> 02:14:26.542
-How could you kill your son?
-Mom... Mom, ask him not to beat him.

02:14:27.375 --> 02:14:28.667
Please ask him not to beat him.

02:14:31.792 --> 02:14:33.583
Mom, ask him not to beat him.

02:14:37.250 --> 02:14:39.542
Mom, please stop him.

02:14:39.583 --> 02:14:40.833
Ask him not to beat him.

02:14:41.250 --> 02:14:43.333
-[continuous blows]
-[emotional music continues]

02:14:44.333 --> 02:14:46.167
Mom, ask him not to beat him.

02:14:49.083 --> 02:14:51.208
Mom, please stop him.

02:14:52.750 --> 02:14:55.000
-[continuous blows]
-[emotional music continues]

02:15:01.708 --> 02:15:03.125
-Mom...
-Rithvik!

02:15:03.917 --> 02:15:05.458
He killed your father.

02:15:06.083 --> 02:15:07.333
He killed and buried your father.

02:15:08.083 --> 02:15:08.792
Understand!

02:15:09.458 --> 02:15:11.000
Hereafter, if you speak to him...

02:15:11.708 --> 02:15:14.083
Hey, tell them!

02:15:15.000 --> 02:15:17.375
[heart-wrenching music]

02:15:18.333 --> 02:15:19.792
[thuds]

02:15:26.583 --> 02:15:28.833
[heart-wrenching music continues]

02:15:33.125 --> 02:15:33.833
Hey!

02:15:34.167 --> 02:15:34.917
Muthu!

02:15:36.125 --> 02:15:38.375
Good morning, good evening.

02:15:39.458 --> 02:15:41.542
How dare you kidnap my father?

02:15:41.833 --> 02:15:43.833
He's the supreme <i>Chakri Kalpak</i>!

02:15:44.333 --> 02:15:47.292
I thought you collapsed my family.

02:15:47.708 --> 02:15:50.333
But you've ruined your family.

02:15:50.750 --> 02:15:52.208
Who the hell are you?

02:15:53.875 --> 02:15:55.292
Answer me!

02:15:56.000 --> 02:15:57.500
Answer me!

02:15:58.042 --> 02:15:59.167
-Answer, damn it!
-[tapping on door]

02:16:01.792 --> 02:16:03.125
Sharva, check who's at the door.

02:16:08.250 --> 02:16:09.458
[door opens]

02:16:11.000 --> 02:16:13.417
[gripping music]

02:16:21.708 --> 02:16:22.542
What is it, Sir?

02:16:22.958 --> 02:16:24.250
I received a complaint

02:16:24.458 --> 02:16:27.667
that a man has threatened and
locked up 3 people in this house.

02:16:28.500 --> 02:16:29.333
Is it so?

02:16:31.458 --> 02:16:34.417
-Who filed a complaint?
-I did!

02:16:36.833 --> 02:16:38.167
Please arrest him.

02:16:39.833 --> 02:16:42.625
[emotional music]

02:16:47.833 --> 02:16:51.500
Do you deserve to live
after killing your son?

02:16:59.792 --> 02:17:02.083
[heart-wrenching music]

02:17:15.292 --> 02:17:18.000
[heart-wrenching music continues]

02:17:36.083 --> 02:17:39.000
[heart-wrenching music continues]

02:17:55.625 --> 02:17:56.792
[music fades]

02:18:00.625 --> 02:18:03.083
Let go of me. Let go of my hand.

02:18:03.250 --> 02:18:05.083
-Let go of my hand.
-Sit down!

02:18:05.208 --> 02:18:07.917
-Let go of my hand!
-Oh, no, Rithvik!

02:18:08.083 --> 02:18:09.958
Oh, no! Let go of her!

02:18:10.167 --> 02:18:11.167
[slaps]

02:18:12.833 --> 02:18:14.042
Oh, no, Swetha!

02:18:14.333 --> 02:18:15.875
Let go of her!

02:18:16.792 --> 02:18:17.958
[gun fires]

02:18:18.042 --> 02:18:19.375
Oh, no! Oh!

02:18:20.958 --> 02:18:22.833
[villainous music]

02:18:23.250 --> 02:18:24.833
[winces]

02:18:33.042 --> 02:18:34.292
<i>If you want them to live...</i>

02:18:34.958 --> 02:18:38.458
return the statues that you stole from us.

02:18:42.833 --> 02:18:45.750
Only if I have my phone
can I do what they ask.

02:18:59.958 --> 02:19:02.125
[upbeat music]

02:19:03.875 --> 02:19:05.750
[machine cranking]

02:19:10.292 --> 02:19:11.458
[message tone]

02:19:16.917 --> 02:19:19.542
[upbeat music intensifies]

02:19:26.708 --> 02:19:27.958
[door whooshing]

02:19:33.083 --> 02:19:34.417
[wood whirring]

02:19:37.708 --> 02:19:38.542
[beeps]

02:19:42.208 --> 02:19:44.417
[phone ringing]

02:19:46.125 --> 02:19:48.542
<i>Girls! Get ready!</i>

02:19:51.792 --> 02:19:53.958
[car whooshing]

02:19:55.250 --> 02:19:57.792
[in Hindi] Hey, check who's out there?
Who drove so fast?

02:20:04.208 --> 02:20:06.333
[upbeat heroic music]

02:20:20.750 --> 02:20:22.583
[slams rapidly]

02:20:24.792 --> 02:20:27.208
[car revving]

02:20:32.458 --> 02:20:34.458
[machine whirring]

02:20:38.792 --> 02:20:40.917
[machine creaking]

02:20:44.625 --> 02:20:47.042
[upbeat heroic music]

02:20:59.833 --> 02:21:02.458
[upbeat heroic music continues]

02:21:14.708 --> 02:21:17.458
[upbeat heroic music continues]

02:21:22.208 --> 02:21:23.208
[door closes]

02:21:29.000 --> 02:21:31.250
[upbeat heroic music intensifies]

02:21:46.333 --> 02:21:47.625
[keys jingles]

02:21:49.167 --> 02:21:51.500
[upbeat heroic music continues]

02:21:55.833 --> 02:21:56.583
Thanks, Roddy!

02:21:57.083 --> 02:21:58.958
[in Hindi] You helped me 20 years ago.

02:21:59.583 --> 02:22:01.083
[in Tamil] You may have forgotten about it.

02:22:01.875 --> 02:22:03.292
But I can never forget it, Sir.

02:22:03.583 --> 02:22:05.208
[lock clinks]

02:22:09.292 --> 02:22:10.125
Anytime!

02:22:11.625 --> 02:22:12.667
Anything for you, Sir.

02:22:16.274 --> 02:22:18.899
[upbeat heroic music continues]

02:22:28.917 --> 02:22:32.042
[upbeat heroic music continues]

02:22:34.292 --> 02:22:35.875
[gun whirling]

02:22:36.375 --> 02:22:37.500
[in Hindi] Hey, help, Sir.

02:22:39.417 --> 02:22:41.917
[continuous gunfire]

02:22:44.417 --> 02:22:46.292
[car rams]

02:22:48.167 --> 02:22:49.875
[mooing]

02:22:51.458 --> 02:22:53.750
Hey, I don't know anything else.

02:22:54.125 --> 02:22:58.333
You should've only
confessed the truth about him.

02:22:58.583 --> 02:23:00.833
Why did you get us all caught?

02:23:01.042 --> 02:23:02.167
Don't worry.

02:23:02.750 --> 02:23:03.958
Jailer will arrive soon!

02:23:04.042 --> 02:23:06.208
To carry our dead bodies?

02:23:13.667 --> 02:23:16.042
[footsteps approaching]

02:23:27.125 --> 02:23:27.875
Sit down.

02:23:31.625 --> 02:23:35.833
This Varman diverted a missile
going elsewhere...

02:23:36.083 --> 02:23:37.708
into our family.

02:23:38.250 --> 02:23:42.500
But you tried to destroy a pyramid
that took years to build.

02:23:42.917 --> 02:23:44.917
I won't forgive you.

02:23:45.917 --> 02:23:48.542
Still, we must learn something from him.

02:23:48.917 --> 02:23:51.500
After his family found out
that he killed his own son...

02:23:51.792 --> 02:23:55.708
his family disowned him and
didn't care if he lived or died.

02:23:56.750 --> 02:24:00.292
He could've exposed his son
that he's a bad person,

02:24:00.417 --> 02:24:02.125
also he tried to kill his father.

02:24:02.417 --> 02:24:05.292
Had he been alive,
he would've killed the family too.

02:24:05.500 --> 02:24:07.625
He could've told the truth about his son
to his family.

02:24:07.792 --> 02:24:09.708
But he did not tell them.
But why?

02:24:10.375 --> 02:24:12.667
If the world comes to know
that his son is a bad person...

02:24:12.792 --> 02:24:16.792
...his wife, daughter-in-law
and his son will feel bad about it.

02:24:17.042 --> 02:24:20.458
He hid the truth and maintained
the good impression about his son

02:24:20.667 --> 02:24:24.250
took all the blame
and is sitting out here silently.

02:24:24.958 --> 02:24:30.208
How far would you go to sacrifice
for your family...

02:24:30.500 --> 02:24:32.125
is what we should learn from him.

02:24:33.000 --> 02:24:34.708
Why didn't you tell me before?

02:24:36.500 --> 02:24:40.583
I didn't know
if you people could handle the truth.

02:24:42.250 --> 02:24:45.125
[soft heart-wrenching music]

02:24:48.708 --> 02:24:50.667
[cries]

02:24:53.250 --> 02:24:57.042
You took a huge risk to save your family.

02:24:57.208 --> 02:25:00.292
I'm going to use your family to kill you.

02:25:00.583 --> 02:25:02.042
Do you get what I'm saying?

02:25:02.333 --> 02:25:03.750
[villainous music]

02:25:04.125 --> 02:25:07.833
Your family found out
that you killed your son.

02:25:08.000 --> 02:25:10.500
So, you killed your family, too.

02:25:10.625 --> 02:25:13.042
I will pin the blame on you.

02:25:13.167 --> 02:25:20.250
I will make you a prisoner
in the same prison you were a Jailer.

02:25:21.167 --> 02:25:22.375
And kill you!

02:25:23.250 --> 02:25:24.833
Shall we proceed in height order?

02:25:26.667 --> 02:25:27.667
Anokha!

02:25:28.458 --> 02:25:30.250
No! Please, please, please!

02:25:30.292 --> 02:25:32.625
Please spare him.
Please spare him.

02:25:33.292 --> 02:25:34.625
Oh, no! Rithvik!

02:25:34.958 --> 02:25:36.292
Please spare my child.

02:25:37.250 --> 02:25:38.375
Please spare him.

02:25:39.250 --> 02:25:39.750
Hey!

02:25:40.958 --> 02:25:41.833
Muthu!

02:25:42.750 --> 02:25:44.500
[door whirring]

02:25:49.083 --> 02:25:51.750
-[muffled yelling]
-[gripping music]

02:25:58.792 --> 02:26:00.667
[gripping music continues]

02:26:03.833 --> 02:26:05.375
It's hurting, Mom!

02:26:06.917 --> 02:26:07.917
Give it to him.

02:26:10.833 --> 02:26:15.958
<i>♪ Your name... ♪</i>

02:26:16.250 --> 02:26:20.917
<i>♪ Your name... ♪</i>

02:26:21.208 --> 02:26:26.208
<i>♪ Your name... ♪</i>

02:26:27.083 --> 02:26:31.833
<i>♪ Your name... ♪</i>

02:26:33.292 --> 02:26:35.625
[winces]

02:26:39.292 --> 02:26:42.167
You keep asking why I killed Varman.

02:26:44.083 --> 02:26:46.042
He made the same mistake!

02:26:47.792 --> 02:26:49.875
Of keeping my grandson
on the edge of a knife.

02:26:50.333 --> 02:26:51.583
Bad move!

02:26:52.417 --> 02:26:53.917
[bones cracking]

02:26:54.750 --> 02:26:59.625
As you wanted to learn how far
someone could sacrifice for their family...

02:26:59.958 --> 02:27:01.542
that's my good habit.

02:27:03.375 --> 02:27:07.417
But you're unaware of my bad habit.

02:27:08.833 --> 02:27:15.750
If I had to kill one person to save
my family from evil people like you...

02:27:17.917 --> 02:27:19.708
[sharp blows land]

02:27:21.000 --> 02:27:23.500
I don't mind killing one, but many.

02:27:24.333 --> 02:27:25.667
[slashes]

02:27:25.917 --> 02:27:31.167
<i>♪ Even today and forever ♪</i>

02:27:31.417 --> 02:27:35.417
<i>♪ He reigns as the Thalaivar ♪</i>

02:27:39.167 --> 02:27:40.958
[continuous gunfire]

02:27:41.708 --> 02:27:42.375
Ved!

02:27:43.625 --> 02:27:44.250
Ved!

02:27:44.958 --> 02:27:47.042
[continuous gunfire]

02:27:47.792 --> 02:27:48.792
[thuds]

02:27:49.000 --> 02:27:52.292
[continuous gunfire]

02:27:53.667 --> 02:27:56.000
[upbeat music]

02:27:58.667 --> 02:28:00.500
[in Hindi] Bodhi, kill them all!

02:28:01.958 --> 02:28:04.500
[continuous gunfire]

02:28:08.417 --> 02:28:12.375
[kicks, slams]

02:28:16.250 --> 02:28:17.250
[gun fires]

02:28:23.250 --> 02:28:24.542
[blood spurting out]

02:28:25.125 --> 02:28:27.292
[continuous slashing]

02:28:27.625 --> 02:28:28.667
[gun fires]

02:28:34.208 --> 02:28:36.292
[upbeat music continues]

02:28:40.750 --> 02:28:42.042
[gun fires]

02:28:44.000 --> 02:28:45.208
[stabs]

02:28:45.375 --> 02:28:46.375
[gun fires]

02:28:49.292 --> 02:28:51.625
[thrilling music]

02:28:53.458 --> 02:28:55.000
[loads gum, fires]

02:29:01.958 --> 02:29:03.292
[gun fires]

02:29:04.958 --> 02:29:07.167
[upbeat music continues]

02:29:15.125 --> 02:29:16.542
I'll kill you, damn it!

02:29:18.750 --> 02:29:20.500
-[smacks]
-[kicks]

02:29:21.958 --> 02:29:22.667
Hey!

02:29:25.417 --> 02:29:27.292
You saved your family.

02:29:27.667 --> 02:29:29.083
How about your friend?

02:29:32.458 --> 02:29:34.917
[villainous music]

02:29:36.917 --> 02:29:39.958
<i>Hey, kill his friend</i>
<i>and anyone you find out there.</i>

02:29:39.958 --> 02:29:41.750
[in Hindi] Sir, no one's out here.
The room is empty.

02:29:41.875 --> 02:29:43.875
No one's out there, you say?

02:29:44.125 --> 02:29:47.042
When the man who beat and dragged
his family here is right here...

02:29:47.167 --> 02:29:48.333
where do you think he would be?

02:29:48.500 --> 02:29:49.833
He, too, is right here.

02:29:51.250 --> 02:29:53.250
<i>♪ He’s witnessed your dirty game ♪</i>

02:29:53.375 --> 02:29:55.667
<i>♪ He's familiar with your father's game ♪</i>

02:29:55.917 --> 02:29:59.875
<i>♪ Oh… he’s the one</i>
<i>Who makes generations dance to his tune! ♪</i>

02:30:00.000 --> 02:30:03.000
<i>♪ A few may try to tarnish his name ♪</i>

02:30:03.083 --> 02:30:05.250
<i>♪ A hundred may try to snatch his crown ♪</i>

02:30:05.417 --> 02:30:07.667
<i>♪ Look over that wall... ♪</i>

02:30:09.833 --> 02:30:11.750
[upbeat heroic music]

02:30:12.875 --> 02:30:14.333
[gun fires]

02:30:15.250 --> 02:30:16.417
Sharva!

02:30:19.000 --> 02:30:21.625
[upbeat heroic music continues]

02:30:28.583 --> 02:30:30.333
[continuous slashing]

02:30:30.875 --> 02:30:32.458
<i>♪ Do you get it now, Dear? ♪</i>

02:30:36.083 --> 02:30:36.792
[in Hindi] Enough!

02:30:38.875 --> 02:30:39.792
Enough.

02:30:40.542 --> 02:30:44.292
Jailer, spare both my children.

02:30:44.708 --> 02:30:46.500
I will give you back everything.

02:30:46.625 --> 02:30:47.458
Dad, don't do it.

02:30:49.750 --> 02:30:51.542
Take good care of Kantha.

02:30:52.583 --> 02:30:55.167
[wheelchair whirring]

02:31:02.375 --> 02:31:03.708
Wherever I am...

02:31:04.583 --> 02:31:06.792
I'll always be thinking of you.

02:31:07.042 --> 02:31:07.750
Dad!

02:31:20.833 --> 02:31:25.667
Jailer, finally,
Chakri Kalpak family has surrendered.

02:31:27.583 --> 02:31:29.125
You won!

02:31:30.000 --> 02:31:32.250
We're all under your feet now!

02:31:32.542 --> 02:31:37.167
I will hand over all our secret
documents and contacts to you.

02:31:37.958 --> 02:31:40.792
And end our chapter for good.

02:31:41.958 --> 02:31:43.542
But, unfortunately...

02:31:43.667 --> 02:31:44.625
[buttons beeping]

02:31:44.667 --> 02:31:46.167
it's not going to happen.

02:31:46.750 --> 02:31:47.708
Jailer...

02:31:48.250 --> 02:31:50.542
-[beeping continuously]
-[cackling]

02:31:52.000 --> 02:31:53.333
-Oh, no!
-Dad, don't do it!

02:31:53.917 --> 02:31:55.833
[loud explosion]

02:31:58.083 --> 02:32:00.000
[machine beeping, whirring]

02:32:04.167 --> 02:32:06.917
[gripping music]

02:32:15.583 --> 02:32:18.250
[in Hindi] Hey, idiot, get in
and start the engine.

02:32:21.417 --> 02:32:23.125
[door closes]

02:32:24.542 --> 02:32:26.792
[jet screeching]

02:32:37.208 --> 02:32:39.750
[theme music]

02:32:53.917 --> 02:32:55.667
Come on! Go!

02:32:58.667 --> 02:33:00.083
[music fades]

02:33:00.708 --> 02:33:02.750
[car revving]

02:33:09.375 --> 02:33:12.292
<i>♪ Boom! Is the Parai roar</i>
<i>Tearing through your ears? ♪</i>

02:33:12.583 --> 02:33:14.958
<i>♪ Is it tearing the earth apart</i>
<i>Like thunder? ♪</i>

02:33:16.250 --> 02:33:18.042
[car revving]

02:33:18.917 --> 02:33:21.500
<i>♪ He turned their hatred into fuel</i>
<i>And grew like a fire-fed flame ♪</i>

02:33:21.583 --> 02:33:22.333
<i>♪ Mass redefined ♪</i>

02:33:22.417 --> 02:33:24.042
<i>♪ That’s Thalaivar's unique biology ♪</i>

02:33:24.083 --> 02:33:27.417
<i>♪ He razed every gate of oppression</i>
<i>And rose stronger ♪</i>

02:33:27.667 --> 02:33:29.458
<i>♪ A FRAME THAT ROARS THROUGH THE AGES! ♪</i>

02:33:29.500 --> 02:33:32.125
<i>♪ Hey, Peak Aura</i>
<i>Being farmed ♪</i>

02:33:32.167 --> 02:33:33.417
<i>♪ He's the Single Apex predator! ♪</i>

02:33:33.500 --> 02:33:35.417
<i>♪ What enemy can stand</i>
<i>Against his wrath? ♪</i>

02:33:35.458 --> 02:33:38.000
<i>♪ Unstoppable</i>
<i>Unbreakable ♪</i>

02:33:38.042 --> 02:33:39.667
<i>♪ Thalaivar Forever ♪</i>

02:33:39.750 --> 02:33:40.917
<i>♪ MVP... ♪</i>

02:33:42.250 --> 02:33:44.667
<i>♪ One name to rule the game ♪</i>

02:33:47.375 --> 02:33:49.917
<i>♪ He's got the fire</i>
<i>Got the flame ♪</i>

02:33:50.333 --> 02:33:52.500
[fire blazing]

02:33:54.083 --> 02:33:56.333
[car revving]

02:34:03.000 --> 02:34:05.417
-[slams]
-[skids]

02:34:10.292 --> 02:34:12.750
[jet scraping]

02:34:19.917 --> 02:34:22.333
[metal scraping]

02:34:28.083 --> 02:34:30.375
[dramatic music]

02:34:30.958 --> 02:34:32.708
[fumes blazing]

02:34:35.708 --> 02:34:37.958
[footsteps approaching]

02:34:42.542 --> 02:34:44.167
How did you escape?

02:34:45.500 --> 02:34:48.333
I thought I could intimidate you.

02:34:49.000 --> 02:34:50.542
Kill you with a bomb.

02:34:51.250 --> 02:34:53.583
Or send you to prison...
I planned many things...

02:34:54.292 --> 02:34:57.500
But you dodged every bloody thing.

02:34:57.667 --> 02:35:00.125
How do you even survive everything?

02:35:00.708 --> 02:35:02.500
It's wrong. Wrong! Wrong!

02:35:02.625 --> 02:35:05.333
-I wonder what mistake I made--
-Don't sweat it!

02:35:07.250 --> 02:35:11.208
Don't confuse yourself by belittling.

02:35:11.667 --> 02:35:14.083
Because you didn't do anything wrong.

02:35:14.333 --> 02:35:15.625
You did everything right.

02:35:16.292 --> 02:35:18.250
But you went up against the wrong person.

02:35:19.917 --> 02:35:22.250
[upbeat heroic theme]

02:35:25.792 --> 02:35:27.125
You see, Kalpak...

02:35:28.208 --> 02:35:32.958
for 50 years, many tried
in many ways to destroy me.

02:35:35.417 --> 02:35:36.417
[sniffs]

02:35:37.000 --> 02:35:38.000
However...

02:35:38.667 --> 02:35:40.958
<i>♪ He’s witnessed your dirty game ♪</i>

02:35:41.250 --> 02:35:43.583
<i>♪ One name to rule the game ♪</i>

02:35:43.750 --> 02:35:46.125
<i>♪ He's familiar with your father's game ♪</i>

02:35:46.333 --> 02:35:48.833
<i>♪ He's got the fire</i>
<i>Got the flame ♪</i>

02:35:49.125 --> 02:35:51.417
<i>♪ Oh… he’s the one</i>
<i>Who makes generations... ♪</i>

02:35:51.792 --> 02:35:54.083
<i>♪ One name to rule the game ♪</i>

02:35:54.375 --> 02:35:56.542
<i>♪ ...dance to his tune! ♪</i>

02:35:56.833 --> 02:35:59.250
<i>♪ He's got the fire</i>
<i>Got the flame ♪</i>

02:36:01.292 --> 02:36:03.708
[upbeat heroic theme continues]

02:36:09.542 --> 02:36:11.708
[puffs out]

02:36:15.708 --> 02:36:16.708
[kicks]

02:36:16.958 --> 02:36:17.958
[loud thuds]

02:36:35.208 --> 02:36:37.458
[rockets whooshes]
[loud explosion]

02:36:41.375 --> 02:36:43.875
[theme music]

02:36:56.750 --> 02:36:57.542
<i>♪ Hukkum! ♪</i>

02:36:58.667 --> 02:36:59.583
<i>♪ Tiger Ka Hukkum! ♪</i>

02:36:59.625 --> 02:37:01.417
<i>♪ Watch Thalaivar unleash the chaos! ♪</i>

02:37:01.542 --> 02:37:03.833
<i>♪ It’s a whole different game</i>
<i>Once Thalaivar arrives! ♪</i>

02:37:03.917 --> 02:37:06.167
<i>♪ Know the situation</i>
<i>Sit down, mate ♪</i>

02:37:06.333 --> 02:37:08.583
<i>♪ Thalaivar will forever be the Superstar ♪</i>

02:37:08.667 --> 02:37:10.917
<i>♪ He is known to bend the rules ♪</i>

02:37:11.000 --> 02:37:13.250
<i>♪ He is liked by all generations ♪</i>

02:37:13.375 --> 02:37:15.583
<i>♪ He is loved by the common man ♪</i>

02:37:15.708 --> 02:37:18.083
<i>♪ He is fit to wear the crown ♪</i>

02:37:18.625 --> 02:37:20.708
<i>♪ He’s witnessed your dirty game ♪</i>

02:37:20.958 --> 02:37:22.917
<i>♪ He's familiar with your father's game ♪</i>

02:37:23.333 --> 02:37:27.333
<i>♪ Oh… he’s the one</i>
<i>Who makes generations dance to his tune! ♪</i>

02:37:27.417 --> 02:37:30.208
<i>♪ A few may try to tarnish his name ♪</i>

02:37:30.375 --> 02:37:32.625
<i>♪ A hundred may try to snatch his crown ♪</i>

02:37:32.833 --> 02:37:35.042
<i>♪ Look over that wall ♪</i>

02:37:35.208 --> 02:37:37.667
<i>♪ millions will rise to show their love! ♪</i>

02:37:38.208 --> 02:37:42.042
TWO WEEKS LATER

02:37:42.929 --> 02:37:45.429
[water gushing]

02:37:47.250 --> 02:37:50.917
He confessed to shooting his son
and dumping his body in this river.

02:37:51.208 --> 02:37:52.208
[camera clicks]

02:37:58.167 --> 02:37:59.708
Please stay with us.

02:38:00.750 --> 02:38:01.917
Please listen to me.

02:38:03.542 --> 02:38:05.167
Why are you surrendering yourself?

02:38:06.458 --> 02:38:08.375
Let what’s done remain done.

02:38:09.667 --> 02:38:11.125
Let's move on in life.

02:38:15.042 --> 02:38:17.500
We're done with the procedures.
Let's go.

02:38:24.208 --> 02:38:26.500
[emotional music]

02:38:36.333 --> 02:38:38.958
[emotional music continues]

02:38:48.625 --> 02:38:51.958
[heart-wrenching music]

02:39:09.500 --> 02:39:12.542
[heart-wrenching music continues]

02:39:20.375 --> 02:39:22.208
Hey, give Sir his phone back.

02:39:22.333 --> 02:39:23.792
Please check your message.

02:39:31.250 --> 02:39:33.667
[wheelchair whirring]

02:39:37.625 --> 02:39:40.042
[villainous music]

02:39:51.583 --> 02:39:54.125
[villainous music continues]

02:40:07.250 --> 02:40:08.542
Reply to the message, Sir.

02:40:10.417 --> 02:40:12.000
Or else Kantha will be offended.

02:40:13.375 --> 02:40:15.458
[suspenseful music]

02:40:18.167 --> 02:40:19.042
Shall we leave?

02:40:21.292 --> 02:40:24.000
[upbeat theme music]

